<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Sefwi New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">ASOMAFOƐ NYUMAA</para>
  <para style="toc3">Aso</para>
  <para style="toc2">Asomafoɛ Nyumaa</para>
  <para style="toc1">ASOMAFOƐ NYUMAA</para>
  <para style="mt1">ASOMAFOƐ NYUMAA</para>
  <para style="ip">Nekaa bɔ Luka Nzɛmba ne si ne, ɛberɛ ala yeɛ Asomafoɛ Nyumaa ne toa so ɔ. Na ɛhene de, ɔhworɔle ye wɔ Roman kɔyɛ afoɛ 61 Y.A. <note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Y.A kyire Yesu Aberɛ so (Brɔfo: </char><char style="it">Common Era</char> anaa <char style="it">C.E</char>)</note> Sɔ mmerɛ ne, né Paul la prizin. Dumaa Asomafoɛ Nyumaa ne, okyire nningyein anaa adwuma bɔ asomafoɛ nemɔ yɛle ɔ. Yeti adwuma bɔ asomafoɛ ne yɛle fi afoɛ 33 kodwu kɔyɛ 61 Y.A ne, yeɛ Luka hane ye nwo dwirɛ wɔ sɔ nwomaa he anu ɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Asomafoɛ Nyumaa ne ti 1 bɔ ɔkwaadwu ye ti 12 ne ka nningyein bɔ somafoɛ Petro yɛle, yeɛ yeti 13 bɔ ɔkwaadwu 28 ne ka nningyein bɔ Somafoɛ Paul yɛle ɔ. Né Luka taa ne Paul tu atee, yeti ɔfale ye nye nwuni bɔ ɔhɔle so nanu pee. Luka hworɔle Asomafoɛ Nyumaa ne mane Teofilus, né ɔpena kyɛ onwu bɔ ɔhɔle so wɔ Yesu tingyelɛ ne si, ɔne mmerɛ bɔ Kristosom hyɛle yebo ne.</para>
  <para style="ip">Asomafoɛ Nyumaa ne maa yɛnwu kyɛbɔ tete Kristofoɛ asafo ne hyɛle yebo, na onyane ngɔsoɛ ndɛ-ndɛ ne. Ɔka kyɛbɔ honhom krongron wale asuafoɛ naso, ná ɔmaa benyane anwoserɛ bɛhane nzɛmba ne bɛhyirele Yudafoɛ ne maen-maen nanufoɛ ne. Nningyein bɔ osisile wɔ Asomafoɛ Nyumaa nanu ne hyɛle yebo mmerɛ bɔ Yesu hɔle anwuro wɔ afoɛ 33 yɛ aberɛ so nu, oodwuli kɔyɛ afoɛ 61 yɛ aberɛ so. Sɔ mmerɛ ne, né baha Paul bawura ye bɔbɔ ye awuro, ná ne ɔnwondɛ kyɛ Kaesare koli ye dwirɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Asomafoɛ Nyumaa ne yeɛ ɔmaa yɛnwu kyɛ, Antiokia yeɛ bɛli moa bɛfrɛle asuafoɛ nemɔ Kristofoɛ ɔ. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 11:26">Aso 11:26</ref> </char>) Luka hworɔle ye nzɛmba ne mane Teofilus, na ye ala yeɛ ɔhworɔle Asomafoɛ Nyumaa ne koso mane ye ɔ.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">ENU DWIRƐ</para>
  <para style="io1">Bɛsiesiele bɛ nwo bɛmane nzɛmba ne (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:1-8">1:1-8</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mmerɛ bɔ Yesu hɔle anwuro, oodwuli kyɛ honhom krongron wale bɛ so Pentekoste afoɛ 33 yɛ aberɛ so (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:9-2:13">1:9–2:13</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Adanzeɛ bɔ bɛlili ye wɔ Yerusalem (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 2:14-3:26">2:14–3:26</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bɛlili adanzeɛ ɔmva ye nwo kyɛ ne bɛtane bɛ nye ne (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 4:1-5:42">4:1–5:42</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɔttemaye kyɛ yɛkɔ yakyi Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne berɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 6:1-7:1">6:1–7:1</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Steven wɔ Sanhendrin ne nyunu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 7:2-60">7:2-60</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bɛlili adanzeɛ bɛhɔle Samaria ne ye si dɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 8:1-40">8:1-40</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Saul sakrale (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 9:1-43">9:1-43</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bɛhane nzɛmba ne bɛhyirele maen-maen nanufoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Kaesarea ne Antiokia (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 10:1-12:25">10:1–12:25</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Paul nzɛmbatrɛ akwanduo bɔ oli moa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13:1-14:28">13:1–14:28</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mbanyi ne yiale nu wɔ Yerusalem wɔ toa pɛlɛ nanwo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 15:1-35">15:1-35</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Paul nzɛmbatrɛ akwanduo bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 15:36-18:22">15:36–18:22</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Paul nzɛmbatrɛ akwanduo bɔ ɔtɔ so nza (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 18:23-21:17">18:23–21:17</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bɛhyele Paul bɛtole prizin wɔ Yerusalem (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 21:18-23:35">21:18–23:35</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bɛfale Paul bɛhɔle Kaesarea (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 24:1-26:32">24:1–26:32</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Atee bɔ Paul pɛ hɔle Roman (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 27:1-28:16">27:1–28:16</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Paul wɔ Roman (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 28:17-31">28:17-31</ref> </char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Teofilus, edwirɛ bɔ nni moa ndworɔ mmerɛle wɔ ne, ngane nningyein bɔ Yesu hyɛle yebo yɛle, ɔne nikye biala bɔ ohyirele <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />tonn oodwuli kyẽa bɔ bɛfale ye bɛhɔle anwuro ne. Ná kora bɔ ɔkɔ anwuro ne, ɔnate honhom krongron so mane asomafoɛ bɔ waye bɛ ne akwankyerɛ. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Amaneɛ bɔ onwuni ye ne si ne, ɔnate adanzeɛ pee bɔ odi mu so maa bɛnwuni kyɛ, amba, ɔte ase. Ngyẽa 40 nanu ne, ɔyele ye nwo ali hyirele bɛ, na ɔhane Nyameɛ Ahennie nanwo dwirɛ. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Mmerɛ bɔ oyiale bɛ ne, ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nnɛmɔ fi Yerusalem, ɛmɔ nwondɛ Baba ne bɔhyɛ bɔ ngane ye nwo dwirɛ ngyirele ɛmɔ ne; <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />ofikyɛ nzue yeɛ né Yohane fa bɔ asu ɔ, nakoso ɛmɔ de, ɔngɔhyɛ biala bɛkɔfa honhom krongron bɛkɔbɔ ɛmɔ asu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Yeti beyiale ye ne, bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Awurade, sɔ mmerɛ he ala yeɛ ɛfa Ahennie ne sie berɛ ma Israel anaa?” <verse eid="ACT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Mmerɛ ne ngyẽa bɔ Baba ne afa ye tumi ahyɛ ne de, ye nwo nhia kyɛ ɛmɔnwu ye. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Mmom sɛ honhom krongron ne ba ɛmɔ so a, ɛmɔ konya tumi, na ɛmɔ kɔyɛ m'adanzefoɛ wɔ Yerusalem, Yudea, ne Samaria mukoraati koodwu aseɛ ne noa dɔ paa.” <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Ɔhane ɛhemɔ yiele ne, bɛfale ye bɛhɔle anwuro, na bɛguso bɛnea anwuro ne, munungum katale ye nwo bɔ bannwu ye kõ. <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Ɔkɔ ne, né bɛnea anwuro haa, na ɛberɛ ala, mmrienzua nyɔ bɔ bɛwura ndadeɛ fufue wale bɛ nwo berɛ, <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />na bɛha bɛhyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Galilea mmrandeɛ, nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔgyi wa, bɔ ɛmɔnea anwuro sɔ ne? Yesu bɔ bafa ye bafi ɛmɔ nwo wa bahɔ anwuro ne, kyɛbɔ ɛmɔ nwuni ye kyɛ ɔkɔ ne, sɔ ala yeɛ okosa kɔwa ɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Na bɛfili bokaa bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Olive naso bɛhɔle Yerusalem. Né ɛberɛ pingye Yerusalem; efi berɛ ɛkɔ Yerusalem a, né ɔte homeda atee.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ebia ɔkɔyɛ kilomita kõ. </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Bɛdwuli berɛ ne, bɛhɔle aborosaen bɔ bɛte nu nanu. Petro, Yohane, Yakobo, Andrea, Filipo, Tomas, Bartolomeo, Mateo, Alfeo awa Yakobo, Simon bɔ ɔbɔ ye nwo mmɔden ne, ɔne Yakobo awa Yuda yeɛ né bɛwɔ berɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Bɛ mukoraati bɛyɛle adwene kõ bɛbɔle mbaeɛ daa, bɛ ne mmrasua nemɔ ne Yesu maame Mary, né Yesu aliemaa nemɔ koso wɔ berɛ.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Sɔ ngyẽa nanu ne, Petro dwɔso gyinane aliemaa nemɔ nu (mmenia kɔyɛ 120 yeɛ ne bɛwɔ berɛ ɔ) na ɔhane kyɛ: <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />“Nniema mɔ, ngɔm bɔ honhom krongron ne nate David so hyɛ fale Yuda nwo ne, né odikyɛ sɔ tworɔnzɛm ne ba nu. Sɔ Yuda ne yeɛ olili mmenia nemɔ nyunu maa bɛɛhyele Yesu ne. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Né ɔboka yɛ so, na ɔyɛle sɔ adwuma he bie. <verse eid="ACT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />(Sɔ biaa he fale akatua bɔ onya fili ye amumuyɛɛ nanu ne tɔle aseɛ. Na mmerɛ bɔ ye kɔme wɔle berɛ ne, ye nu pakyele maa ye nyaa mukoraati turu guale. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Bɛ bɔ bɛte Yerusalem namukoraati tele ye nwo dwirɛ, yeti bɛ dwudwolɛ nu ne, bɛfrɛle sɔ aseɛ ne <char style="tl">Akeldama</char>, bɔ yebo kyire kyɛ, ‘Mogya Aseɛ.’) <verse eid="ACT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Ofikyɛ, bahworɔ ye wɔ Edwein nwomaa nanu kyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Ma nekaa bɔ ɔte ne yɛ dandue,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">nnɛmaa ebiala tena berɛ,’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">na</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Ye dibea ne koso, ma ebie fa.’<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Yeti, mmrienzua bɔ ne bɛli yɛ si, mmerɛ bɔ ne yɛne Awurade Yesu di akɔ-ne-aba, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />fi mmerɛ bɔ Yohane bɔle ye asu, ɔbaadwu kyẽa bɔ bɛfale ye bɛfili yɛ nwo wa bɛhɔle anwuro ne, odikyɛ bɛ nu kõ baboka yɛ so, na ɔne yɛ yɛ ye tingyelɛ nanwo adanzefoɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Yeti, bɛyele mmenia nyɔ, Yosef bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Barsaba, bɔ besa bɛfrɛ ye Yusto ne, ɔne Matias. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Na bɛbɔle mbaeɛ kyɛ: “O Awurade, wɔ bɔ ɛse ebiala ahone nu, mmrienzua nyɔ hemɔ, maa yɛnwu bɛ nu kõ bɔ aye ye <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />kyɛ oosi Yuda gya nu, na ɔfa ɔsom ne asomafoɛ adwuma bɔ ɔpole, na ɔɔyɛle bɔ okuro ne.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Yeti, bɛtɔɔsole ne,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bɛbɔle ndondo ne.”</char></note> ɔyele Matias, yeti, bɛfale ye bɛ bokale asomafoɛ 11 naso.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Na kyẽa bɔ ne bɛdi Pentekoste Afahyɛ ne, né bɛ mukoraati bayia nu wɔ neka-horɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Komapɛ, dede bie fili anwuro wale, né dede ne te kyɛ mvrama bɔ ye noa yɛ se paa, ná ɔgyegyele awuro berɛ mukoraati. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Na bɛnwuni see bɔ wayɛ kyɛ temverema, kyɛ wayeye ngoko-ngoko waagyina bɛ nu biala ti afia. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Na honhom krongron ne yili bɛ nu biala tɛkyɛ, na bɛhyɛle yebo kyɛ bɛka dwudwolɛ foforɛ, kyɛbɔ honhom ne fa mane bɛ kyɛ bɛha ne.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, né Yudafoɛ bɔ bɛmva bɛ som benni angorɛ, bɔ bɛfi aseɛ he aso nekaa biala awa Yerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Yeti mmerɛ bɔ dede ne wale ne, mmeni lɔen he amukoraati wale berɛ, na bɔ ne ɔkɔ so ne maa bɛ nwo dwirili bɛ, ofikyɛ bɛ nu biala tele kyɛ bɛka ye kuro dwudwolɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Nahorɛ nu, bɛ nwo dwirili bɛ paa, na bɛhane kyɛ: “Bɛ bɔ bɛdwudwo ne, aso bɛ mukoraati bɛtte Galileafoɛ? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Ye de, ɔwale ye sɛ, yeɛ yɛ nu biala te ye bɔbɔ ye kuro dwudwolɛ ne?<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Dwudwolɛ bɔ bɛfa bɛpɛle ye kotoa ne.”</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Partifoɛ, Mediafoɛ, Elamfoɛ ne bɛ bɔ bɛtete Mesopotamia, Yudea, Kapadokia, Ponto, ne Asia, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />Frigia ne Pamfilia, Egypt ne Libia maen ne nekaa bɔ opingye Kirene, ne ɛwɔfoɛ bɔ bɛfi Roman, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />Yudafoɛ ne bɛ bɔ basakra baayɛ Yudafoɛ, Kretafoɛ ne Arabfoɛ, yɛte kyɛ bɛfa yɛ bɔbɔ yɛ kuro dwudwolɛ bɛka Nyameɛ nningyein bɔ ɔyɛ nwanwa nanwo dwirɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Bɛ nwo dwirili bɛ paa, na né wabɔ bɛ pusa; ná ne bɛ bisa bɛ nwo kyɛ: “Nzu yeɛ ɔkɔ so ne?” <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Nakoso ebiemɔ gorole bɛ nwo kyɛ: “Nzãa fɛɛ-fɛɛ yeɛ wabo bɛ ne.”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Ná Petro ne buru-ne-kõ ne dwɔso gyinane, na ɔfale konviɛ bɔ enu la berɛ hane kyɛ: “Yudea mmrienzua ne ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔte Yerusalem mukoraati, mepena kyɛ ɛmɔnwu ye, na ɛmɔyɛ asoɛ betie me. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Sɔ mmenia hemɔ bolle, kyɛbɔ ɛmɔ adwene yɛ ɛmɔ ne, ofikyɛ bekye bɔ wabɔ ngyerɛmɔ 9:00<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">9:00 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ne te dɔnhwere bɔ ɔto so nza.</char></note> ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Mmom, ɛhe yeɛ diifoɛ Yoel hane ye nwo dwirɛ ne, ɔhane kyɛ:<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />‘Nyameɛ nwa, “Awieɛ mmerɛ nanu ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">ngohwie me honhom ne bie ngogua mmenia ahoroɛ mukoraati so;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Na ɛmɔ mmaa mmrienzua ne ɛmɔ mmaa mmrasua kɔhyɛ ngɔm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">ɛmɔ mmrandeɛ konya anisoadehu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">ná ɛmɔ mbanyi nemɔ ahe nnaleɛ.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Ná me ngoaa ne me mmaawa koso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">ngohwie me honhom ne bie ngogua bɛ so sɔ mmerɛ ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">na bɛkɔhyɛ ngɔm.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Ngɔmaa anwanwadeɛ kɔwa ewienu wɔ anwuro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">ná nzɛngyerɛneɛ awa aseɛ so wɔ ase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">mogya, see, ne nwosina munguu kɔwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Eyia kɔkakyi awosii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">ná ɛsraen akakyi mogya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">kora né Awurade anuonyam kyẽa pirikua ne awa.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Ná ebiala bɔ ɔkɔbɔ Awurade dumaa ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:21">okonya ngoa.” ’<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />“Israel mmrandeɛ, ɛmɔtie ɛhe: Kyɛbɔ ɛmɔ bɔbɔ ɛmɔse ne, Yesu bɔ ofi Nazerɛt ne te ebie bɔ Nyameɛ bɔbɔ yele ye maa ɔyɛle nningyein mbiri-mbiri, anwanwadeɛ, ne nzɛngyerɛneɛ wɔ ɛmɔ nu. Ná Nyameɛ nate nningyein bɔ ɔyɛle naso yele ye nwo ali hyirele ɛmɔ. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Sɔ biaa he yeɛ ɛmɔ yele ye bɛmane ne. Na sɔ ala yeɛ né Nyameɛ abɔ ye ti anu ɔ, na ne ɔse ye dadaada kyɛ sɔ yeɛ okosi ɔ. Na ɛmɔ maa mmeratofoɛ bɔle ye asɛnnua nu bɛhuni ye. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Nakoso Nyameɛ tingyele ye, na olɛle ye fili ewue yealɛ nu, ofikyɛ né ewue ngɔhora ngɔkyekye ye. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Ye yeɛ David hane ye nwo dwirɛ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">‘Awurade wɔ me nyunu daa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">Ɔwɔ me sa famaa so, yeti me nwo ngɔwoso me lle.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Ɛhene ati m'ahone nye gye, na me temverema di ahurusi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">na ngɔtena anidasoɛ nu,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />ofikyɛ, ɛngɔyakyi me kra wɔ kumaa nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">na bɔ odi nahorɛ ma wɔ ne, ɛngɔma ɔngɔporɔ.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Amaa manwu ngoa atee ne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">Na ɛkɔmaa ngonya anigye paa wɔ wɔ nyunu.’<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />“Aliemaa mɔ, ngɔhora ngɔha ye pen ngohyire ɛmɔ kyɛ David wuli maa besiele ye, na ɔbaadwu ɛnɛ, ye asieleɛ tɛ́ wɔ yɛ nwo wa. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Ɔnate kyɛ ne ɔte diifoɛ, na né ɔse kyɛ Nyameɛ aha ye ndaen kyɛ ɔkɔfa ye bosoniɛ bie kosie ye bia so nati, <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />oli moa nwuni Kristo bɔ ne bɛkotingye ye bɛkofi ewue nu ne, na ɔhane ye nwo dwirɛ kyɛ, banyakyi ye wɔ kumaa nu, na ye nwonaen koso amborɔ. <verse eid="ACT 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Yesu he yeɛ Nyameɛ tingyele ye ne, na yɛ mukoraati yɛdi ɛhe anwo adanzeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Ná ɔnate kyɛ bama ye so bafa ye batena Nyameɛ sa famaa so, ná ye sa aha honhom krongron bɔ Baba ne fa hyɛle ye bɔ nati, wahwie bɔ ɛmɔnwu ye, ná ɛmɔte ne wagua yɛ so. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />David de, wangɔ anwuro, nakoso ɔhane kyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">‘Awurade ha hyirele me wura kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34">“Tena me sa famaa so<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />kodwu kyɛ ngɔfa w'atamfo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:35">ngogua wɔ gya bo.”’<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />Yeti, odikyɛ Israel awuro mukoraati nwu ye pefee kyɛ, Yesu bɔ ɛmɔ bɔle ye asɛnnua nu ne, Nyameɛ ayɛ ye Awurade ne Kristo.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛtele ɛhe ne, bɛyɛle basaa, na bɛbisale Petro ne asomafoɛ bɔ baha ne kyɛ: “Aliemaa mɔ, nzu yeɛ yɛyɛ ɔ?” <verse eid="ACT 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Petro ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔsakra, na ɛmɔma bɛbɔ ɛmɔ nu biala asu wɔ Yesu Kristo dumaa nu, na wamaa ɛmɔ anya bɔne fakyɛ. Ná ɛmɔ konya honhom krongron bɔ bɛfa bɛkyɛ mbaen ne bie. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Ofikyɛ bɔhyɛ ne wɔ berɛ ma ɛmɔ, ɛmɔ mmaa mɔ, ne bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ dede namu, ɔne ebiala bɔ Awurade yɛ Nyameɛ kɔfrɛ ye kɔwa ye berɛ ne.” <verse eid="ACT 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Na ɔhane edwirɛ foforɛ fa lili bɛ adanzeɛ, na otuli bɛ fo kyɛ: “Ɛmɔma bɛle ɛmɔ bɛfi aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ bɔ wahyea he anu.” <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Yeti bɛ bɔ bɛfale anigye bɛlɛle ye dwirɛ ne, bɛbɔle bɛ asu. Na sɔ kyẽa ne, mmenia kɔyɛ 3,000 yeɛ bɛɛbokale bɛ so ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Na bɛhɔle so betiele asomafoɛ ne ngyerɛkyerɛ ne, bɛfale nnamvoa, bɛdidili, na bɛbɔle mbaeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Esuronyi hane ebiala, ná asomafoɛ ne hyɛle yebo yɛle anwanwadeɛ ne nzɛngyerɛneɛ pee.<verse eid="ACT 2:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Né bɛ bɔ baayɛ gyidifoɛ namukoraati wɔ neka-horɛ, na bɛfale bɛ nningyein mukoraati bɛbɔle nu, <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />na bɛtɔnene b'ahodeɛ ne b'agyapadeɛ, na bɔ benyane ye ne, bɛhyɛle maa ebiala nyane bɔ ohia ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Daa biala, né bɛfa adwene kõ bɛkɔ asɔre awuro berɛ, bɛbɔnu bɛdidi wɔ b'awuro, bɛfa anigye ne ahone bɔ enu te bɛbɔnu bɛdidi, <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />bɛye Nyameɛ ayɛ, na benyane mmenia namukoraati nyunu adom. Na daa biala, né Awurade kɔ so fa bɛ bɔ odɛ bɛ ngoa ne bie baboka so.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Ɛlɛho bie, né Petro ne Yohane kɔ asɔre awuro berɛ, né wabɔ eyia 3:00; sɔ mmerɛ ne yeɛ ne bɛbɔ mbaeɛ ne. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Né ebiemɔ so biaa bie, bɛwole ye ne, né wabubu. Daa biala, né bɛfa ye bɛbasie asɔre awuro né anoa bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Nyemene nanwo, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɔkɔhora kɔsrɛ nikye kofi bɛ bɔ bɛkɔ asɔre awuro dɔ ne berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Mmerɛ bɔ onwuni kyɛ Petro ne Yohane kɔ asɔre awuro berɛ ne, ɔhyɛle yebo kyɛ ɔsrɛ nikye fi bɛ berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Nakoso Petro ne Yohane neane ye dinn, yeɛ bɛhane kyɛ: “Nea yɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Yeti ɔfale ye adwene hɔle bɛ so, na ne ɔse kyɛ okonya nikye bie kofi bɛ berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Nakoso Petro ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Dwetɛ ne sikaa kɔkorɛ de, nnne bie, nakoso bɔ nne ye ne yeɛ mefa mema wɔ ne. Nazerɛtniɛ Yesu Kristo dumaa nu, nate!” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Na ɔsɔle ye sa famaa nu mane ye so, na ɛberɛ ala, ye gya ne ye gya-porɛ nanu yɛle se; <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />ná odwɔso gyinane ye gya so, na ɔne bɛ nate hɔle asɔre awuro berɛ, bɛkɔ namukoraati, né ohuri-huri ye Nyameɛ ayɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Ná mmenia namukoraati nwuni kyɛ ɔnate ye Nyameɛ ayɛ ne, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />bɛnwuni kyɛ ye yeɛ né ɔtena asɔre awuro né anoa bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Anoa Nyemene nanwo srɛ-srɛ sikaa ne. Na bɔ wasi ne yɛle bɛ nwanwa, na bɛ nye gyele pa.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Ná mmerɛ bɔ biaa ne tɛ́ tira Petro ne Yohane nu wɔ Solomon varanda naso ne, mmenia namukoraati tuli mirika wale berɛ, na bɔ wasi ne maa bɛ nwo dwirili bɛ paa. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Petro nwuni ye sɔ ne, ɔhane kyɛ: “Israel mmrienzua, nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔ amaa ɛhe ayɛ ɛmɔ nwanwa sɔ ne? Ná nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔnea yɛ haa te kyɛ ɛnwa yɛ bɔbɔ yɛ tumi anaa yɛ nyamesom pa yeɛ wamaa biaa he anate ne? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Abraham, Isaac, ne Yakob Nyameɛ, yɛ Baba mɔ Nyameɛ ne ahyɛ ye akoaa Yesu anuonyam. Sɔ Yesu he yeɛ ɛmɔ yele ye bɛmane ne, na mmerɛ bɔ Pilato yɛle ye adwene kyɛ ɔyakyi ye ne po, ɛmɔ pole ye.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɛmɔhane kyɛ ɛmɔnze ye.”</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Ɛmɔ pole Sona bɔ ɔte Krongron na ɔte Teneneeniɛ ne, na ɛmɔhane kyɛ ɔyakyi wudiniɛ ne ma ɛmɔ, <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />na ɛmɔhuni bɔ otira ngoa nzafoa ne. Nakoso Nyameɛ tingyele ye fili ewue nu, na yɛte edwirɛ he anwo adanzefoɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Ye dumaa ne, ɔne gyidie bɔ yɛle ye wɔ ye dumaa nanu ne, yeɛ wamaa biaa he bɔ ɛmɔnwu ye, na ɛmɔse ye ne nwo atɔ ye ne. Na gyidie bɔ ɔnate Yesu so ne yeɛ wamaa biaa he nwo atɔ ye koraa wɔ ɛmɔ mukoraati nyunu ne.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />“Afei aliemaa mɔ, mese kyɛ, sɛ ne ɛmɔse a, ahaa ɛmɔ anyɛ sɔ, na atemmufoɛ ne koso, né bɛnze. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Nakoso ɛhe amaa bɔ Nyameɛ nate adiifoɛ nemɔ so ha tole berɛ ne awa nu. Ɔhane kyɛ, ye Kristo ne konwu amaneɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Yeti, ɛmɔsakra ɛmɔ adwene, na ɛmɔkakyi ɛmɔ nwo ma bɛkyikyi ɛmɔ bɔne. Sɛ ɛmɔyɛ sɔ a, ahotɔ mmerɛ kofi Awurade bɔbɔ berɛ kɔwa, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />na ɔkɔsoma Yesu bɔ ɔte Kristo bɔ waye ye ne kɔma ɛmɔ. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Ɔkɔtena anwuro tonn koodwu mmerɛ bɔ bɛkosiesie nningyein mukoraati ne, ɛhene yeɛ Nyameɛ nate ye adiifoɛ krongron nemɔ so aha ye nwo dwirɛ ato berɛ dadaada ne. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Mose hane kyɛ: ‘Awurade, ɛmɔ Nyameɛ kɔye diifoɛ bɔ ɔte kyɛ me kofi eliema mɔ nu kɔma ɛmɔ. Edwirɛ biala bɔ ɔkɔha kohyire ɛmɔ ne, odikyɛ ɛmɔtie. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Ná ebiala bɔ wandie sɔ diifo ne, bɛkɔsɛkye ye koraa bɛkofi mmenia nanu.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Na adiifoɛ namukoraati, ofi Samuel so ɔbaadwu bɛ bɔ bɛli ye si bɛwale naso ne, ebiala bɔ odwudwole ne hane sɔ ngyẽa nemɔ nwo dwirɛ pefee. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Ɛmɔte adiifoɛ nemɔ ne apam bɔ Nyameɛ ne ɛmɔ baba mɔ yɛle ne mmaa. Ɔha hyirele Abraham kyɛ: ‘Wɔ bosoniɛ yeɛ ɔkɔmaa mmusua bɔ ɔwɔ aseɛ naso namukoraati ne konya nhyira ɔ.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Na mmerɛ bɔ Nyameɛ tingyele ye akoaa ne, oli moa somane ye kyɛ ɔbra ɛmɔ berɛ, na ɔɔkakyi ebiala fi ye bɔne nwo, ná wamaa ɛmɔ anya nhyira.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Bɛguso bɛdwudwo bɛkyire mmenia ne, sɔfo nemɔ, bɔ ɔnea asɔre awuro naso ne, ɔne Sadukifoɛ nemɔ wale bɛ so. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Né bafɛ yaa paa, ofikyɛ ne asomafoɛ nemɔ kyirekyire mmenia ne, na né bɛka ye wɔ badwanu kyɛ Yesu atingye afi ewue nu. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Yeti bɛhyele bɛ; na ɔnate kyɛ né aleɛ asa ayie nati, bɛfale bɛ bɛguale prizin maa aleɛ hene. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Nakoso bɛ bɔ betiele edwirɛ nanu pee lɛ lili, na mmrienzua ne dodoɔ ne dwuli kɔyɛ 5,000.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Aleɛ hene ne, maen nanu atumvoɛ, mbanyi, ne atwerɛfoɛ nemɔ yiale nu wɔ Yerusalem, <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />né Annas bɔ ɔte sɔfo panyi ne, Kaiafa, Yohane, Alɛzanda, ne sɔfo panyi ne abusuafoɛ mukoraati wɔ berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Bɛfale Petro ne Yohane bɛgyinane bɛ afia, na bɛhyɛle yebo bɛbisale bɛ kyɛ: “Tumi beni yeɛ ɛmɔfa bɛyɛle ɛhe ne, na ɛmɔyɛle ye wɔ nwa dumaa nu?” <verse eid="ACT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Yeɛ Petro bɔ honhom krongron ayi ye tɛkyɛ ne ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Maen nanu atumvoɛ ne mbanyi, <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />sɛ ɛnɛ, pa bɔ yayɛ yama bubuaniɛ nati yeɛ ɛmɔneɛnea yɛ dwirɛ nu, na ɛmɔpena kyɛ ɛmɔnwu bɔ ɔmaa biaa he nwo tɔle ye ne de a, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />yɛpena kyɛ ɛmɔ mukoraati, ne mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ Israel namukoraati nwu ye kyɛ, Nazerɛtniɛ Yesu Kristo bɔ ɛmɔ bɔle ye asɛnnua nu, ná Nyameɛ tingyele ye fili ewue nu ne, ɔnate ye so yeɛ biaa he nwo atɔ ye bɔ ogyi ɛmɔ nyunu wa ne. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Yesu he yeɛ ole,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">‘nyɔboɛ bɔ ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔte brekyafoɛ ne gyi tole ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">ɛhene yeɛ waayɛ nyɔboɛ bɔ ye nwo hia paa ne.’<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Afei koso, sona foforɛ biala nne berɛ bɔ ɔkɔmaa yekonya ngoa ɔ, ná dumaa foforɛ biala nne anwuro bo bɔ bafa bama mmenia kyɛ yɛfa so yɛnya ngoa ɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛnwuni akukuduro bɔ Petro ne Yohane fa dwudwo, ná bɛnwuni kyɛ bangɔ sukuu, ná bɛtte mmenia titire biala ne, ɔyɛle bɛ nwanwa paa. Na ɛberɛ yeɛ bɛnwuni kyɛ sãa né bɛboka Yesu so. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Na mmerɛ bɔ bɛnwuni biaa bɔ basa ye anwonyerɛ ne kyɛ ogyi bɛ nwo berɛ ne, bangora hwee ka. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Yeti, bɛmaa bɛfili Sanhendrin sua nanu bɛfitele, na bɛtuli agyina. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Yeɛ bɛbisale bɛ nwo kyɛ: “Nzu yeɛ yɛfa yɛyɛ mmenia hemɔ ɔ? Ofikyɛ ebiala bɔ ɔwɔ Yerusalem ne nye tua nzɛngyerɛneɛ kandinga bɔ bayɛ ne, ná yɛsu ye nwo aporowaa a, ɔnyɛ yé. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Yeti bɔ ɔkɔyɛ na edwirɛ he andrɛ kõ ne, ɛmɔma yɛ nwuna-nwuna bɛ, na yɛha yɛhyire bɛ kyɛ, bɛnea ye, na banga dumaa he anwo dwirɛ bangyire ebiala kõ.” <verse eid="ACT 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Yeti, bɛfrɛle bɛ bɛwale, na bɛhyɛle bɛ kitii kyɛ, nnɛmaa bɛbɔ Yesu dumaa ne kõ, na nnɛmaa bɛyɛ ngyerɛkyerɛ wɔ ye dumaa nanu kõ. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Nakoso Petro ne Yohane hane kyɛ: “Sɛ ɔte pa wɔ Nyameɛ nyunu kyɛ, yɛtie ɛmɔ yɛtra Nyameɛ a, ɛmɔ bɔbɔ ɛmɔbua. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Yɛ de, bɔ yanwu ye, na yate ne, yɛyakyi ye hanɛ a, ɔnyɛ yé.” <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Yeti besa bɛbɔle bɛ ndrɛneɛ, na bɛyakyile bɛ kyɛ bɛhɔ, ofikyɛ bannya edwirɛ biala bɔ begyina so bɛtwe bɛ so ɔ. Afei koso, né bɛsuro mmenia ne, ofikyɛ né ebiala ye Nyameɛ ayɛ wɔ bɔ wasi nanwo. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Biaa bɔ bɛyɛle anwanwadeɛ he bɛsale ye anwonyerɛ ne, né ɔbo afoɛ 40.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Bɛyakyile bɛ ne, bɛhɔle asuafoɛ bɔ baha ne berɛ, na edwirɛ bɔ sɔfo mbanyi ne mbanyi nemɔ ha hyirele bɛ ne, bɛhane ye mukoraati bɛhyirele bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Na bɛtele sɔ dwirɛ ne, bɛ mukoraati bɛmane bɛ konvi so bɛha bɛhyirele Nyameɛ kyɛ: “Awurade Tumvoɛ, wɔ yeɛ ɛbɔle anwuro, aseɛ, ɛpo, ne nikye biala bɔ ɔwɔ nu ne, <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />wɔ yeɛ ɛnate honhom krongron so hane ye wɔ yɛ nana David, bɔ ɔte wɔ akoaa ne noa nu kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">‘Nzuati yeɛ maen ne afɛ yaa sɔ ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">Ná mmenia ne dwene nningyein bɔ mvasoɛ nne so nwo ne?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Aseɛ naso ahemvo dwɔso gyina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">na atumvoɛ nemɔ dwɔso tia Awurade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">ne bɔ Awurade asra ye ne.’<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Nahorɛ nu, sɔ kuro he ala nu yeɛ Herode, Pontio Pilato, maen-maen nanufoɛ ne, ɔne mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ Israel ne ha bɔle nu, na bɛdwɔso betiale Yesu, bɔ ɔte w'akoaa krongron bɔ asra ye ne. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Na bɛyɛle bɔ aha ato berɛ kyɛ ɛkɔyɛ ne. Ɛhemɔ wale nu, ofikyɛ ɛle tumi, na ne ɔte wɔ pɛ kyɛ osi. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Afei Awurade, nea kyɛbɔ bɛ nwuna-nwuna yɛ ne, na ma wɔ ngoaa akukuduro paa ma yɛfa yɛha wɔ dwirɛ ne, <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />mmerɛ bɔ ɛtengyɛ wɔ sa fa sa mmenia anwonyerɛ, ná ɛma nzɛngyerɛneɛ ne anwanwadeɛ fa w'akoaa krongron Yesu dumaa nu ba ne.” <verse eid="ACT 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Bɛbɔle mbaeɛ ne bɛyiele ne, nekaa bɔ bayia nu ne wosole, na honhom krongron wale bɛ mukoraati so, na bɛhɔle so bɛfale akukuduro bɛhane Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Afei mmeni lɔen namukoraati nyane ahone ne kra kõ, ná bɛ nu biala anga kyɛ nningyein bɔ ole ye ne te ye deɛ, mmom bɛfale bɛ nningyein namukoraati bɛbɔle nu. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Ná asomafoɛ nemɔ fale tumi kandinga lili Awurade Yesu bɔ batingye ye nanwo adanzeɛ, na adom kandinga wale bɛ mukoraati so. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Bɛ nu biala nne berɛ bɔ ne ye nwo kyere ye ɔ, ofikyɛ ebiala bɔ né ole aseɛ ne awuro ne tɔnene ye, na bɔ onyane ye ne, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />ɔfa brɛle asomafoɛ nemɔ. Na bɛ koso, bɛhyɛle maa ebiala nyane bɔ ohia ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Né Yosef bɔ asomafoɛ nemɔ frɛ ye Barnaba (bɔ yebo kyire “Awerɛkyekye Awa”) ne wɔ berɛ. Né ɔte Lewiniɛ bɔ ofi Kipro; <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />né ole aseɛ bie, na ɔtɔnene ye fale sikaa bɔ onyane ye ne brɛle asomafoɛ nemɔ.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Né biaa bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Ananias wɔ berɛ, na ɔne ɔye Safira tɔnene b'agyapadeɛ bie. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Nakoso ɔyele sikaa bɔ onyane ye ne bie feale, na ɔfale bɔ ɔhale ne brɛle asomafoɛ nemɔ. Né ɔye se ye nwo bie. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Ná Petro ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Ananias, nzuati yeɛ Satan amaa anya akukuduro kyɛ, ɛpɛ anoanu hyire honhom krongron ne, ná ɛfa aseɛ nanwo sikaa ne bie fea ne? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Mmerɛ bɔ aseɛ ne wɔ wɔ berɛ ne, né ɔtte wɔ deɛ? Ná ɛtɔnene ye ne, né sikaa ne tte wɔ deɛ? Na nzuati yeɛ anya sɔ adwene ne wɔ w'ahone nu ne? Nná sona yeɛ apɛ anoanu ahyire ye hɔ oo, mmom Nyameɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Ananias tele ɛhe ala pɛ, ɔpɛ fini, ná owuli. Ná esuronyi hane bɛ bɔ bɛtele sɔ dwirɛ namu. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Ná mmrandeɛ nemɔ dwɔsole, bɛfale ɛtena bɛkyekyele ye nwo, yeɛ bɛɛsiele ye ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Kɔyɛ dɔnhwere nza si ne, ɔye wale, nakoso ne ɔnze bɔ wasi ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Petro bisale ye kyɛ: “Ka kyire me, sɔ ala yeɛ ɛmɔ tɔnene aseɛ ne ɔ?” Na ɔhane kyɛ: “Yoo, sɔ ala yeɛ yɛ tɔnene ye ɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Yeti Petro ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔ munyɔ ne, ɛmɔ ayɛ ɛmɔ adwene kyɛ ɛmɔ kɔsɔ Awurade honhom bɛkɔnea ne? Nea, bɛ bɔ beesiele ɛhu ne, bekye bɔ badwu anoa ne nyunu berɛ ɔ, na wɔ koso, bɛkɔfa wɔ bɛkɔhɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Na ɛberɛ ala, ɔpɛ fini ye gya bo berɛ, na owuli. Na mmerɛ bɔ mmrandeɛ ne wale berɛ ne, bɛnwuni kyɛ wawu, yeti bɛfale ye, na beesiele ye wɔ ohu nanwo berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Yeti, esuronyi hane asafo ne paa, na bɛ bɔ bɛtele sɔ dwirɛ ne koso, esuronyi hane bɛ.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Nakoso, asomafoɛ nemɔ hɔle so yɛle nzɛngyerɛneɛ ne anwanwadeɛ pee wɔ mmenia nanu; na bɛ mukoraati, né beyia nu wɔ Solomon varanda naso. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, bɛ bɔ baha nanu biala nne berɛ bɔ onyane akukuduro fale ye nwo bɔle bɛ ɔ, nakoso, né mmenia ka bɛ nwo dwirɛ pa. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Na bɔ ɔtra sɔ ne, mmeni pee nyane gyidie wɔ Awurade nu, ná bɛɛbokale bɛ so, mmrienzua ne mmrasua pee. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Na bɛfale bɛ bɔ bɛnde apɔ ne bɛguale mba ne bɛen so wɔ atee noa, na sɛ Petro pɛ nu a, né ye wawoɛ ne atɔ bɛ so. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Afei, mmeni pee fi nguro bɔ wapɛ Yerusalem nwo wayia nanu wale, ná bɛba ne, bɛfale bɛ bɔ bɛnde apɔ ne bɛ bɔ sunzummɔne wɔ bɛ so bɛwale, na bɛ mukoraati bɛ nwo tɔle bɛ.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Ná sɔfo panyi ne né Sadukifoɛ kue bɔ bɛboka ye so ne dwɔsole, né ahoɔyaa ku bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Yeti, bɛhyele asomafoɛ nemɔ, na bɛfale bɛ bɛguale prizin. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Na kɔngɔen ne, Awurade abɔfo bukyele prizin né anoa ne, ɔyele bɛ fili berɛ, na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Ɛmɔɔgyina asɔre awuro berɛ, na ɛmɔha ngoa he nwo dwirɛ behyire mmenia ne.” <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Bɛtele ɛhe ne, bɛhɔle asɔre awuro berɛ ngyerɛmɔ tutuutu, na bɛhyɛle yebo kyɛ bɛ kyirekyire mmenia ne.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Mmerɛ bɔ sɔfo panyi ne né bɛ bɔ bɛboka ye so ne wale ne, bɛfrɛle Sanhendrin ne, na bɛfrɛle mbanyi bɔ bɛwɔ Israel namukoraati maa beyiale nu, yeɛ bɛsoma kyɛ bɛhɔ prizin dɔ bɛɛfa asomafoɛ nemɔ bɛbra. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Nakoso, sogyafoɛ nemɔ dwuli berɛ ne, né benne berɛ, yeti bɛɛbɔle bɛ amaneɛ kyɛ: <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />“Yɛhɔle ne, né batoto prizin né anoa nanu, ná ne sogyafoɛ nemɔ gyi-gyi anoa ne nyunu berɛ. Nakoso yɛ bukyele anoa ne, né ebiala nne nu.” <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Mmerɛ bɔ sona bɔ ɔnea asɔre awuro berɛ ne sɔfo mbanyi nemɔ tele ɛhe ne, né bɛnwu bɔ bɛyɛ ɔ, ofikyɛ né bɛnze bɔ okofi nu kɔwa ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Nakoso ebie wale berɛ ɔɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Mmenia bɔ ɛmɔ hyele bɛ ne, ɛmɔɔnea kyɛ bɛgyi asɔre awuro dɔ bekyirekyire mmenia ne ɔ!” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Yeti sogyaniɛ panyi ne né sogyafoɛ nemɔ hɔle dɔ, na bɛɛfale bɛ bɛwale, nakoso bannyɛ bɛ basa-basa, ofikyɛ né bɛsuro kyɛ annea a né mmenia ne asi bɛ nyɔboɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Na bɛfale bɛ bɛɛgyinane Sanhendrin ne nyunu, na sɔfo panyi ne bisale bɛ kyɛ: <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />“Yɛhyɛle ɛmɔ kitii kyɛ, nnɛmɔfa dumaa he bɛyɛ ngyerɛkyerɛ kõ, nakoso ɛmɔ afa ɛmɔ ngyerɛkyerɛ ne balɛ́ Yerusalem kuro ne babɔ so, na ɛmɔ ayɛ ɛmɔ adwene kyɛ, ɛmɔ kɔmaa biaa he mogya kɔwa yɛ so.” <verse eid="ACT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Petro ne asomafoɛ bɔ baha ne hane kyɛ: “Nyameɛ mmom yeɛ odikyɛ yɛtie ye ɔ,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nyameɛ yeɛ ɔte Sodifoɛ bɔ odikyɛ yɛtie ye ɔ.”</char></note> na ɔtte sona. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Yɛ baba mɔ Nyameɛ tingyele Yesu bɔ ɛmɔ sinzele ye bakaa so bɛhuni ye ne. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Na Nyameɛ apagya ye so ayɛ ye Kannifoɛ ne Agyenkwa, na wafa ye watena ye sa famaa so kyɛ ɔma Israel nya adwene-sakra na ɔfa bɛ bɔne hyɛ bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Na yɛte edwirɛ he anwo adanzefoɛ, na honhom krongron bɔ Nyameɛ afa ama bɛ bɔ betie ye ne koso di ɛhe anwo adanzeɛ.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Mmerɛ bɔ badwa ne tele ɛhe ne, bɛfɛle yaa paa, na ne bɛpena kyɛ bɛku bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Né Farisiniɛ bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Gamaliel boka Sanhendrin naso, né okyire Mmeraa, na né mmenia bu ye paa. Odwɔsole, na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ bɛfa mmrienzua ne bɛfite kaa. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Israel mmrienzua, bɔ ɛmɔpena kyɛ ɛmɔfa bɛyɛ sɔ mmrienzua hemɔ ne, ɛmɔdwene ye nwo yé. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Mmerɛ bie bɔ wapɛ nu ne, Teuda dwɔsole, né yenwa ɔte sona titire, na mmenia kɔyɛ kyɛ 400 tu lili ye si. Nakoso mmerɛ bɔ bɛhuni ye ne, bɛ bɔ beli ye si namukoraati bɔ sandele, na wanzi bɛ yé. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Yesi ne, mmerɛ bɔ bɛtworɔ dumaa ne, Yuda bɔ ofi Galilea ne koso mane ye nwo so, na ɔhwene mmeni pee lili ye si. Sɔ biaa ne koso wuli ne, bɛ bɔ bɛli ye si namukoraati bɔ sandele. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Yeti edwirɛ he bɛ yɛka ne, mepena kyɛ ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ, nnɛmɔ ha mmrandeɛ hemɔ, ɛmɔyakyi bɛ. Na sɛ sɔ nhyehyɛɛ he anaa adwuma he fi sona a, okogu; <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Nakoso sɛ ofi Nyameɛ a, ɛmɔ ngɔhora ye gu lle. Wanyɛ sɔ a, né wayɛ kyɛ ɛmɔ ne Nyameɛ yeɛ bɛkõ ɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Yeti betiele Gamaliel afutuo ne. Na bɛfrɛle asomafoɛ nemɔ bɛwale, na bɛgwale bɛ, yeɛ bɛhyɛle bɛ kyɛ, nnɛmaa bɛfa Yesu dumaa ne bɛyɛ ngyerɛkyerɛ kõ, na bɛyakyile bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Ná bɛfi Sanhendrin ne nyunu bɛkɔ ne, né bɛ nye agye paa kyɛ ye dumaa nati, banwu kyɛ odikyɛ bɛgua bɛ nyunu ase. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Na daa biala, né bekyirekyire bɛka Kristo Yesu nwo nzɛmba ne wɔ asɔre awuro berɛ ne awuro-awuro nu, ná banyakyi.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Ná mmerɛ bɔ asuafoɛ nemɔ dodoɔ kɔ anyunu ne, Yudafoɛ bɔ bɛka Greek dwudwolɛ ne hyɛle yebo dwudwo tiale Yudafoɛ bɔ bɛka Hebri dwudwolɛ ne, ofikyɛ né bɛbu bɛ nye bɛgua akunafoɛ bɔ bɛka Greek dwudwolɛ naso. Ná nningyein bɔ daa bɛkyɛ ne, né bɛmma bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Yeti, buru-ne-nyɔ ne frɛle mmenia namukoraati maa beyiale, na bɛha bɛhyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɔttemaye kyɛ yɛkɔyakyi Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne berɛ, ná yaagyina tɛbulu nwo yakyekyɛ aleɛ. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Yeti aliemaa mɔ, ɛmɔneɛnea ɛmɔ nu, ná ɛmɔye mmrienzua nzoo bɔ bɛle dumaa pa, mmenia bɔ honhom wɔ bɛ so, na bɛse nworɛ, na yɛfa adwuma bɔ ye nwo hia he yɛwura bɛ sa. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Na yɛ de, yɛkotu yɛ nwo yekosie berɛ yɛkɔbɔ mbaeɛ, na yayere yɛ nwo yaha Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne.” <verse eid="ACT 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Bɔ bɛhane ne tɔle mmenia ne so anu, yeti bɛyele Steven, brienzua bɔ ole gyidie na honhom krongron wɔ ye so, ɔne Filipo, Prokoro, Nikanor, Timon, Parmena, ne Nikolas bɔ ofi Antiokia, ná wasakra waayɛ Yudaniɛ ne. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Bɛfale bɛ bɛbrɛle asomafoɛ ne, na bɛbɔle mbaeɛ beyiele ne, bɛfale bɛ sa bɛguale bɛ so.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Afei, Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne hɔle so trɛle, na asuafoɛ ne dodoɔ bu bɔle ye nwo wɔ Yerusalem, na asɔfo nanu pee yɛle gyidifoɛ.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Ná Steven bɔ Nyameɛ adom ne tumi wɔ ye so ne yɛle anwanwadeɛ ne nzɛngyerɛneɛ pee wɔ mmenia nanu. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Ná mmenia biemɔ bɔ bɛboka kue bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye sua bɔ beyia nu nanu Ahofadifoɛ, ne Kirenfoɛ biemɔ, ne Alɛzandriafoɛ, ne mmenia biemɔ bɔ bɛfi Kilikia ne Asia wale kyɛ bɛne Steven baasu aporowaa. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Nakoso nyanza ne honhom bɔ ne ɔfa dwudwo ne, bangora ye noa gyina. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Yeti, bɛne ebiemɔ yɛle plan kyɛ bɛha kyɛ: “Yate kyɛ ɔka mmusue dwirɛ fa Mose ne Nyameɛ nwo.” <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Ná bɛ piepiane mmenia ne, mbanyi nemɔ, ne atwerɛfoɛ nemɔ maa bɛwale ye so komapɛ, na bɛhyele ye bɛhɔle Sanhendrin ne nyunu. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Yeɛ bɛmaa mmenia biemɔ lili adanzewia tiale ye kyɛ: “Daa biala, biaa he dwudwo tia nekaa krongron he ne Mmeraa ne. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Yɛtele ye po kyɛ ɔka kyɛ, Yesu bɔ ofi Nazerɛt ne kodwiri sua he kogua, na amanne bɔ Mose fa mane yɛ ne, ɔkɔsesa ye.” <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Mmerɛ bɔ Sanhendrin badwa namukoraati neane ye haa ne, bɛnwuni kyɛ ye nyunu ayɛ kyɛ abɔfo nyunu.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Ná sɔfo panyi ne bisale ye kyɛ: “Sɔ dwirɛ hemɔ te nahorɛ?” <verse eid="ACT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Yeɛ Steven yele ye noa kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 7:2">“Mmrienzua, aliemaa mɔ ne baba mɔ, ɛmɔtie me. Anuonyam Nyameɛ ne yele ye nwo ali hyirele yɛ nana Abraham mmerɛ bɔ ne ɔwɔ Mesopotamia, kora yeɛ otu kɔ Haran ne, <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />na ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: ‘Tu fi w'aseɛ so ne w'abusuafoɛ nwo, na kɔ nekaa bɔ ngohyire wɔ ne.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Yeti otu fili Kaldeafoɛ aseɛ naso, na ɔɔtenane Haran. Ná ye baba wue si ne, Nyameɛ maa ofili berɛ ɔɔtenane nekaa bɔ kesaalae yɛte ne. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Nakoso Nyameɛ amma ye agyapadeɛ biala, wannya nekaa bɔ ne ɔkɔfa ye gya kotia po; mmom ɔhyɛle ye bɔ kyɛ ɔkɔfa sɔ aseɛ ne kɔma yɛ kyɛ ye agyapadeɛ, na sɛ ɔnne berɛ a, ɔkɔfa kɔma ye bosofoɛ; nakoso sɔ mmerɛ ne, né olle ba. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Yesi ne, Nyameɛ ha hyirele ye kyɛ, ye bosofoɛ kɔɔyɛ ɛwɔfoɛ wɔ ebie maen so, na sɔ mmenia nemɔ kɔfa bɛ kɔyɛ ngoaa na bɛkoli bɛ nye tonn afoɛ 400. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Nyameɛ hane kyɛ, ‘Na ngobu maen bɔ bɛkɔfa bɛ bɛkɔyɛ ngoaa ne atɛn, na ɛhene si ne, bɛkofi berɛ bɛkɔɔso me wɔ wa.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Ná Nyameɛ ne Abraham yɛle toa pɛlɛ nwo apam, yeti ɔwole Isaac ne, kyẽa bɔ ɔtɔ so mmɔtwɛ nala, ɔpɛle ye toa, ná Isaac koso wole Yakob, yeɛ Yakob wole abusua-panyin 12 nemɔ.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />“Né abusua-panyin nemɔ nye boro Yosef, yeti bɛtɔnene ye maa ɔɔyɛle akoaa wɔ Egypt. Nakoso ne Nyameɛ boka ye so, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />yeti ɔhaw biala bɔ ɔhɔle nu ne, olɛle ye fili nu. Ɔmaa Yosef nyane adom ne nyanza wɔ Egypt hene Farao nyunu. Na Farao fale Egypt maen ne ye awuro namukoraati wurale Yosef sa kyɛ ɔnea so. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Ɛhɔen kandinga bie wale Egypt ne Kanaan mukoraati, yeti né yɛ baba mɔ nnya aleɛ nni. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Ná mmerɛ bɔ Yakob tele kyɛ aleɛ wɔ Egypt ne, ɔsomane yɛ baba mɔ maa bɛli moa bɛhɔle dɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Ye pɛn nyɔ so ne, Yosef yele ye nwo ali hyirele oliema nemɔ, na Farao koso nwuni Yosef abusua ne. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Yeti Yosef maa bɛɛfale ye baba Yakob ne ye abusuafoɛ namukoraati bɛwale, né bɛte mmenia 75. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Yeti, Yakob hɔle Egypt, na ɛberɛ yeɛ owuli ɔ, na yɛ nana mɔ koso, ɛberɛ yeɛ bɛwuli ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Na bɛfale bɛ bɛhɔle Sekem bɛɛsiele bɛ, bɛsiele bɛ wɔ asieleɛ bɔ Abraham fale dwetɛ tɔ fili Hamor mmaa bɔ bɛwɔ Sekem berɛ nanu.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />“Mmerɛ bɔ ne waha kaa ma ɛbɔ bɔ Nyameɛ hyɛle Abraham ne ba nu ne, yɛ mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ Egypt ne dodoɔ bu bɔle ye nwo, na bɛyɛle pee. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Yesi ne, ɔhene foforɛ oolili bia wɔ Egypt, ye de né ɔnze Yosef. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Ɔhene sɔ ne fale nyanza-nyanza lili yɛ mmenia naso, na ɔhyɛle yɛ nana mɔ maa bɛyakyile bɛ mmaa mmaa-mmaa nemɔ berɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a bɛkowu ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Sɔ mmerɛ nanu ala yeɛ bɛwole Mose ɔ, na né ye nwo yɛ nyemene pa-pa. Bɛfale bosome nza bɛneane ye wɔ ye baba awuro. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Na mmerɛ bɔ bɛyakyile ye bɛtole nekaa bie ne, Farao awa brasua fale ye, na ɔtetele ye kyɛ ye bɔbɔ ye kunu ba. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Yeti, bɛmaa Mose suane Egyptfoɛ nyanza mukoraati. Nahorɛ nu, né ye noa ate, na ne ɔyɛ nningyein mbiri-mbiri.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />“Olili afoɛ 40 ne, ɔwale ye ahone nu kyɛ ɔkwaanea oliema nemɔ boso, Israel mmaa nemɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Ná mmerɛ bɔ onwuni kyɛ Egyptniɛ bie sisi bɛ nu kõ ne, ɔɔbokale ye, na ohuni Egyptniɛ ne fa tuale ye so kerɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Né y'adwene yɛ ye kyɛ, oliema nemɔ konwu kyɛ Nyameɛ nate ye so yeɛ odɛ́ bɛ ɔ, nakoso banwu ye so. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Aleɛ hene ne, onwuni oliema biemɔ kyɛ bɛkõ, ná ɔbɔle mmɔden kyɛ okosiesie bɛ afia, na ɔhane kyɛ: ‘Ɛmɔte aliemaa, na nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔyɛ ɛmɔ nwo bɔne ne?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Nakoso bɔ osisi ye mmango ne piane ye, yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: ‘Nwa yeɛ ɔyele wɔ kyɛ ɛnea yɛ so, na ɛbu yɛ atɛn ne? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Kyɛbɔ anoma ɛhuni Egyptniɛ ne, sɔ ala yeɛ ɛpena kyɛ ɛnɛ koso ɛku me ɔ?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Mose tele ɛhe nala pɛ, ɔfale yeti bɔle nu, na ɔɔyɛle ɛwɔfoɛ wɔ Midian aseɛ so, ɛberɛ yeɛ ɔwole ye mmaa nyɔ ne ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />“Afoɛ 40 si ne, abɔfo bie yele ye nwo ali hyirele ye wɔ ɛserɛ so, wɔ Sinai Bokaa naso, wɔ ndire bɔ ne ɔsɔ nanu. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Mose nwuni ye ne, ɔyɛle ye nwanwa, na mmerɛ bɔ ɔhɔle ye nwo berɛ kyɛ ɔkwaanea ye yé ne, ɔtele Awurade konvi wɔ berɛ kyɛ: <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Me yeɛ nne wɔ baba mɔ Nyameɛ ne, Abraham, Isaac, ne Yakob Nyameɛ.’ Esuronyi hane Mose, yeti wanyɛ ye adwene po kyɛ ɔkɔ berɛ kɔnea nikye-horɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Awurade ha hyirele ye kyɛ: ‘Yeye wɔ mmaboa, ofikyɛ aseɛ bɔ ɛgyi so ne te aseɛ krongron. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Ɔhaw bɔ me mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ Egypt ne fa nu ne, manwu ye mukoraati, mate esue bɔ bɛsu ne, na mawa kyɛ mebaale bɛ. Yeti bra, na nzoma wɔ Egypt.’<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />“Mose he bɔ bɛpole ye, na bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: ‘Nwa yeɛ ɔyele wɔ kyɛ ɛnea yɛ so, na ɛbu yɛ atɛn?’ ne, ye ala yeɛ Nyameɛ nate abɔfo naso yele ye nwo ali hyirele ye wɔ ndire bɔ ne ɔyera nanwo, na ɔsomane ye kyɛ ooli bɛ nyunu, na ole bɛ ne. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Sɔ biaa he yele bɛ fili Egypt, na ɔyɛle anwanwadeɛ ne nzɛngyerɛneɛ pee wɔ Egypt ne Ɛpo Kɔkorɛ nanwo ne ɛserɛ naso afoɛ 40. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Mose he ala yeɛ ɔha hyirele Israel mmaa nemɔ kyɛ: ‘Nyameɛ kɔye diifoɛ bie bɔ ɔte kyɛ me kofi eliema mɔ nu kɔma ɛmɔ.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Mose he ala yeɛ ne ɔne asafo ne wɔ ɛserɛ naso ne. Na abɔfo bɔ ɔne ye ne yɛ baba mɔ dwudwole wɔ Sinai Bokaa naso ne, né ɔwɔ berɛ bie. Na onyane ngoa dwirɛ krongron ne kyɛ ɔfa berɛ yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Nakoso yɛ baba nemɔ andie ye. Mmom bɛpole ye, na ɔhale bɛ ngome a, né bɛwɔ Egypt, <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />na bɛha bɛhyirele Aaron kyɛ: ‘Yɛ nyameɛ ma yɛ, ná oli yɛ nyunu. Ofikyɛ Mose he bɔ olili yɛ nyunu yele yɛ fili Egypt ne, yɛnze bɔ wato ye ɔ.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Yeti sɔ mmerɛ ne, bɛyɛle nandwie ba, na bɛbɔle afɔleɛ bɛmane sɔ statu ne, na bɛlili ahurusi wɔ bɛ sa noa adwuma nanwo. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Yeti, Nyameɛ hwene ye nwo fili bɛ nwo, na ɔyakyile bɛ maa bɛsõne nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne, kyɛbɔ bahworɔ ye wɔ adiifoɛ nemɔ nwomaa nanu ne. Bahworɔ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">‘O Israel awuro, aso me yeɛ ɛmɔ fale nningyein bɛbrɛle me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">ná ɛmɔ bɔle afɔleɛ wɔ ɛserɛ naso afoɛ 40 bɛmane me ne anaa?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Ɛmɔ fale Molɛk <char style="w">tɛnt</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">ne ɛmɔ nyameɛ Refan nzramaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">na statu yeɛ ɛmɔ yɛle bɛ kyɛ ɛmɔkɔsõ bɛ ɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Yeti ngɔpɛ ɛmɔ asue,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">maa ɛmɔ kɔhɔ Babilon si dɔ.’<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />“Mmerɛ bɔ ne yɛ baba mɔ wɔ ɛserɛ naso ne, benyane tɛnt bɔ odi adanzeɛ kyɛ Nyameɛ wɔ bɛ nu. Ye nwo akwankyerɛ bɔ Nyameɛ fa mane Mose ne, olili so pɛpɛɛpɛ, na ɔyɛle ye kyɛbɔ Nyameɛ fa hyirele ye nala. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Yɛ baba mɔ sa hane tɛnt ne, na bɛne Yosua fa wale maen-maen ne aseɛ naso, maen bɔ Nyameɛ foane bɛ fili yɛ baba mɔ nyunu ne. Na né tɛnt ne wɔ berɛ oodwuli David aberɛ so. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />David nyane Nyameɛ nyunu adom, na ɔsrɛle ye kyɛ, ɔpena kyɛ osi awuro ma Yakob Nyameɛ ne. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Nakoso Solomon yeɛ osili awuro ne mane ye ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Nakoso Anwuro-anwuroniɛ ne, nná sua bɔ sona asi nu yeɛ ɔte ɔ, na sɔ ala yeɛ diifoɛ ne hane ɔ. Ɔhane kyɛ:<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />Awurade nwa, ‘Anwuro te me bia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">na aseɛ te nekaa bɔ mefa me gya mesie ɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Awuro beni yeɛ ɛkɔhora kosi kɔma me ɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Ná nisua yeɛ ɛmɔ kɔfa bɛkɔma me kyɛ nne me nwomeɛ ɔ?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Aso nná me sa yeɛ ɔyɛle ɛhe amukoraati ɔ?’<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />“Ɛmɔte mmenia bɔ ɛmɔ asenze ɛmɔ kɔme, ɛmɔ ahone ne yɛ se, na ɛmɔ so koso ati, daa ɛmɔ kõ betia honhom krongron ne. Na bɔ ɛmɔ baba mɔ yɛle ne, ɛhene biala yeɛ ɛmɔyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Adiifoɛ nanu beni yeɛ ɛmɔ baba mɔ andane ye nye ɔ? Na bɛ bɔ bɛhane Teneneeniɛ bɔ ɔba nanwo dwirɛ ne, bɛhuni bɛ mu. Na sɔ teneneeniɛ ne yeɛ ɛmɔ yele ye bɛmane na ɛmɔ huni ye ne. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Mmeraa bɔ abɔfo ne fa wale ne, ɛmɔ yeɛ ɛmɔ nyane ɔ, nakoso ɛmɔ anni so.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Betie ye ne, né bafɛ yaa paa wɔ b'ahone nu, ná bɛhyɛle yebo kyɛ bɛkwa bɛ gye bɛgua ye so. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Na ye de, ɔnate kyɛ ne honhom krongron wɔ ye so nati, ɔtole ye nye neane anwuro, na onwuni Nyameɛ anuonyam, na onwuni Yesu kyɛ ogyi Nyameɛ sa famaa so, <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ; “Ɛmɔnea, menwu ye kyɛ anwuro abukye, na Sona Awa ne gyi Nyameɛ sa famaa so.” <verse eid="ACT 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Ɔhane ɛhe nala pɛ, bɛteɛteane nu bɛguale ye so, na bɛfale bɛ sa bɛsisili bɛ so, na bɛ mukoraati, bɛtuli bum bɛwale ye so. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Na bɛhwene ye bɛhɔle kuro ne si, yeɛ bɛhyɛle yebo bɛsili ye nyɔboɛ ɔ. Na adanzefoɛ nemɔ fale bɛ ndadeɛ guale abrandeɛ bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Saul gya bo. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛsi Steven nyɔboɛ ne, ɔsrɛle kyɛ: “Awurade Yesu, de me honhom.” <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Yeɛ obuli ndwerɛ ɔ, na ɔteane nu kyɛ: “Awurade, nnɛbu bɛ atɛn wɔ bɔne he anwo.” Ɔhane sɔ nala, owuli.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Né Saul koso pene ye wue naso.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Na ofi sɔ kyẽa ne, asafo bɔ ɔwɔ Yerusalem ne yiale ɔtaeɛ paa. Na bɛ mukoraati bɛnwati bɛhɔle Yudea ne Samaria mandam nanu maa ɔhale asomafoɛ ne ngome. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Mmenia biemɔ bɔ bɛmva bɛ som benni angorɛ siele Steven, na bɛsuni ye paa. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Saul koso hyɛle yebo kyɛ ɔsɛkye asafo ne, na ne owura awuro biala nu kɔtwe mmrienzua ne mmrasua mukoraati ba, maa bɛfa bɛ bɛgua prizin.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Nakoso, bɛ bɔ bɛnwatili ne, nekaa biala bɔ bɛhɔle ne, bɛhane nzɛmba ne wɔ berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Filipo hɔle Samaria kuro nanu, na ɔhane Kristo nwo dwirɛ hyirele bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Mmeni lɔen ne tɛle bɛ so tiele edwirɛ bɔ Filipo ka ne yé, na bɛnwuni nzɛngyerɛneɛ bɔ ɔyɛle ne. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Né bɛ nu pee le sunzummɔne, ná sunzummɔne nemɔ teɛteanu serɛ-serɛ, na bɛfili bɛ nu. Na ɔsale bɛ bɔ babubu ne bɛ bɔ bayɛ apakye nanu pee anwonyerɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Yeti kuro nanufoɛ nye gyele paa.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Né biaa bie wɔ Samaria kuro nanu bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Simon, né ɔyɛ magyek wɔ kuro nanu maa ebiala nwo dwiri ye, na né yenwa ɔte sona titire. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Ná bɛ mukoraati, ofi ngwalaa so bɔ ɔkwaadu mbanyi so ne, né ebiala tie ye, na ne bɛka kyɛ: “Sɔ biaa he yeɛ ole Nyameɛ tumi bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Tumi Piri ne.” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Né bɛyɛ asoɛ betie ye paa, ofikyɛ né magyek bɔ ɔyɛ ne amaa bɛ nwo adwiri bɛ ahyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Nakoso mmerɛ bɔ bɛlɛle Filipo bɔ ne ɔka Nyameɛ Ahennie ne Yesu Kristo dumaa nanwo nzɛmba ne bɛlili ne, bɛmaa bɛbɔle bɛ asu, mmrienzua ne mmrasua mukoraati. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Simon koso yɛle gyidiniɛ, na ɔbɔle asu yiele ne, ɔne Filipo natele; na nzɛngyerɛneɛ ne anwanwadeɛ mbiri-mbiri bɔ onwuni ye ne maa ye nwo dwirili ye paa.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Mmerɛ bɔ asomafoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Yerusalem ne tele kyɛ Samariafoɛ alɛ́ Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne, bɛsomane Petro ne Yohane maa bɛhɔle dɔ. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Bɛdwuli dɔ ne, bɛbɔle mbaeɛ bɛmane bɛ maa benyane honhom krongron. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Ofikyɛ né honhom krongron ne nya walle bɛ nu biala so, mmon Awurade Yesu dumaa nanu ngome yeɛ ne babɔ bɛ asu ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Yeti, bɛfale bɛ sa bɛguale bɛ so, na benyane honhom krongron. <verse eid="ACT 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Mmerɛ bɔ Simon nwuni kyɛ, sɛ asomafoɛ nemɔ fa bɛ sa gua ebie so a, né wanya honhom krongron ne, ɔyɛle kyɛ ɔma bɛ sikaa, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔma me tumi he bie, ná sɛ mefa me sa megua ebie so a, ye koso wanya honhom krongron.” <verse eid="ACT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Yeɛ Petro ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Ɛne wɔ dwetɛ namukoraati, ɛmɔ sɛkye, ofikyɛ ɛse kyɛ ɛkɔhora kɔfa sikaa kɔtɔ Nyameɛ akyɛdeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Ɛlle kyɛfa biala wɔ edwirɛ he anu, ofikyɛ w'ahone ndengyɛ wɔ Nyameɛ nyunu. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Yeti sakra fi wɔ bɔne nwo, na srɛ Awurade kyɛ, sɛ ɔkɔyɛ ye a, ɔfa nningyein tɛɛ bɔ adwene ye nwo wɔ w'ahone nu ne hyɛ wɔ; <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />ofikyɛ manwu kyɛ ɛte pɔizen bɔ ɔyɛ wee, na ɛtte akoaa pa.” <verse eid="ACT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Simon ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔsrɛ Awurade bɛma me, ná nningyein bɔ akeka nanu biala amma me so.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Mmerɛ bɔ Petro ne Yohane lili adanzeɛ fekɔ-fekɔ na bɛhane Awurade dwirɛ ne beyiele ne, bɛsili atee so kyɛ bɛba Yerusalem. Bɛba namukoraati, né bɛka nzɛmba ne wɔ Samaria nguraa nemɔ pee nu.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Na Awurade bɔfo ha hyirele Filipo kyɛ: “Dwɔso kɔ ngwaen dɔ, atee bɔ ofi Yerusalem kɔ Gaza naso.” (Sɔ atee ne la ɛserɛ so.) <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Yeti, odwɔso hɔle, ɔkwaanea a, Etiopianiɛ ahemvie panyi bie ɛhe. Né sɔ biaa ne le tumi paa, né owura Etiopia hemaa Kandake bo, ye yeɛ ne ɔnea ye agudeɛ mukoraati so ɔ. Né wahɔ Yerusalem waaso, <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />bɔ osa kɔ ye kuro, na ne ɔte ye teaseɛnam nu ɔkenga diifoɛ Isaiah nwomaa ne. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Yeti, honhom ne ha hyirele Filipo kyɛ: “Kɔ dɔ, pingye teaseɛnam ne.” <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Yeti, Filipo tuli mirika hɔle ye nwo berɛ, na ɔtele kyɛ biaa ne kenga diifoɛ Isaiah nwomaa ne. Filipo bisale ye kyɛ: “Bɔ ɛkenga ne, ɛte ye bo?” <verse eid="ACT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Biaa ne hane kyɛ: “Sɛ ebie angyire me a, ngɔyɛ sɛɛ ne mate ye bo.” Yeti ɔsrɛle Filipo kyɛ ɔɔtena ye nwo berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Edwirɛ bɔ ne ɔkenga ye wɔ tworɔnzɛm nanu ne ɛhe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">“Bɛfale ye bɛhɔle kyɛ boan bɛ bɛkwaahu ye ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">na kyɛbɔ boan bɔ bɛpepɛ ye nwo nwiaa yɛ konn ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">sɔ ala yeɛ ye koso wammukye ye noa ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛbrɛle ye ase ne, bammu atɛn tenenee bamma ye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Nwa yeɛ okohyire ye aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ ɔ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Ofikyɛ bɛyele ye bɛfili aseɛ naso.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Ahemvie panyi ne bisale Filipo kyɛ: “Mesrɛ wɔ, nwa nwo dwirɛ yeɛ né diifo ne ka ne? Ye bɔbɔ, anaa sona foforɛ?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Filipo hyɛle yebo dwudwole, na ɔfale tworɔnzɛm he hyɛle yebo hane Yesu nwo nzɛmba hyirele ye. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Na mmerɛ bɔ bɛnate atee naso ne, bɛnwuni nzue bie, yeɛ ahemvie panyi ne bisale Filipo kyɛ: “Nea, nzue yeɛ ɔla berɛ ne, nzu yeɛ osi m'asubɔ atee ɔ?” <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" /><note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛ ɛnea Bible biemɔ nu a, bafa edwirɛ bie wura ɛwa kyɛ: </char><char style="em">Yeɛ Filipo ha hyirele ye kyɛ, “Sɛ edɛ́ di koraa wɔ w'ahone nu de a, ɛkɔhora kɔbɔ asu.” Na ye koso ɔhane kyɛ, “Medɛ́ medi kyɛ Yesu Kristo yeɛ ole Nyameɛ Awa ne.”</char> Nakoso sɔ dwirɛ ne, ɔnne tete asaanoa ndworɔyɛ bɔ wahyɛ paa, ɔne bɔ odi mu paa nanu. </note>― <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Yeti, ɔmaa teaseɛnam ne gyinane, na Filipo ne ahemvie panyi ne dwu hɔle nzue nanu, na ɔbɔle ye asu. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Bɛfili nzue nanu bɛfitele ne, Awurade honhom fale Filipo hɔle, ná ahemvie panyi ne anwu ye kõ, na ɔfale anigye hɔle ye atee. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Filipo nye wale ye nwo so ne, né ɔwɔ Asdod, na ɔfale mandanu berɛ mukoraati hane nzɛmba ne wɔ kuro biala nu tonn oodwuli Kaesarea.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Né Saul tɛ́ nwuna-nwuna Awurade asuafoɛ nemɔ, na né ɔpena kyɛ oku bɛ. Yeti ɔhɔle sɔfo panyi ne berɛ, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />na ɔhane kyɛ, ɔma ye krataa ma ɔhɔ Damasko sua bɔ beyia nu nemɔ nu, na brienzua anaa brasua biala bɔ okonwu ye kyɛ ɔboka Atee naso ne, wahye ye wawa Yerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Ɔka kaa maa odwu Damasko ne, mvum nu, kanea bie fi anwuro pɛle ye nwo yiale. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Na ɔte tɔle, yeɛ ɔtele konviɛ bie kyɛ: “Saul, Saul, nzuati yeɛ ɛtane me nye sɔ ne?” <verse eid="ACT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Saul hane kyɛ: “Me wura, wɔ yeɛ ɛle nwa?” Ye koso ɔhane kyɛ: “Me yeɛ nne Yesu bɔ ɛtane ye nye ne. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Afei dwɔso kɔ kuro nanu, na bɛkɔmaa ekonwu bɔ odikyɛ ɛyɛ ɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Afei, né mmenia bɔ bɛne ye kɔ ne gyi berɛ tolii bɔ bɛngora dwudwo, ofikyɛ ne bɛte kyɛ ebie dwudwo, nakoso né bɛnnwu sona ne. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Saul dwɔso fili aseɛ nwo berɛ, ɔwɔ nu, né ye nye ne tetɛ so, nakoso ne onnwu hwee. Yeti, bɛsosɔle ye nu bɛfale ye bɛhɔle Damasko. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Ná ɛlɛsa mua, né onwu hwee, wannidi ná wanno hwee koso.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Né suaniɛ bie wɔ Damasko bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Ananias, na Awurade dwudwo hyirele ye wɔ anisoadehu nu kyɛ: “Ananias!” Na olɛle so kyɛ: “Awurade, me ɛhe.” <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Na Awurade ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Dwɔso kɔ atee bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Tee naso, kɔ Yuda awuro, na kɔpena biaa bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Saul bɔ ofi Tarsus ne. Nea, ɔbɔ mbaeɛ, <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />na wanya anisoadehu kyɛ biaa bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Ananias awa berɛ, na wafa ye sa wagua ye so maa ye nye ne ate.” <verse eid="ACT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Nakoso Ananias hane kyɛ: “Awurade, mmeni pee aha sɔ biaa he nwo dwirɛ ahyire me, baha nningyein tɛɛ bɔ wafa wayɛ wɔ akrongronfoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Yerusalem ne bahyire me. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Ná waale tumi wafi sɔfo mbanyi nemɔ dɔ kyɛ, ɔba wa bakye ebiala bɔ ɔbɔ wɔ dumaa ne.” <verse eid="ACT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Nakoso Awurade ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Kɔ, ofikyɛ brienzua he te nikye bɔ baye ye bama me kyɛ, ɔfa me dumaa hɔ maen-maen nanufoɛ, b'ahemvo, ne mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ Israel ne berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Na ngɔmaa okonwu amaneɛ bɔ me dumaa ti, okonwu ye ne.” <verse eid="ACT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Yeti Ananias hɔle awuro berɛ; odwuli berɛ ne, ɔfale ye sa guale ye so, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Nniema Saul, Awurade Yesu bɔ ɔyele ye nwo ali hyirele wɔ mmerɛ bɔ ne ɛnate atee so ɛba ne, ye yeɛ wasoma me kyɛ mmera wɔ berɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a wɔ nye kɔte na anya honhom krongron.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Na ɛberɛ ala, nikye bie te kyɛ ɛboen fili ye nye naso guale ase, na onwuni nikye. Na ɔdwɔsole maa bɛbɔle ye asu, <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />na odidili nyane anwoserɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Na ɔne asuafoɛ nemɔ tenane Damasko berɛ hyɛle kaa. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Ná ɛberɛ ala ɔhyɛle yebo hane Yesu nwo dwirɛ wɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nemɔ nu kyɛ, Yesu yeɛ ole Nyameɛ Awa ne. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Nakoso bɛ bɔ né betie ye namukoraati nwo dwirili bɛ, na bɛhane kyɛ: “Nná sɔ biaa he yeɛ né ɔteetee bɛ bɔ bɛbɔ sɔ dumaa he wɔ Yerusalem ne? Ná ɛwa bɔ ɔwale ne, nnaa ɔwale kyɛ ɔbaahye bɛ kɔma sɔfo mbanyi nemɔ?” <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Nakoso Saul nyane anwoserɛ pee, ná ɔmaa Yudafoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Damasko ne nwo dwirili bɛ, ofikyɛ ɔmaa enu lale berɛ paa kyɛ, Yesu yeɛ ole Kristo ne.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Ngyẽa biemɔ si ne, Yudafoɛ nemɔ bɔle porɛ kyɛ bɛkɔhu ye. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Nakoso, Saul nwuni porɛ bɔ babɔ ne. Né bɛtetɛ ye wɔ atee nemɔ noa eyia ne kɔngɔen, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a bekonya ye bɛkɔhu ye. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Nakoso ye asuafoɛ nemɔ fale ye siele kɛndɛn nu kɔngɔen, na bɛdwurale ye bɛfale bɔen bie bɔ ɔla fasue nanwo nanu.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Mmerɛ bɔ ɔwale Yerusalem ne, ɔbɔle mmɔden kyɛ ɔkɔfa ye nwo kɔbɔ asuafoɛ nemɔ, nakoso ne bɛsuro ye, ofikyɛ né bennɛ benni kyɛ waayɛ suaniɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Nakoso Barnaba fale ye hɔle asomafoɛ nemɔ berɛ, na ɔmaa bɛnwuni kyɛbɔ onwuni Awurade wɔ atee naso, ná ɔne ye dwudwole, ɔne kyɛbɔ ɔfale akukuduro hane Yesu nwo dwirɛ wɔ Damasko ne. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Yeti ɔne bɛ tenane berɛ, na Yerusalem de, né ɔkora kɔ nekaa biala, na né ɔkora fa akukuduro dwudwo wɔ Awurade dumaa nu. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Ɔne Yudafoɛ bɔ bɛka Greek dwudwolɛ ne dwudwole, na ɔne bɛ suli aporowaa, yeti né bɛpena ye bɛku ye. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Mmerɛ bɔ aliemaa nemɔ nwuni ye sɔ ne, bɛfale ye bɛwale Kaesarea, na bɛmaa ɔhɔle Tarsus.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Na asafo ahoroɛ bɔ ɔwɔ Yudea, Galilea ne Samaria ne nyane asomdwie, na bɛyɛle se; na mmerɛ bɔ bɛnate Awurade suronyi ne honhom krongron né awerɛkyekye nu ne, bɛ dodoɔ ne hɔle anyunu.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Mmerɛ bɔ Petro kyini sɔ mandam nanu ne, ɔhɔle akrongronfoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Lida ne berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Ɛberɛ yeɛ onwuni biaa bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Aeneas. Né wabubu, yeti ne wala neka-horɛ afoɛ mmɔtwɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Petro ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Aeneas, Yesu Kristo asa wɔ anwonyerɛ. Dwɔso, na sɛ wɔ bɛen ne.” Na ɛberɛ ala ɔdwɔsole. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Na mmerɛ bɔ bɛ bɔ bɛte Lida ne Saron né nwuni ye ne, bɛsakrale bɛwale Awurade berɛ.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Né suaniɛ bie wɔ Yopa bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Tabita, bɔ yebo kyire “Dorkas.” Né sɔ maame he yɛ nyumaa pa, na né ɔyɛ adɔyɛ paa. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Nakoso sɔ mmerɛ nanu ne, anwonyerɛ bɔle ye maa owuli. Yeti bɛbiale ye, na bɛfale ye bɛtole aborosaen sua bie nu. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Né Lida pingye Yopa, yeti mmerɛ bɔ asuafoɛ nemɔ tele kyɛ Petro wɔ Lida ne, bɛsomane mmenia nyɔ maa bɛɛsrɛle ye kyɛ: “Yɛsrɛ wɔ, bra wa kesaalae.” <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Yeti Petro dwɔsole, na ɔne bɛ hɔle. Mmerɛ bɔ odwuli berɛ ne, bɛfale ye bɛhɔle aborosaen naso. Ná akunafoɛ namukoraati fale esue wale ye nwo berɛ, na ndadeɛ ne ɛtena bɔ Dorkas yɛle, mmerɛ bɔ ne ɔte ase ne, bɛfale pee bɛhyirele ye. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Petro maa ebiala fitele, na obuli ndwerɛ bɔle mbaeɛ. Afei ɔkakyile ye nwo hyirele fuin ne, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Tabita, dwɔso!” Ná ɔtele ye nye, na mmerɛ bɔ onwuni Petro ne, odwɔso tenane berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Yeti Petro sɔle ye sa nu maa ɔdwɔso gyinane berɛ. Ná ɔfrɛle akrongronfoɛ ne akunafoɛ nemɔ, na ɔfale ye mane bɛ, bɔ ne ɔte ase ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Edwirɛ he trɛ hɔle Yopa kuro nanu mukoraati, na mmeni pee nyane gyidie wɔ Awurade nu. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Ná Petro tenane Yopa kaa, né ɔte Simon bɔ ɔfa ngaka nwomaa yɛ nningyein né awuro.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Né biaa bie wɔ Kaesarea bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Kornelio, né ɔte sogyaniɛ panyi wɔ kue bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Italy sogyafoɛ nanu. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Né ɔne ye awurofoɛ mva bɛ som nni angorɛ, na ne bɛsuro Nyameɛ; né ɔyɛ adɔyɛ paa, na daa biala né ɔbɔ Nyameɛ mbaeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Ɛlɛho yia bie, mmerɛ bɔ ne wabɔ kɔyɛ 3:00<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">3:00 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ne te dɔnhwere bɔ ɔtɔ so ngona.</char></note> ne, onyane anisoadehu, na onwuni Nyameɛ abɔfo pefee wɔ ye berɛ, yeɛ abɔfo ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Kornelio!” <verse eid="ACT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Na Kornelio naene ye haa, né osuro, na obisale ye kyɛ: “Me wura, nzu ane?” Abɔfo ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Wɔ mbaeɛ ne wɔ adɔyɛ namukoraati adwu Nyameɛ nyunu, na ɔkaye ye mukoraati. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Yeti soma mmenia ma bɛhɔ Yopa, ná bɛɛfrɛ Simon bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Petro ne. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Sɔ biaa he wɔ Simon bɔ ɔfa ngaka nwomaa yɛ nningyein ne awuro, ná ye awuro ne wɔ ɛpo ne noa.” <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Abɔfo bɔ ɔne ye dwudwole ne hɔle nala pɛ, Kornelio frɛle ye ngoaa nanu nyɔ, yeɛ sogyaniɛ kõ bɔ osuro Nyameɛ, <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />na ɔhane bɔ wasi namukoraati hyirele bɛ, yeɛ ɔsomane bɛ maa bɛhɔle Yopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Aleɛ hene ne, mmerɛ bɔ bɛnate atee so bɔ né waha kaa maa bɛdwu kuro nanu ne, Petro hɔle sua ne ti afia kyɛ ɔkwaabɔ mbaeɛ, ne wabɔ kɔyɛ eyia 12:00.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">12:00 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ne te dɔnhwere bɔ ɔtɔ so nzia.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Ɛhɔen huni ye, yeti né ɔpena aleɛ di. Na mmerɛ bɔ bɛguso bɛyɛ aleɛ ne, nikye tɔle ye so.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Onyane anisoadehu.”</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Onwuni kyɛ anwuro abukye, ná onwuni nikye bie, né wayɛ kyɛ ɛtena kandinga bɔ basosɔ ye noa nná nanu, ná bɛyakyi nu maa ofi anwuro ba ase. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Né keka biala bie wɔ nu, aseɛ he aso ngaka bɔ bɛ gya nná, ngaka bɔ bɛkõngõ, ne ewienu nnomaa mukoraati. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Yeɛ konviɛ bie ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Petro, dwɔso, na ku bie di!” <verse eid="ACT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Nakoso Petro hane kyɛ: “Awurade, ɛhe de ongosi lle; ofikyɛ akyiwadeɛ ne nikye bɔ ye nwo nde de, nnili bie lle.” <verse eid="ACT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Yeɛ konviɛ ne sa ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nningyein bɔ Nyameɛ ate ye nwo ne, nnɛka kyɛ ye nwo nde.” <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Konviɛ ne sa wale ye pɛn nza so, na ɛberɛ ala, bɛfale sɔ nikye ne bɛhɔle anwuro.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Mmerɛ bɔ Petro gu so ɔdwene bɔ anisoadehu ne kyire nanwo ne, né mmenia bɔ Kornelio asoma bɛ ne apena Simon awuro ne alaa banwu ye, na né bɛgyi anoa ne si berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Ná bɛteane nu bɛbisale kyɛ, Simon bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Petro ne wɔ berɛ a. <verse eid="ACT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Petro gu so ɔdwene anisoadehu nanwo ne, honhom ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nea, mmenia nza bie pena wɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Yeti dwɔso, dwu ase, na ɛne bɛ hɔ; nnɛmaa w'adwene nu yɛ wɔ nnaa, ofikyɛ me yeɛ masoma bɛ ɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Yeti Petro hɔle mmrienzua nemɔ berɛ wɔ aseɛ nwo dɔ, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Sona bɔ ɛmɔpena ye ne ɛhe. Ɛwa de, ɛmɔ amaneɛ?” <verse eid="ACT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Bɛhane kyɛ: “Kornelio te sogyaniɛ panyi bɔ ɔtengyɛ na osuro Nyameɛ, ná Yuda maen namukoraati ka ye nwo dwirɛ pa. Ná abɔfo krongron bie fale akwankyerɛ fili Nyameɛ dɔ brɛle ye kyɛ, ɔma bɛɛfrɛ wɔ bɛbra ye awuro, ná otie bɔ ɛle ye ka ɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Yeti, ɔmaa bɛɛtenane ye berɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Na aleɛ hene ne, ɔdwɔsole, na ɔne bɛ hɔle. Ná aliemaa mɔ bɔ bɛwɔ Yopa ne bie ne ye hɔle. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Ná kyẽa bɔ ole berɛ ne, bɛdwuli Kaesarea. Né Kornelio nea bɛ atee, na né wafrɛ ye abusuafoɛ ne ye nnamvo mukoraati. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Petro dwuli berɛ nala pɛ, Kornelio yiale ye, na obuli ndwerɛ wɔ ye gya bo kotole ye. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Nakoso Petro sɔle ye nu mane ye so, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Dwɔso, me koso, nde sona kyɛ wɔ ala!” <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Mmerɛ bɔ ɔne bɛbɔ ngɔmmɔ ne, owurale awuro berɛ, ná onwuni kyɛ mmenia pee ayia berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔse ye paa kyɛ, mmeraa mma atee kyɛ Yudaniɛ kɔfa ye nwo kɔbɔ ebie bɔ ofi maen foforɛ so, anaa okopingye ye po; nakoso Nyameɛ amaa manwu ye kyɛ, nnɛmaa meka kyɛ sona bie nwo nde, anaa ye nwo agua fiɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Yeti mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔ frɛle me kyɛ mmra ne, mambopo me ti koraa. Ɛhene ati mepena kyɛ menwu bɔ yeti yeɛ ɛmɔ frɛle me ne.”<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Yeɛ Kornelio hane kyɛ: “Ɛlɛnna ɛhe, kɔyɛ kyɛ sɔ mmerɛ he ala, né mebɔ mbaeɛ wɔ m'awuro berɛ kɔyɛ eyia 3:00,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">3:00 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ne te dɔnhwere bɔ ɔtɔ so ngona.</char></note> na brienzua bie bɔ owura atadeɛ fufue hyɛnn oogyinane me nyunu berɛ, <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: ‘Kornelio, Nyameɛ ate wɔ mbaeɛ ne, na wakaye adɔyɛ bɔ ɛyɛ ne. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Yeti maa bɛhɔ Yopa, ná bɛɛfrɛ Simon bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Petro ne bɛbra. Sɔ biaa he wɔ Simon bɔ ɔfa ngaka nwomaa yɛ nningyein ne awuro, na ye awuro ne wɔ ɛpo ne noa.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Na ɛberɛ ala yeɛ nzomane kyɛ bɛɛfrɛ wɔ, yeɛ wɔ koso awa ne oo. Yeti, yɛ mukoraati yayia nu wɔ Nyameɛ nyunu, kyɛ yɛbaatie bɔ Awurade afa ama wɔ kyɛ ɛha hyire yɛ ne.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Na Petro hyɛle yebo kyɛ odwudwo, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Bekye bɔ manwu ye paa kyɛ, Nyameɛ nyeye mmenia nu, <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />mmom maen biala nu ne, ebiala bɔ osuro ye, na ɔyɛ bɔ okuro ne, odɛ́ ye to nu. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Nyameɛ fale ye dwirɛ mane Israel mmaa nemɔ, na ɔhane asomdwie bɔ ɔnate Yesu Kristo so nanwo nzɛmba, sɔ Yesu he yeɛ ɔte yɛ mukoraati Awurade ne. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Ɛmɔ bɔbɔ ɛmɔse edwirɛ bɔ bɛhane ye wɔ Yudea mukoraati ne, bɛhyɛle yebo bɛhane sɔ dwirɛ ne wɔ Galilea, mmerɛ bɔ Yohane hane asubɔ nwo dwirɛ yiele ne. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Sɔ dwirɛ ne fa Yesu bɔ ofi Nazerɛt nanwo. Kyɛbɔ Nyameɛ fale honhom krongron ne tumi srale ye, ná ohyinini aseɛ naso mukoraati yɛle pa, ná ɔsale bɛ bɔ Abɔnzam hyɛ ne so ne anwonyerɛ ne, ɔyɛle sɔ nningyein ofikyɛ né Nyameɛ boka ye so. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Na nningyein bɔ ɔyɛle ye wɔ Yudafoɛ maen nemɔ nu, ne Yerusalem mukoraati ne, yɛte ye nwo adanzefoɛ. Nakoso bɛbɔle ye asɛnnua nu bɛhuni. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Na ye ɛlɛsa so ne, Nyameɛ tingyele ye, ná ɔmaa ɔyele ye nwo ali, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />nakoso nná ebiala yeɛ ɔyele ye nwo ali hyirele ye ɔ, mmom ɔyele ye nwo ali hyirele bɛ bɔ Nyameɛ limoa yele bɛ kyɛ adanzefoɛ ne, na ɛhene yeɛ ole yɛ bɔ ye tingyele ne si ne, yɛne ye didili na yɛnone ne. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Na ɔhyɛle yɛ kyɛ yɛha nzɛmba ne yɛhyire ebiala, na yɛli adanzeɛ fekɔ-fekɔ kyɛ, ye yeɛ Nyameɛ aye ye kyɛ obu ateasefoɛ ne awufo atɛn ne. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Ye yeɛ adiifoɛ namukoraati lili ye nwo adanzeɛ kyɛ, ebiala bɔ okonya ye nu gyidie ne konya bɔne-fakyɛ wɔ ye dumaa nu ne.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Petro gu so odwudwo ne, honhom krongron ne wale mmenia bɔ betie ye namukoraati so. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Na ɔyɛle gyidifoɛ bɔ bapɛ bɛ toa bɔ bɛne Petro wale ne nwanwa kyɛ, bahwie honhom krongron akyɛdeɛ ne bagua maen-maen nanufoɛ naso ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Na bɛtele kyɛ bɛka dwudwolɛ foforɛ bɛye Nyameɛ ayɛ. Yeɛ Petro hane kyɛ: <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Sɔ mmenia hemɔ anya honhom krongron ne te kyɛ yala, yeti ebie kɔhora kosi yɛ atee kyɛ nnɛmaa yɛfa nzue yɛbɔ bɛ asu anaa?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Yeti ɔmaa bɛbɔle bɛ asu wɔ Yesu Kristo dumaa nu. Ná bɛsrɛle ye kyɛ ɔtena bɛ nwo berɛ kaa.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Afei asomafoɛ ne aliemaa mɔ bɔ bɛwɔ Yudea ne tele kyɛ, maen-maen nanufoɛ ne koso alɛ́ Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Petro sa wale Yerusalem ne, bɛ bɔ basɔ toa pɛlɛ nu twann ne né ye nyane dwudwolɛ, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />na bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ ɛhɔle bɛ bɔ bɛpɛlle bɛ toa ne awuro, ná ɛne bɛdidili ɔ?” <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Yeti, Petro hyɛle yebo hane bɔ ɔhɔle so namukoraati hyirele bɛ kyɛ: <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Né nwɔ Yopa kuro nanu mebɔ mbaeɛ, yeɛ nyane anisoadehu ɔ; ná nwuni nikye bie wɔ me nye so te kyɛ ɛtena kandinga bɔ basosɔ ye noa nná nanu bɛyakyi nu maa ofi anwuro ba ase, na ɔwale me nwo berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Mmerɛ bɔ nneane ye yé ne, nwuni aseɛ he aso ngaka bɔ bɛ gya nná, ngaka bɔ bɛ nwo yɛ suro, ngaka bɔ bɛkõngõ, ɔne ewienu nnomaa wɔ nu. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Yeɛ ndele kyɛ konviɛ bie ka kyire me kyɛ: ‘Petro, dwɔso, na ku bie di!’ <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Nakoso ngane kyɛ: ‘Awurade, ɛhe de ongosi lle; ofikyɛ akyiwadeɛ ne nikye bɔ ye nwo nde de, ebie hɔlle me noa nu lle.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Yeɛ konviɛ ne fili anwuro ha hyirele me pɛn nyɔ so kyɛ: ‘Nningyein bɔ Nyameɛ ate ye nwo ne, nnɛka kyɛ ye nwo nde.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Ɛhe sili pɛn nza, na bɛfale nikye biala bɛhɔle anwuro. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Sɔ mmerɛ nala, né mmrienzua nza bie gyi awuro bɔ nde nu ne nyunu, na né basoma bɛ bafi Kaesarea kyɛ bɛbra me berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Yeɛ honhom ne ha hyirele me kyɛ, mene bɛ hɔ, na nnɛmaa me maa m'adwene nu yɛ me nnaa. Ná aliemaa nzia hemɔ koso ne me hɔle, na yɛhɔle biaa ne awuro berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Ye koso, ɔhane kyɛbɔ onwuni abɔfo wɔ ye awuro berɛ, ná abɔfo ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: ‘Soma mmenia ma bɛhɔ Yopa, na bɛɛfrɛ Simon bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Petro ne bɛbra, <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />na ɔkɔmaa ɛne w'awurofoɛ mukoraati konwu bɔ ɛmɔyɛ a, ɛmɔ konya ngoa ɔ.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Nhyɛle yebo kyɛ me dwudwo nala, honhom krongron ne wale bɛ so, kyɛbɔ ahyɛaseɛ ne, ɔwale yɛ so nala. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Ɛberɛ ala, ngayele edwirɛ bɔ ne Awurade taa ka ne, né ɔtaa ka kyɛ: ‘Nzue yeɛ Yohane fa bɔle asu ɔ, na ɛmɔ de, honhom krongron yeɛ bɛkɔfa bɛkɔbɔ ɛmɔ asu ɔ.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Ná honhom krongron bɔ Nyameɛ fa kyɛ mbaen, bɔ ɔmane yɛ bie mmerɛ bɔ yɛnyane gyidie wɔ Awurade Yesu Kristo nu ne, sɛ wama bɛ sɔ akyɛdeɛ ne bie a, me yeɛ nne nwa, bɔ ngɔhora ngosi Nyameɛ atee ɔ?” <verse eid="ACT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛtele ɛhe ne, ebiala andwudwo kõ, na bɛhyɛle Nyameɛ anuonyam kyɛ: “Ye de, Nyameɛ ama maen-maen nanufoɛ atee kyɛ, bɛkɔhora bɛkɔsakra b'adwene, ná banya daa ngoa.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Afei bɛ bɔ bɛnwatili, ɔnate amaneɛ bɔ ɔwale asuafoɛ nemɔ so wɔ Steven wue si ne, bɛhɔle alaa bɛɛfitele Foinike, Kipro ne Antiokia. Nakoso Yudafoɛ ngome yeɛ né bɛka edwirɛ ne bɛkyire bɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Nakoso, Kipro ne Kirenfoɛ bɔ ne bɛboka bɛ so nanu biemɔ wale Antiokia, na bɛhyɛle yebo bɛne bɛ bɔ bɛka Greek né dwudwole, na bɛhane Awurade Yesu nwo nzɛmba ne bie bɛhyirele bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Né Awurade sa wɔ bɛ so, yeti bɛ nu pee nala yɛle gyidifoɛ, na bɛsakra bɛwale Awurade berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Asafo bɔ ɔwɔ Yerusalem ne tele bɛ nwo dwirɛ, yeti bɛsomane Barnaba maa ɔhɔle Antiokia. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Mmerɛ bɔ odwuli berɛ, na onwuni Nyameɛ adom ne, ye nye gyele paa, na ɔhyɛle bɛ mukoraati nguraen kyɛ bɛsi b'adwene pi, na bɛbata Awurade nwo. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Né Barnaba te sona pa, né honhom krongron wɔ ye so, afei né ole gyidie. Yeti mmeni pee nyane gyidie wɔ Awurade nu. <verse eid="ACT 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Ná ɔhɔle Tarsus ɔɔpenane Saul paa, <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />mmerɛ bɔ onwuni ye ne, ɔne ye wale Antiokia. Yeti afoɛ kõ mua yeɛ bɛne bɛ yiale nu wɔ asafo nanu ɔ. Ná Antiokia yeɛ ole nekaa bɔ oli moa bɔ (Nyameɛ maa) bɛfrɛle asuafoɛ nemɔ Kristofoɛ ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, adiifoɛ biemɔ fili Yerusalem wale Antiokia. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Ná bɛ nu kõ bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Agabus dwɔso gyinane, na ɔnate honhom naso hyɛle ngɔm kyɛ, ɛhɔen kandinga bie baawa wiase mukoraati, na amba, sɔ dwirɛ ne wale nu wɔ Klaudio aberɛ so. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Yeti, asuafoɛ nemɔ yɛle b'adwene kyɛ, bɔ ebiala konya ye biala, ɔfa bra ná bɛfa bɛɛboka aliemaa mɔ bɔ bɛwɔ Yudea ne. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Ná bɛyɛle sɔ, yeti bɛfa bɛsomane Barnaba ne Saul maa bɛfa bɛɛmane mbanyi nemɔ.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, Ɔhene Herode hyɛle yebo yɛle asafo nanufoɛ biemɔ ayayade. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Ɔfale dadeɛ huni Yohane aliema Yakobo. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Onwuni kyɛ Yudafoɛ ne nye agye bɔ wayɛ nanwo ne, ɔhyele Petro koso. Sɔ mmerɛ ne, né bɛdi Paanoo bɔ Yiste nne nu afahyɛ ne. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Ɔhyele ye ne, ɔfale ye tole prizin ne, ná sogyafoɛ kue nná yeɛ ne bɛnea ye so ɔ; kue biala nu ne, sogyafoɛ nná yeɛ bɛwɔ nu ɔ. Sɛ kue he fi berɛ a, né foforɛ awa. Né Herode ayɛ ye adwene kyɛ, Pɛnu afahyɛ ne si ne, ɔkɔye ye maa okoogyina mmenia ne nyunu. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Yeti né Petro la prizin, nakoso ne asafo ne bɔ Nyameɛ mbaeɛ ma ye paa.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Kɔngɔen bɔ aleɛ kye a, né Herode ayɛ ye adwene kyɛ ɔkɔye Petro ne, né Petro la sogyafoɛ nyɔ afia, na né bafa kyenyi bakyekye ye sa nyɔ namu. Né sogyafoɛ nyɔ gyi anoa ne nyunu bɔ bɛbɔ prizin nanwo waen ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Komapɛ, Awurade bɔfo wale prizin berɛ, na kanea tale ɛberɛ mukoraati hyireinn. Na abɔfo ne bɔle Petro mvenu tingyele ye, yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Dwɔso ndɛ-ndɛ.” Ná kyenyi ne fili ye sa guale ase. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Yeɛ abɔfo ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Wuro-wura wɔ nwo, na wura wɔ mmaboa.” Ɔyɛle sɔ, na abɔfo ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Fa atadeɛ bɔ ogua wɔ so ne wura, na di me si.” <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Yeti Petro lili ye si maa bɛfitele, nakoso né ɔnze kyɛ bɔ abɔfo ne yɛ ne, ɔte nikye deinn bɔ ɔkɔso ɔ. Né y'adwene yɛ ye kyɛ, onya anisoadehu bie. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Bɛpɛle nu wɔ nekaa bɔ sogyafoɛ bɔ bɛli moa ne bɛ bɔ bɛtɔso nyɔ ne gyi ne, ná mmerɛ bɛ bɛdwuli buralɛ anoa bɔ ɔkɔ kuro nanu nanwo ne, anoa ne bɔbɔ bukye mane bɛ. Ná bɛfite bɛfale atee naso kaa ne, abɔfo ne yakyile ye berɛ hɔle. <verse eid="ACT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Ɛberɛ yeɛ Petro nye wale ye nwo so ɔ, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Bekye bɔ manwu kyɛ, Awurade yeɛ ɔsomane ye abɔfo kyɛ oole me fi Herode sa nu, ná ɔye me fi nikye biala bɔ né Yudafoɛ ne nea atee nanu ɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Onwuni ye sɔ ne, ɔhɔle Yohane bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Marko né maame Mary awuro, ɛberɛ yeɛ né mmeni pee ayia nu bɛbɔ mbaeɛ ne. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Mmerɛ bɔ ɔbɔle aluo berɛ anoa nanu ne, abaawa bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Roda wale berɛ kyɛ ɔbaanea sona-horɛ. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Mmerɛ bɔ ɔtele Petro konvi ne, ye nye gyele pa-pa, yeti wammukye anoa ne po; osa hɔle awuro dɔ ɔɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Petro gyi anoa ne si dɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Gyemia abɔ laen.” Nakoso, ɔhɔle so ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ ɔte nahorɛ, yeti bɛhane kyɛ: “Ɔte ye abɔfo.” <verse eid="ACT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Nakoso, né Petro tɛ́ bɔ anoa nanu, na mmerɛ bɔ bɛbukyele, na bɛnwuni ye ne, bɛ nwo dwirili bɛ pa-pa. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Nakoso ɔfale ye sa yɛle nzɛngyerɛneɛ hyirele bɛ kyɛ bɛyɛ konn, na ɔhane kyɛbɔ Awurade yele ye fili prizin ne hyirele bɛ. Na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔɔha ɛhe behyire Yakobo ne aliemaa nemɔ.” Na ofili berɛ hɔle nekaa foforɛ.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Aleɛ hene ne, né sogyafoɛ ne nnwu nekaa bɔ Petro afa ɔ, yeti né bɛnwu bɔ bɛyɛ bɛ nwo ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Herode penane ye wɔ bɔen biala nu, na mmerɛ bɔ wannwu ye ne, obisale sogyafoɛ nemɔ bɔ osili ɔ. Afei ɔhyɛle kyɛ bɛhu bɛ.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bɛhwe bɛ so.”</char></note> Na ye de, ofili Yudea hɔle Kaesarea ɔɔtenane dɔ kaa.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Afei de, ne Herode afɛ Tiro ne Sidonfoɛ naso yaa paa. Yeti, bɛ mukoraati bɛyɛle kõ bɛwale ye berɛ, na bɛsrɛle Blasto bɔ ɔnea ɔhene awuro naso né kyɛ, ɔha bie ma bɛ ma asomdwie bra, ofikyɛ ɔhene yeɛ ɔma bɛ maen né aleɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Kyẽa titire bie dwuli, ná Herode wurale ye ahemvo atadeɛ, ɔtenane ye atemmuo bia so, yeɛ ɔhyɛle yebo kyɛ odwudwo kyire mmenia ne. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Na mmenia ne hyɛle yebo teɛteane nu kyɛ: “Ɛhe de ɔtte sona konvi, ɔte nyameɛ bie konvi!” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Ɛberɛ ala, Awurade bɔfo bɔle ye, ná ɔlɔle ngaka wuli, ofikyɛ wamva anuonyam né wamma Nyameɛ.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Nakoso Awurade dwirɛ ne trɛle paa, na mmeni pee lɛ lili.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Mmerɛ bɔ Barnaba ne Saul yiele adwuma bɔ bɛɛyɛle ye wɔ Yerusalem ne, besa bɛwale, bɛba ne, bɛne Yohane bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Marko ne yeɛ bɛwale ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Né adiifoɛ ne akyerɛkyerɛfoɛ wɔ Antiokia asafo nanu. Bɛ yeɛ ole: Barnaba, Simeon bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Niger ne, Lukios bɔ ofi Kiren ne, Manaen, (bɔ ɔne amrado Herode fi nu ne) yeɛ Saul. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛsõ Awurade, na bɛyɛ akɔngyere ne, honhom krongron ne hane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔye Barnaba ne Saul bɛma me, ná bɛɛyɛ adwuma bɔ yeti mvrɛle bɛ ne.” <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Yeti, bɛyɛle akɔngyere na bɛbɔle mbaeɛ beyiele ne, bɛfale bɛ sa bɛguale bɛ so, na bɛguale bɛ atee maa bɛhɔle.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Yeti, Barnaba ne Paul bɔ honhom krongron asoma bɛ ne hɔle Seleukia, bɛfili berɛ ne, bɛfale hyep bɛhɔle Kipro. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Bɛdwuli Salamis ne, bɛhyɛle yebo kyɛ bɛka Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne wɔ Yudafoɛ sua bɔ beyia nu nanu. Né Yohane boka-boka bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Bɛfale supɔ naso mukoraati bɛɛdwuli Pafos ne, bɛnwuni Yudaniɛ bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Bar-Yesu, né ɔyɛ magyek, na ne ɔte ngondombo diifoɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Né sɔ biaa he ne Sergio Paul, bɔ ɔte mandam né amrado ne yeɛ bɛwɔ berɛ ɔ. Né Sergio Paul te ebie bɔ ye adwene nu la berɛ paa. Ɔfrɛle Barnaba ne Saul wale ye berɛ, na né ye nye aboro paa bɔ ɔpena kyɛ otie Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Nakoso Elima bɔ ɔyɛ magyek (sɔ yeɛ né ye dumaa ne bo kyire ɔ) ne hyɛle yebo sili bɛ atee, na ɔbɔle mmɔden kyɛ ɔkɔhwe amrado ne kofi gyidie nanwo. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Na honhom krongron wale Saul bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Paul naso, na ɔneane Elima haa, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Wɔ bɔ asisie mukoraati wɔ wɔ nu, Abɔnzam awa, tenenee mukoraati tamfo, ɛngɔyakyi Awurade tenenee atee bɔ ɛkyea ye ne? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Nea, kesaalae Awurade sa wɔ wɔ so, na wɔ nye kosi, na mmerɛ bie kɔpɛ bɔ ɛngonwu eyia ɔ.” Na ɛberɛ ala, ye nye so yɛle ye tumm, bɔ ne onwu hwee. Ná ne ɔfa ye sa fuefua pena ebie bɔ ɔkɔsɔ ye sa nu kohyire ye atee ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Amrado ne nwuni bɔ wasi ne, ɛberɛ ala, ɔyɛle gyidiniɛ, ofikyɛ Awurade ngyerɛkyerɛ ne maa ye nwo dwirili ye paa.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Paul ne ye mmango nemɔ fale ɛpo so fili Pafos wale Perga bɔ ɔwɔ Pamfilia ne. Bɛdwuli berɛ ne, Yohane yakyile bɛ berɛ sa hɔle Yerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Nakoso bɛ de, bɛfili Perga bɛwale Antiokia bɔ ɔwɔ Pisidia ne. Na homeda ne, bɛhɔle sua bɔ beyia nu nanu bɛɛtenane ase. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Bɛkengale Mmeraa ne Adiifoɛ nemɔ nwomaa ne bɛyiele ne, mbanyi bɔ bɛwɔ sua nanu ne maa bɛha bɛhyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Aliemaa mɔ, sɛ ɛmɔle edwirɛ bie bɔ ɛmɔkɔha bɛkɔhyɛ mmenia ne nguraen a, ɛmɔha.” <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Yeti Paul dwɔsole, na ɔfale ye sa yɛle nzɛngyerɛneɛ hyirele bɛ, yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:16">“Israelfoɛ ne maen-maen nanufoɛ bɔ ɛmɔsuro Nyameɛ, ɛmɔtie me. <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Israel maen né Nyameɛ yele yɛ nana mɔ, na mmerɛ bɔ né bɛte ɛwɔfoɛ wɔ Egypt ne, ɔmane bɛ so, na ɔfale ye sa bɔ wama so ne yele bɛ fili berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Na onyane bɛ nwo aboterɛ wɔ ɛserɛ naso kɔyɛ afoɛ 40. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Mmerɛ bɔ ɔsɛkyele maen nzoo wɔ Kanaan aseɛ naso ne, ɔfale b'aseɛ ne mane bɛ kyɛ b'agyapadeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Ɛhe mukoraati hɔle wɔ afoɛ 450 nanu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">“Ɛhene si ne, ɔmane bɛ atemmufoɛ tonn oodwuli diifoɛ Samuel so. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Nakoso yesi ne, bɛhane kyɛ behia ɔhene, ná Nyameɛ fale Kis awa Saul bɔ ofi Bengyamin abusua nu ne mane bɛ, na olili bɛ so afoɛ 40. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Otuli ye ne, ɔfale David mane bɛ kyɛ ɔhene, na olili ye nwo adanzeɛ kyɛ: ‘Manwu Yese awa David, ɔte ebie bɔ m'ahone la ye so, na ɔkɔyɛ bɔ mekuro ɔ.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Kyɛbɔ Nyameɛ hyɛle bɔ ne, brienzua he bosoniɛ yeɛ ɔfale ye mane Israel kyɛ agyenkwa ɔ, na sɔ sona ne yeɛ ole Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Kora bɔ Yesu ba ne, Yohane ha hyirele Israelfoɛ mukoraati kyɛ, bɛbɔ asu bɛfa behyire kyɛ basakra b'adwene. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Nakoso Yohane baayie ye adwuma ne, ɔhane kyɛ: ‘Ɛmɔ adwene yɛ ɛmɔ kyɛ me yeɛ nne nwa? Nná me yeɛ nne Ye. Nakoso ɛmɔnea, ebie li me si ɔba, na ye gya bo mmaboa po, menvata kyɛ me sangye.’<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />“Aliemaa mɔ, Abraham bosofoɛ, ne ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔ aha bɔ ɛmɔsuro Nyameɛ, bafa edwirɛ bɔ ɔkɔmaa yekonya ngoa ne ba berɛ yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Yerusalemfoɛ ne bɛ mbanyi nemɔ de, bannwu ye, na mmerɛ bɔ bɛbu ye atɛn ne, edwirɛ bɔ adiifoɛ nemɔ hane, bɔ bɛkenga ye homeda biala ne, bɛmaa ɔwale nu. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Ɔwɔ nu, né edwirɛ biala nne ye nwo bɔ né odikyɛ begyina so bɛku ye ɔ, nakoso bɛha bɛhyirele Pilato kyɛ ohu ye. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Na beyiele bɔ bahworɔ bafa ye nwo namukoraati ne, bɛyele ye bɛfili bakaa naso, na bɛfale ye bɛtole kumaa nu. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Nakoso Nyameɛ tingyele ye fili ewue nu, <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />na ɔfale ngyẽa pee yele ye nwo ali hyirele bɛ bɔ bɛne ye fili Galilea hɔle Yerusalem ne. Na ɛhemɔ yeɛ kesaalae, bɛdi ye nwo adanzeɛ bɛkyire mmenia ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Yeti yɛ de, bɔ Nyameɛ fa hyɛle yɛ nana mɔ bɔ ne, ɛhene nwo nzɛmba yeɛ yɛka yɛ kyire ɛmɔ ne. <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />Na yɛ bɔ yɛte bɛ mmaa mɔ ne, Nyameɛ atingye Yesu amaa sɔ bɔhyɛ ne awa nu ama yɛ. Na sɔ ala yeɛ bahworɔ ye wɔ edwein bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ nanu ɔ; bahworɔ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">‘Ɛte mma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">na ɛnɛ me koso, mayɛ wɔ baba.’<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, Nyameɛ tingyele ye fili awufo nu, na ongosi lle kyɛ okosa kɔhɔ tebea bɔ ɔkɔmaa ɔkɔporɔ nu; waha ɛhe nwo dwirɛ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">‘Ɔdɔ bɔ onni hwamɔ bɔ nhyɛle David bɔ, kyɛ ngɔla ye ali ngohyire ye ne, ngɔfa ngɔma wɔ. Na kyɛbɔ ɔte biala ne, ɔkɔwa nu.’<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Na waha ye wɔ edwein foforɛ nu kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">‘Bɔ odi nahorɛ ma wɔ ne, ɛngɔma ɔngɔporɔ.’<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />David de, ɔsõne Nyameɛ wɔ ye aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ nu, na owuli maa bɛsiele ye bɛbokale ye baba mɔ so, na ɔporɔle. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Nakoso, bɔ Nyameɛ tingyele ye ne de, wamborɔ. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Yeti aliemaa mɔ, yɛpena kyɛ ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ, yɛnate yeso yeɛ yɛka bɔne-fakyɛ nwo dwirɛ yɛkyire ɛmɔ ne, <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />na nningyein bɔ Mose mmeraa nati, né ɛmɔdi ye nwo fɔ ne, ebiala bɔ okonya gyidie ne, bɛnate ye so bɛkobu ye bem wɔ ye nwo. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Yeti ɛmɔnea yé, ná bɔ baha ye wɔ adiifoɛ nemɔ nu ne, wamma ɛmɔ so. <verse eid="ACT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />Bɛhane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">‘Ɛmɔtie, ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔgoro mmenia nwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">ɛmɔma ɔyɛ ɛmɔ nwanwa ná ɛmɔtu bɛmini;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">ofikyɛ meyɛ adwuma bie wɔ ɛmɔ aberɛ so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">sɔ adwuma ne, sɛ ebie ka kyire ɛmɔ po a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">ɛmɔ ngole ngoli.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Ná Paul ne Barnaba fí sua nanu kɔ ne, mmenia ne srɛle bɛ kyɛ, homeda bieku, besa bɛbra, ná bɛɛha sɔ dwirɛ ne bieku behyire bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Bɛ pɔnone ne, Yudafoɛ ne bɛ bɔ basakra baayɛ Yudafoɛ bɔ bɛsõ Nyameɛ nanu pee lili Paul ne Barnaba si. Ná bɛne bɛ dwudwole, yeɛ bɛhyɛle bɛ nguraen kyɛ, bɛhɔ so bɛtena Nyameɛ adom nanu.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Na homeda bɔ oli berɛ ne, kuro nanufoɛ pee yiale nu kyɛ bɛbaatie Awurade dwirɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Nakoso Yudafoɛ nemɔ nwuni mmeni lɔen ne, né ɔyɛ bɛ yea, yeti bɛhyɛle yebo bɛkekane mmusue dwirɛ bɛfa bɛbɔle Paul dwirɛ ne bɛguale. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Na Paul ne Barnaba fale akukuduro ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ yeɛ ne odikyɛ bɛdi moa bɛka Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne bɛkyire ɛmɔ ɔ. Nakoso ɔnate kyɛ ɛmɔ apia bato nekaa bie, na ɛmɔbu ɛmɔ nwo kyɛ ɛmɔ mvata daa ngoa nati, yɛkɔ maen-maen nanufoɛ ne berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Ofikyɛ Awurade aha ahyire yɛ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">‘Maye wɔ kyɛ maen-maen nanufoɛ né kanea,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ekole bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ aseɛ ne noa dɔ ne ngoa ɔ.’”<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Maen-maen nanufoɛ ne tele ɛhe ne, bɛhyɛle yebo bɛlili ahurusi, na bɛhyɛle Awurade dwirɛ ne anuonyam, ná bɛ bɔ bɛle ahone pa bɔ ɔkɔmaa bekonya daa ngoa ne yɛle gyidifoɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Afei koso, Awurade dwirɛ ne trɛ hɔle maen nanu mukoraati. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Nakoso Yudafoɛ nemɔ tutu guale mmrasua bɔ bɛsuro Nyameɛ, ná bɛle dumaa ne so anu, na bɛtutu bɛguale atitire bɔ bɛwɔ kuro nanu ne koso so anu maa bɛtuli bɛ nye bɛsiele Paul ne Barnaba so bɛfoane bɛ bɛfili b'aseɛ naso. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Na asomafoɛ nemɔ poro-porole bɛ gya bo mvuture bɛguale bɛ so, na bɛsili nu bɛhɔle Ikoniom. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Na asuafoɛ nemɔ nye gyele, na honhom krongron wale bɛ so.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Bɛdwuli Ikoniom ne, bɛhɔle Yudafoɛ sua bɔ beyia nu nanu, na kyɛbɔ bɛ dwudwole ne, ɔmaa Yudafoɛ ne Greekfoɛ pee yɛle gyidifoɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Nakoso Yudafoɛ bɔ banne banni ne tutu guale maen-maen nanufoɛ ne so anu, na bɛsɛkyele b'adwene maa benyane aliemaa nemɔ nwo adwemmɔne. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Yeti bɛhyɛle berɛ kaa, na Awurade mane bɛ tumi maa bɛfale akukuduro bɛ dwudwole. Na Nyameɛ maa bɛyɛle nzɛngyerɛneɛ ne anwanwadeɛ, na ɔnate so lili edwirɛ bɔ ɔfa ye adom nwo nanwo adanzeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Nakoso, mmenia nanu hyɛle nyɔ, né ebiemɔ ta Yudafoɛ ne si, yeɛ né bɛ ngaa ne koso ta asomafoɛ ne si. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Mmerɛ bɔ maen-maen nanufoɛ ne Yudafoɛ, ne b'atumvoɛ ne yɛle kyɛ bɛteetee bɛ, ná besi bɛ nyɔboɛ ne, <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />bɛnwuni ye. Yeti bɛnwati bɛhɔle Listra, Derbi, ne Likaonia nguro nemɔ nu, <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />na bɛtoale so bɛhane nzɛmba ne wɔ dɔ.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Né biaa bie te abafam wɔ Listra. Né ɔtaha ase bɔ ɔnatelle lle, ofikyɛ bɛwole ye ne, né wabubu. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Mmerɛ bɔ Paul dwudwo ne, ne biaa ne tie ye paa. Paul neane ye dinn, na onwuni kyɛ ole gyidie bɔ ɔkɔhora kɔmaa ye nwo kɔtɔ ye, <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />yeti ɔmane ye konvi so hane kyɛ: “Dwɔso gyina wɔ gya so.” Yeti biaa ne dwɔso gyinane berɛ, na ɔhyɛle yebo natele. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Mmerɛ bɔ mmenia ne nwuni bɔ Paul ayɛ ne, bɛfale Likaonia dwudwolɛ bɛteane nu kyɛ: “Nyameɛ nemɔ ayɛ bɛ nwo mmenia badwu bawa yɛ wa!” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Yeti bɛhyɛle yebo bɛfrɛle Barnaba Zeus, na bɛfrɛle Paul Hermes, ofikyɛ ye yeɛ ne odi anyunu dwudwo ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Yeti Zeus sɔfo bɔ ye asɔre sua wɔ kuro ne tiwaa ne fale nandwie ne flawa abotire wale anoa nanwo berɛ, ná ne ɔpena kyɛ ɔbɔ afɔleɛ wɔ mmenia nanu. <verse eid="ACT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Nakoso, mmerɛ bɔ asomafoɛ Barnaba ne Paul tele ye nwo dwirɛ ne, bɛsunzuale bɛ ndadeɛ nu, na bɛdwɔso bɛgyinane mmenia nanu bɛteane nu kyɛ: <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />“Mmrienzua, nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔyɛ ɛhe ɔ? Yɛ koso yɛte mmenia, na yɛdi mvomsoɛ kyɛ ɛmɔ ala. Nzɛmba yeɛ yɛka yɛkyire ɛmɔ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɛmɔ kɔsakra bɛkofi sɔ nningyein hemɔ nwo, na ɛmɔ awa Nyameɛ teasefoɛ bɔ ɔbɔle anwuro, aseɛ, ɛpo ne nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ nu namukoraati ne berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ bɔ wapɛ nu ne de, ɔmane maen-maen nanufoɛ ne atee maa bɛyɛle bɔ bɛkuro ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Nakoso ɔhɔle so yɛle nningyein pa fa lili ye nwo adanzeɛ; ebie yeɛ ole kyɛ ɔmaa nzue tɔ mane ɛmɔ, ɔmaa ɛmɔ nyane mmerɛ bɔ aleɛ ba, ɛmɔ nyane aleɛ bɛlili maa ɛmɔ ko yili, na ɔmaa ɛmɔ nyane anigye wɔ ɛmɔ ahone nu.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Nakoso ɛhe po ne, ɔha fɛle pa, kora yeɛ mmenia ne yakyi afɔleɛ bɔ ne bɛpena kyɛ bɛbɔ bɛma bɛ ne ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Na Yudafoɛ biemɔ fili Antiokia ne Ikoniom wale berɛ, na bɛtutu bɛguale mmenia ne so anu maa bɛsili Paul nyɔboɛ bɛhwene ye bɛɛtole kuro ne si dɔ, ofikyɛ ne bɛse kyɛ wawu. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Nakoso mmerɛ bɔ asuafoɛ nemɔ wale berɛ bɛɛpɛle ye nwo beyiale ne, odwɔsole, na ɔhɔle kuro nanu. Na aleɛ hene ne, ɔne Barnaba fili berɛ hɔle Derbi. <verse eid="ACT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Bɛhane nzɛmba ne wɔ kuro nanu, ná benyane asuafoɛ kaa ne, besa bɛwale Listra, Ikoniom ne Antiokia <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />bɛɛbokale asuafoɛ nemɔ maa bɛyɛle se, na bɛhyɛle bɛ nguraen kyɛ, bɛhɔ so bɛtena gyidie nanu. Bɛha bɛhyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Odikyɛ yɛfa amaneɛ pee nu kora né yahɔ Nyameɛ ahennie nanu.” <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛyele mbanyi wɔ asafo biala nu ne, bɛbɔle mbaeɛ, na bɛyɛle akɔngyere bɛfale bɛ bɛwurale Awurade bɔ banya ye nu gyidie ne sa.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Na bɛfale Pisidia bɛwale Pamfilia. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Na mmerɛ bɔ bɛhane edwirɛ ne wɔ Perga beyiele ne, bɛhɔle Atalia. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Bɛfale hyep bɛfili Atalia bɛwale Antiokia. Ɛberɛ ala yeɛ mmerɛ bie bɛfale bɛ bɛwurale Nyameɛ adom bo, maa bɛɛyɛle adwuma bɔ kesaalae bayie ne. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Bɛdwuli ne, bɛboale asafo ne noa bɛhane bɔ Nyameɛ nate bɛ so ayɛ namukoraati, ɔne kyɛbɔ wabukye anoa wama maen-maen nanufoɛ kyɛ bɛɛyɛ gyidifoɛ ne behyirele bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Na bɛne asuafoɛ ne tenane berɛ hyɛle kaa.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Yesi ne, mmrienzua biemɔ fili Yudea wale berɛ, na bɛhyɛle yebo bɛhyirehyirele aliemaa nemɔ kyɛ, “Sɛ bambɛ ɛmɔ toa, kyɛbɔ Mose mmeraa ne ka nea a, ɛmɔngonya ngoa.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Ɛhe fale dwudwolɛ wale bɛ ne Paul ne Barnaba afia, na bɛsuli bɛ nwo aporowaa paa. Yeti, bɛyele Paul ne Barnaba ne ebiemɔ kyɛ, bɛhɔ asomafoɛ ne mbanyi nemɔ berɛ wɔ Yerusalem, na bɛɛbisa edwirɛ nanu. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Yeti mmerɛ bɔ asafo ne guale bɛ atee ne, bɛɛfale Foinike ne Samaria, na bɛhane kyɛbɔ maen-maen nanufoɛ asakra b'adwene nanwo dwirɛ pee bɛhyirele bɛ, na ɛhe maa aliemaa nemɔ nye gyele paa. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Bɛdwuli Yerusalem ne, asafo ne, asomafoɛ ne mbanyi nemɔ lɛle bɛ kama, na bɛhane nningyein bɔ Nyameɛ nate bɛ so ayɛ namukoraati bɛhyirele bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Nakoso, Farisifoɛ nanu biemɔ bɔ baayɛ gyidifoɛ ne dwɔsole, na bɛhane kyɛ: “Maen-maen nanufoɛ ne, odikyɛ bɛpɛ bɛ toa, na yɛhyɛ bɛ maa bɛdi Mose Mmeraa naso.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Yeti asomafoɛ ne mbanyi nemɔ yiale nu, na bɛsusuli edwirɛ nanwo bɛhɔle siɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Bɛsusuli edwirɛ nanwo bɛhɔle siɛ paa, yeɛ Petro dwɔso ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Aliemaa mɔ, ɛmɔse kyɛ ahyɛaseɛ nala yeɛ Nyameɛ neɛneane ɛmɔ nu yele me kyɛ, maen-maen nanufoɛ ne fa me noa dwirɛ so te nzɛmba ne, ná bɛle bɛli. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Na Nyameɛ bɔ ɔse ahone nu ne mane bɛ honhom krongron fa lili ye nwo adanzeɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔyɛ mane yɛ nala. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Ná wamma nzonzonyɛ biala amma yɛ ne bɛ afia, mmom ɔnate gyidie naso tele bɛ nwo. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Ye de, nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔsɔ Nyameɛ bɛnea, na ɛmɔfa kɔnnua bɔ yɛne yɛ nana mɔ po angora ye soa bɛto bɛ so ne? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Afei koso, yedɛ yɛdi kyɛ, ɔnate Awurade Yesu Kristo adom so yeɛ balɛ́ yɛ ɔ, na sɔ adom nala yeɛ wamaa balɛ́ bɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Ɛhe maa mmenia namukoraati yɛle dinn. Na Barnaba ne Paul hane nzɛngyerɛneɛ ne anwanwadeɛ pee bɔ Nyameɛ nate bɛ so ayɛ ye wɔ maen-maen nanu ne hyirele bɛ, na mmenia namukoraati tiele. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Bɛdwudwo bɛyiele ne, Yakobo hane kyɛ: “Aliemaa mɔ, ɛmɔtie me. <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simeon<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ye ala yeɛ ole Simon Petro.</char></note> amaa yanwu mmerɛ bɔ oli moa bɔ Nyameɛ pɛle ye nye neane maen-maen, ná ɔyele mmenia bie wɔ bɛ nu fale ye dumaa tole bɛ so ne. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Na ɛhe ne adiifoɛ nemɔ dwirɛ ne yia, ofikyɛ bahworɔ kyɛ:<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />‘Ɛhe si ne, ngosa ngɔwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">na ngoosi David <char style="w">tɛnt</char> bɔ wadwiri wagua ne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Ngosa ngosi bɔ wadwiri wagua ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">na ngɔmaa okosi ye daa nu,<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛ bɔ baha ne kɔpena Awurade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">bɛ ne maen-maen nanufoɛ namukoraati, mmenia bɔ me dumaa la bɛ so ne;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">Awurade bɔ ɔyɛ nningyein he ne yeɛ waha ɔ,<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />nningyein bɔ bɛse fi teteete ne.’<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Yeti bɔ meka yeɛ ole kyɛ, maen-maen nanufoɛ bɔ bɛsakra bɛba Nyameɛ berɛ ne, nnɛmɔ maa yɛha bɛ, <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />mmom yɛhworɔ krataa yɛma bɛ, na yɛma bɛnwu ye kyɛ, odikyɛ bɛtwe bɛ nwo bɛfi nningyein bɔ bosoen amaa yɛnwu agua fiɛ, adwamammɔ, ɔne ngaka bɔ bahu bɛ, ná banhwie bɛ mogya bangua nanwo. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Na ofi teteete ne, Mose le mmenia bɔ bɛka ye nwo dwirɛ wɔ kuro biala nu, ofikyɛ homeda biala, bɛkenga ye dwirɛ wɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nemɔ nu.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Yeti, asomafoɛ ne, mbanyi ne, ne asafo namukoraati sili gyinayɛ kyɛ, bɛkɔye mmrienzua biemɔ bɛkofi bɛ nu, na basoma bɛ ne Paul ne Barnaba maa bahɔ Antiokia. Yeti bɛsoma Yuda bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Barsaba ne né Silas, bɛ yeɛ ne bɛli aliemaa nemɔ nyunu ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Edwirɛ he yeɛ bɛhworɔ bɛfa bɛsomane bɛ ɔ:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 15:23">Krataa he fi asomafoɛ ne mbanyi bɔ yɛte ɛmɔ aliemaa mɔ ne berɛ,</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 15:23">Yɛfa yɛbrɛ aliemaa mɔ bɔ ɛmɔ wɔ maen-maen nanu wɔ Antiokia, Siria, ne Kilikia ne:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 15:23">Yɛ kyea ɛmɔ.<verse eid="ACT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Yate kyɛ yɛ nu biemɔ awa ɛmɔ berɛ, na bɛkeka edwirɛ bie bɛfa bɛha ɛmɔ adwene, na bɛpena kyɛ bɛsɛkye ɛmɔ adwene. Nakoso, yɛmanne bɛ akwankyerɛ biala. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Yeti yɛ mukoraati yale yato nu kyɛ, yɛye mmenia biemɔ yɛboka Barnaba ne Paul bɔ yɛdɔ bɛ naso, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />sɔ mmrienzua hemɔ afa bɛ ngoa ato asane nu ama y'Awurade Yesu Kristo dumaa ne. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Na yesa yɛsoma Yuda ne Silas maa bɛfa bɛ noa bɛbaka edwirɛ komapɛ nala.<verse eid="ACT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Ná honhom krongron ne, ɔne yɛ bɔbɔ koso nguro kyɛ yɛfa adesoa foforɛ biala yɛto ɛmɔ so, sana ɛhemɔ bɔ ye nwo hia nala; yeɛ ole kyɛ: <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Ɛmɔhwe ɛmɔ nwo bɛfi nningyein bɔ bafa babɔ afɔleɛ bama bosoen, mogya, ngaka bɔ bahu bɛ, ná banhwie bɛ mogya bangua, ɔne adwamammɔ nwo. Sɛ ɛmɔtwe ɛmɔ nwo koraa bɛfi sɔ nningyein hemɔ nwo a, okosi ɛmɔ yé.</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 15:29">Nyameɛ boka ɛmɔ so.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Yɛ kyea ɛmɔ.”</char></note><verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Yeti bɛguale mmrienzua nemɔ atee maa bɛhɔle Antiokia. Bɛdwuli berɛ ne, bɛboale asafo ne noa bɛfale krataa ne bɛmane bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Ná bɛkengale krataa ne bɛyiele ne, bɛ nye gyele paa, ofikyɛ ne enu dwirɛ ne hyɛ nguraen. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Né Yuda ne Silas te adiifoɛ, yeti bɛhane edwirɛ pee bɛhyɛle aliemaa nemɔ nguraen, na ɔmaa bɛyɛle se. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Na bɛtenane berɛ kaa ne, aliemaa nemɔ guale bɛ atee asomdwie nu maa besa bɛhɔle bɛ bɔ bɛsomane bɛ ne berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" /><note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛ ɛnea Bible biemɔ nu a, bafa edwirɛ bie bawura ɛwa kyɛ, </char><char style="em">“Silas de, né onwu ye kyɛ, ɔte pa kyɛ ɔkɔtena berɛ.”</char> Nakoso sɛ ɛnea asaanoa ndworɔyɛ bɔ wahyɛ paa, ɔne bɔ odi mu paa nemɔ nu a, sɔ dwirɛ ne nne nu.</note>― <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Nakoso Paul ne Barnaba de, bɛtenane Antiokia, na bɛne mmeni pee bɔle nu yɛle ngyerɛkyerɛ, na bɛhane Awurade dwirɛ ne.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Ngyẽa biemɔ si ne, Paul ha hyirele Barnaba kyɛ: “Ma yɛhɔ kuro biala bɔ yɛhane Awurade dwirɛ wɔ nu naso, na yɛɛnea kyɛbɔ aliemaa nemɔ nwo te ɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Né Barnaba ayɛ ye adwene kyɛ, ɔkɔmaa bɛkɔfa Yohane bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Marko ne bɛkɔhɔ. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Nakoso Paul de, né onwu ye kyɛ, bɛne ye kɔ a ɔnyɛ yé, ofikyɛ ɔyakyile bɛ berɛ wɔ Pamfilia, na ɔne bɛ angɔ anyɛ adwuma ne. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Ɛhe fale dwudwolɛ paa wale bɛ afia, na ebiala fale ye atee. Barnaba fale Marko, na bɛfale ɛpo so bɛhɔle Kipro, <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />na Paul koso fale Silas, ná aliemaa nemɔ fale bɛ wurale Awurade adom bo ne, ofili berɛ hɔle. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Na ɔɔfale Siria ne Kilikia, na ɔbokale asafo nemɔ maa bɛyɛle se.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Yeti bɛwale Derbi, na yesi ne, bɛhɔle Listra. Né suaniɛ bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Timoteo wɔ berɛ, né ye maame te Yudaniɛ gyidiniɛ, nakoso ye baba de, né ɔte Greekniɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Né aliemaa mɔ bɔ bɛwɔ Listra ne Ikoniom namukoraati ka ye nwo dwirɛ pa. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Né Paul pena kyɛ ɔne Timoteo kɔ, nakoso Yudafoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ nati, ɔfale ye pɛle ye toa; ofikyɛ ne bɛ mukoraati bɛse kyɛ ye baba te Greekniɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Na kuro biala bɔ bɛkɔhɔ nu ne, bɛfa mmeraa ne gyinayɛ bɔ asomafoɛ ne mbanyi bɔ bɛwɔ Yerusalem ne asi ne bɛma bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Ɛhe maa asafo nemɔ yɛle se wɔ gyidie nanu, na daa biala, né bɛ dodoɔ né kɔ anyunu.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Afei koso, bɛɛfale Frigia ne Galatia maen nanu, ofikyɛ honhom krongron né amma bɛ atee maa banga nzɛmba ne wɔ Asia mandam nanu. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Na bɛwale Misia ne, né bɛpena kyɛ bɛkɔ Bitinia, nakoso Yesu honhom né amma bɛ atee. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Yeti bɛpɛle nu wɔ Misia bɛwale Troa. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Na kɔngɔen ne, Paul nyane anisoadehu bie, né biaa bie gyi Makedonia ɔka kyire ye kyɛ: “Bra Makedonia na baboka yɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Onyane sɔ anisoadehu nala pɛ, yɛyɛle y'adwene kyɛ yɛkɔ Makedonia, ofikyɛ yɛnwuni ye kyɛ Nyameɛ yeɛ wafrɛ yɛ kyɛ yɛɛha nzɛmba ne wɔ berɛ ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Yeti yɛfole hyep wɔ Troa yɛhɔle yɛ nyunu tee yɛɛdwuli Samotrake, na aleɛ hene ne, yɛhɔle Neapoli. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Na yɛfili berɛ yɛhɔle Filipi, né ɔte kuro piri wɔ Makedonia mandam nanu. Na yɛlili ngyẽa kaa wɔ sɔ kuro naso. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Na Homeda ne, yɛfili kuro nanu yɛhɔle nzue bie nwo, nekaa bɔ né y'adwene yɛ yɛ kyɛ bɛbɔ mbaeɛ ne. Yɛtenane berɛ, na mmrasua bɔ né bayia nu berɛ ne, yɛne bɛ bɔle ngɔmmɔ. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Né brasua bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Lidia wɔ berɛ otie; ofi Tiatira, na né ɔtɔne ndadeɛ valent. Né ɔsõ Nyameɛ, ná Awurade bukyele ye ahone nu maa ɔyɛle asoɛ tiele bɔ Paul ka ne. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛbɔle ɔne ye awurofoɛ asu ne, ɔsrɛle yɛ kyɛ: “Sɛ ɛmɔ anwu kyɛ, medi nahorɛ mema Awurade de a, ɛmɔbra bɛɛtena m'awuro.” Na ɔhane alaa maa yɛhɔle.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Ɛlɛho bie, né yɛnate atee so yɛkɔ nekaa bɔ bɛbɔ mbaeɛ ne, ná abayaa bie yiale yɛ. Né ole sunzummɔne bɔ ɔmaa ɔkora ka bɔ okosi kyẽabie ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Sɔ abayaa he lili yɛne Paul si, na ne ɔteɛteanu kyɛ: “Sɔ mmenia hemɔ te Anwuro-Anwuro Nyameɛ ne ngoaa, na bɛka atee bɔ ɔkɔmaa ɛmɔ konya ngoa nanwo dwirɛ bɛkyire ɛmɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Ɔyɛle sɔ ngyẽa pee, afei de né ɔyɛ Paul ahomete, na ɔkakyile ye nwo ha hyirele honhom ne kyɛ: “Mehyɛ wɔ wɔ Yesu Kristo dumaa nu kyɛ, fi ye nu kɔ.” Na sɔ mmerɛ nala, ofili ye nu.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Mmerɛ bɔ ye wura nemɔ nwuni kyɛ, anidasoɛ bɔ bɛle ye kyɛ bekonya sikaa ne abɔ bɛ ne, bɛhyele Paul ne Silas, na bɛhwene bɛ bɛhɔle atumvoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ dwaa nanu ne berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Na bɛfale bɛ bɛwale maen nanu mbanyi ne berɛ, yeɛ bɛhane kyɛ; “Sɔ mmenia hemɔ te Yudafoɛ, na bɛha yɛ kuro ne paa. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Bɛka amanne biemɔ bɔ mmeraa mma atee kyɛ Romanfoɛ suesua anaa yɛyɛ ɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Ɛberɛ ala, mmeni lɔen namukoraati tuli bɛ noa guale bɛ so. Ná maen nanu mbanyi ne tetele Paul ne Silas ndadeɛ nu, yeɛ bɛha bɛhyirele mmenia ne kyɛ, bɛfa mmakaa bɛbo bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Bɛgwale bɛ pa, beyiele ne, bɛfale bɛ bɛguale prizin, yeɛ bɛha bɛhyirele bɔ ɔnea prizin berɛ ne kyɛ, ɔnea bɛ so yé. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Yeti, ɔfale bɛ guale prizin sua bɔ ɔwɔ ye kunu dɔ paa nanu, na ɔkyekyele bɛ gya bɔle mmakaa nu.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Kɔngɔen ne, Paul ne Silas bɔle mbaeɛ, na bɛtole edwein bɛyele Nyameɛ ayɛ, né bɛ bɔ bɛla prizin berɛ ne tie. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Komapɛ, aseɛ wosolɛ kandinga bie sili maa prizin ne fapem ne wosole. Afei, anoa nemɔ bukye-bukyele, na ebiala kyenyi sangyele. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Mmerɛ bɔ sona bɔ ɔnea prizin berɛ ne dwɔsole, na onwuni kyɛ anoa nemɔ abukye ne, ɔhwene dadeɛ kyɛ oku ye nwo, ofikyɛ né ye adwene yɛ ye kyɛ, prizinfoɛ ne anwati. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Nakoso Paul teane nu kyɛ: “Nnɛku wɔ nwo, ofikyɛ yɛ mukoraati yɛwɔ wa.” <verse eid="ACT 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Yeti olɛle kanea, na ɔfale mirika wurale prizin sua nanu, yeɛ ɔfale ahopere bule ndwerɛ wɔ Paul ne Silas nyunu. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Na ɔyele bɛ fitele, yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: “Me wura mɔ, nzu yeɛ odikyɛ meyɛ, ná manya ngoa ɔ?” <verse eid="ACT 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Nya gyidie wɔ Awurade Yesu nu, ná ɛne w'awurofoɛ mukoraati konya ngoa.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Na Paul ne Silas hane Awurade dwirɛ ne hyirele ye, ɔne ebiala bɔ ɔwɔ ye awuro berɛ ne. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Na sɔ kɔngɔen nala, ɔfale bɛ hɔle, na onwunzini bɛ kena nemɔ aso, na bɛbɔle ɔne ye awurofoɛ mukoraati asu. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Ná ɔfale bɛ wale ye awuro, yeɛ ɔmane bɛ aleɛ maa bɛlili. Ná ɔne ye awurofoɛ mukoraati gyele bɛ nye kyɛ, kesaalae de, banya gyidie wɔ Nyameɛ nu.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Aleɛ hene ne, maen nanu mbanyi nemɔ somane polisifoɛ maa bɛɛha bɛhyirele bɔ ɔnea prizin berɛ ne kyɛ: “Ye sɔ mmrienzua nemɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Bɔ ɔnea prizin berɛ ne hane bɛ dwirɛ ne hyirele Paul kyɛ: “Maen nanu mbanyi ne asoma mmenia awa kyɛ, yɛ ye ɛmɔ. Yeti ɛmɔbra, na ɛmɔfa asomdwie bɛhɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Nakoso Paul hane kyɛ: “Yɛte Romanfoɛ, nakoso bɛgwale yɛ wɔ badwanu, yeɛ bɛfale yɛ bɛguale prizin aberɛ bɔ né bɛlili yɛ dwirɛ. Nakoso kesaalae de, bɛbaaye yɛ kodɛɛ? Ɛhe de, ɔngɔyɛ ye! Maa bɛ bɔbɔ bɛbra, na bɛɛfa yɛ bɛfite.” <verse eid="ACT 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Polisifoɛ nemɔ hane sɔ dwirɛ ne hyirele maen nanu mbanyi ne. Mmerɛ bɔ bɛtele kyɛ bɛte Romanfoɛ ne, esuronyi hane bɛ paa. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Yeti bɛwale bɛɛpale bɛ kyerɛ, na bɛyele bɛ beyiele ne, bɛsrɛle bɛ kyɛ, bɛfi kuro nanu bɛhɔ. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Nakoso bɛfili prizin berɛ ne, bɛhɔle Lidia awuro; na mmerɛ bɔ bɛnwuni aliemaa nemɔ ne, bɛhyɛle bɛ nguraen, yeɛ bɛfili berɛ bɛhɔle ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Afei bɛfale Amfipoli ne Apolonia bɛwale Tɛsalonika, né Yudafoɛ le sua bɔ beyia nu wɔ berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Kyɛbɔ ne Paul taa yɛ ne, ɔhɔle sua bɔ beyia nu nanu, na ɔfale homeda nza ne bɛ susuli tworɔnzɛm nanwo, <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />na ohyirehyirele nu mane bɛ adanzeɛ bɔ okyire kyɛ, né odikyɛ Kristo ne nwu amaneɛ, na bɛtingye ye bɛfi ewue nu, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Yesu bɔ meka ye nwo dwirɛ mekyire ɛmɔ ne, ye yeɛ ole Kristo ne.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Yeti, bɛ nu biemɔ yɛle gyidifoɛ, na bɛfale bɛ nwo bɛbɔle Paul ne Silas. Na Greekfoɛ pee bɔ bɛsõ Nyameɛ ne mmrasua bɔ bɛte atitire nanu pee koso yɛle sɔ. <verse eid="ACT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Na ahoɔyaa ti, Yudafoɛ nemɔ boɔboale mmrienzua biemɔ bɔ bɛnate kuro nanu mbaen noa, bɛboale sɔ atuturafoɛ nemɔ noa maa bɛyɛle basabasa, na bɛmaa kuro nanu yɛle bagya-bagya. Bɛhɔle Yason awuro kyɛ bɛkwaahwe Paul ne Silas bɛ berɛ atuturafoɛ nemɔ. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Ná bannwu bɛ ne, bɛfale Yason ne aliemaa biemɔ bɛwale kuro nanu mbanyi ne nyunu, na bɛteɛteane nu kyɛ: “Mmenia hemɔ bɔ bamaa wiase ne ayɛ basabasa ne, bawa ɛwa koso, <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />na Yason alɛ́ bɛ ahɔ ye awuro. Sɔ mmrienzua he amukoraati dwɔso tia Kaesare ahyɛdeɛ, na bɛnwa ɔhene foforɛ bie wɔ berɛ, na yeɛ ole Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Mmerɛ bɔ kuro nanufoɛ ne atumvoɛ ne tele sɔ dwirɛ ne, ɔhale bɛ paa. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Yeti, bɛmaa Yason ne bɛ ngaa ne tuale sikaa bie fa lili agyinam, yeɛ bɛyakyile bɛ maa bɛhɔle ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Ná kɔngɔen nala, aliemaa nemɔ maa Paul ne Silas hɔle Berea. Bɛdwuli berɛ ne, bɛhɔle Yudafoɛ sua bɔ beyia nu nanu. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Né ɛhemɔ adwene nu la berɛ tra bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Tɛsalonika ne, ofikyɛ bɛfale b'ahone mukoraati bɛlɛle edwirɛ ne, na daa biala né bɛneɛnea Tworɔnzɛm nanu bɛnea kyɛ, bɔ bɛka ne te nahorɛ a. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Yeti bɛ nu pee yɛle gyidifoɛ, na Greekfoɛ mmrasua ne mmrienzua bɔ bɛte atitire nanu pee koso yɛle gyidifoɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Nakoso mmerɛ bɔ Yudafoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Tɛsalonika ne tele kyɛ Paul ka Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne wɔ Berea ne, bɛwale berɛ, na bɛtutu bɛguale mmenia ne so anu maa bɛyɛle basabasa. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Yeti aliemaa nemɔ yɛle ndɛ guale Paul ate maa ɔhɔle ɛpo ne noa, na Silas ne Timoteo de, bɛtenane berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Nakoso, bɛ bɔ bɛɛsomane Paul ne fale ye hɔle alaa bɛɛdwuli Atene. Ná besa bɛba ne, Paul mane bɛ ngraa kyɛ, bɛha behyire Silas ne Timoteo kyɛ, bɛyɛ ye ndɛ bɛbra ye nwo dɔ.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Paul nwondɛ bɛ wɔ Atene ne, onwuni kyɛ bosoen alɛ́ kuro ne abɔ so, ná ne ɔyɛ ye ahomete. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Yeti ɔne Yudafoɛ ne bɛ bɔ bɛsõ Nyameɛ ne susuli tworɔnzɛm nanwo wɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nanu, na daa biala né ɔkɔ dwaaso, na bɛ bɔ okonya bɛ wɔ berɛ ne koso, né ɔne bɛ susu edwirɛ nwo. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Nakoso, Epikurofoɛ ne Stoafoɛ bɔ bɛse nwomaa ne suli ye aporowaa. Na ebiemɔ hane kyɛ: “Nzu yeɛ akoaa he bɔ odwudwo nwora ne pena kyire ne?” Ebiemɔ koso hane kyɛ: “Ɔka nyameɛ foforɛ bie nwo dwirɛ.” Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ né ɔka Yesu bɔ batingye ye bafi ewue nu nanwo dwirɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Yeti bɛfale ye bɛhɔle Areopago, na bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Ngyerɛkyerɛ foforɛ bɔ ɛka ye nwo dwirɛ ne, ɛkɔhora kohyire nu kohyire yɛ? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Ofikyɛ nningyein bɔ ɛka ye nwo dwirɛ ne, yɛtelle bie lle, na yɛpena kyɛ yɛnwu bɔ okyire ɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Atenefoɛ ne ɛwɔfoɛ bɔ bɛte kuro nanu ne, sɛ́ bɛnyɛ hwee a, bɔ bɛyɛ ala yeɛ ole kyɛ bɛkɔha edwirɛ foforɛ anaa bɛkotie edwirɛ foforɛ.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Yeti, Paul gyinane Areopago né afia, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Atene mmrienzua, menwu ye kyɛ ɛmɔ kuro nyamesom paa. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Ofikyɛ mmerɛ bɔ nnate kuro nanu ne, ndole me bo ase nneane nningyein bɔ ɛmɔsõ bɛ ne. Ná nwuni afɔleɛ bokyea bie po bɔ bahworɔ ye nwo kyɛ, ‘Ɛhe te nyameɛ bɔ yɛnze ye ne deɛ.’ Yeti bɔ ɛmɔsõ ye, nakoso ɛmɔnze ye ne, ye nwo dwirɛ yeɛ meka mekyire ɛmɔ ne. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Nyameɛ bɔ ɔbɔle wiase ne nikye biala bɔ ɔwɔ nu ne, ye yeɛ ɔte anwuro ne aseɛ ne Wura ɔ. Na ɔtte asɔre sua bɔ sona asi nu. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Yeɛ nná sona sa yeɛ bɛfa bɛsõ ye ɔ, ofikyɛ onhia hwee. Na ye bɔbɔ yeɛ ɔma ebiala ngoa ne nwomeɛ ne nikye biala ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Na mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ maen biala nu ne, ɔyɛle bɛ fili sona-horɛ nu, kyɛ bɛtena aseɛ he aso mukoraati. Na ɔhyɛle mmerɛ ahoroɛ, yeɛ ɔfale ɛwɛen tole nekaa biala bɔ bɛkɔtena ne, <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a bɛkɔpena Nyameɛ, na bayere bɛ nwo bapena ye alaa kodwu kyɛ bekonwu ye. Nakoso bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, ɔne yɛnu biala afia annwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Ofikyɛ, ye ti yeɛ yɛle ngoa, yɛkeka yɛ nwo, na yɛte ase ne, na bɛ bɔ bɛtworɔ anwenzɛm wɔ ɛmɔ wa ne, bɛ nu biemɔ po aha kyɛ, ‘Yɛ koso, yɛte ye mmaa mɔ.’ <verse eid="ACT 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Na sɛ yɛte Nyameɛ mmaa de a, nnɛmɔ maa yɛnya adwene kyɛ Ɛdangama ne te kyɛ sikaa kɔkorɛ anaa dwetɛ anaa nyɔboɛ bie bɔ kuro sona abɔ ye ti anu ayɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, Nyameɛ bule ye nye guale mmerɛ bɔ né yɛnze hwee naso, nakoso kesaalae de, ɔka kyire mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ wiase mukoraati ne kyɛ, bɛsakra b'adwene. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Ofikyɛ waye kyẽa bie wasie berɛ, na wabɔ ye ti anu kyɛ sɔ kyẽa ne, ɔnate sona bie bɔ waye ye so kobu bɛ bɔ bɛte aseɛ naso namukoraati atɛn wɔ tenenee nu. Ná watingye sɔ sona ne wafi ewue nu wafa wayɛ adanzeɛ wama ebiala.”<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛtele ewue tingyele nanwo dwirɛ ne, ebiemɔ gorole Paul nwo, na ebiemɔ koso hane kyɛ: “Sɔ dwirɛ he ati, yɛkosa yekotie wɔ bieku.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Yeti Paul fili berɛ hɔle, <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />nakoso ebiemɔ fale bɛ nwo bɔle ye, na bɛɛyɛle gyidifoɛ. Bɛ nu biemɔ yeɛ ole Dionisio bɔ ɔboka Areopago naso ne, ɔne brasua bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Damari, ne mmenia foforɛ bie.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Ɛhe si ne, ofili Atene hɔle Korinto. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Na onwuni Yudaniɛ bie bɔ bɛfrɛ Akwila wɔ berɛ, né ɔte Pontoniɛ. Bekye bɔ ne ɔne ɔye Prisila afi Italy awa berɛ ɔ, ofikyɛ ne Klaudio ahyɛ mmeraa kyɛ, Yudafoɛ namukoraati fí Roman. Yeti Paul hɔle bɛ berɛ, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />na ɔnate kyɛ ɔne bɛ yɛ adwuma kõ nati, ɔtenane b'awuro ne bɛ yɛle adwuma, ofikyɛ bɛ koso, ne bɛyɛ tɛnt nwo adwuma. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Na homeda biala, né ɔka edwirɛ ne wɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nanu, na ɔhane edwirɛ ne maa Yudafoɛ ne Greekfoɛ lɛ lili. <verse eid="ACT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Mmerɛ bɔ Silas ne Timoteo fili Makedonia wale ne, Paul fale ye mmerɛ pee hane edwirɛ ne, na olili adanzeɛ hyirele Yudafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ, Yesu yeɛ ole Kristo ne. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Na mmerɛ bɔ bɛdwɔso betiale ye, na bɛpepɛle ye nzoaa ne, ɔporo-porole ye atadeɛ nu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ mogya bɔ ɛmɔ ti so. Me de, menni ye nwo fɔ. Na ofi ɛnɛ bɔ ɔkɔ ne, mekɔ maen-maen nanufoɛ ne berɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Yeti ofili berɛ hɔle biaa bie bɔ ɔsõ Nyameɛ bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Titio<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Tito.” </char></note> Yusto awuro; né ye awuro ne wɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nanwo berɛ pɛɛ. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Na Krispo bɔ ɔte panyi wɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nanu ne, ɔne ye awurofoɛ mukoraati lɛle Awurade lili. Na Korintofoɛ bɔ bɛtele edwirɛ ne koso, bɛ nu pee lɛ lili, na bɛbɔle bɛ asu. <verse eid="ACT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Kɔngɔen ne, Awurade ha hyirele Paul wɔ anisoadehu nu kyɛ: “Nnɛsuro, kɔ so dwudwo, nnɛka wɔ noa to nu, <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />ofikyɛ mmoka wɔ so, na ebiala ngɔhora ngɔyɛ wɔ hwee; na nne mmeni pee wɔ kuro he anu.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Yeti ɔtenane berɛ afoɛ kõ ne bosome nzia, na ɔhane Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne hyirele bɛ.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Mmerɛ bɔ né Galio te amrado wɔ Akaia ne, Yudafoɛ nemɔ yɛle kõ, na bɛhwene Paul bɛhɔle nekaa bɔ bɛdi dwirɛ ne, <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />yeɛ bɛhane kyɛ: “Sɔ biaa he laka-laka mmenia maa bɛfa atee bɔ otia mmeraa so bɛsõ Nyameɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Na Paul yɛle kyɛ ɔye ye nwo noa ne, Galio ha hyirele Yudafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ: “Yudafoɛ, sɛ ɔte nzɛmmɔne anaa bɔne pirikua bie de a, ahaa ngotie ɛmɔ. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Nakoso ɔnate kyɛ ɔte edwirɛ, dumaa, ɔne ɛmɔ mmeraa nanwo aporowaa nati, ɛmɔ bɔbɔ ɛmɔha ye nwo dwirɛ. Menguro kyɛ ngobu sɔ nningyein nemɔ nwo atɛn.” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Yeti, ɔfoane bɛ fili nekaa bɔ odi dwirɛ ne. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Na ɛlɔen namukoraati tuli bɛ nwo guale Sostene bɔ ɔte panyi wɔ sua bɔ beyia nu naso, na bɛbole ye wɔ nekaa bɔ bɛdi dwirɛ ne, nakoso Galio anyɛ ye nwo hwee.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Yeti Paul tenane berɛ kaa ne, ɔne aliemaa nemɔ lili ngraa, na ɔfale hyep hɔle Siria. Né Akwila ne Prisila boka ye so. Odwuli Kenkrea ne, ɔtetele ye ti ne maa ɔhɔle ase, ofikyɛ ne waha ndaen. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Bɛdwuli Efeso ne, ɔyakyile bɛ berɛ. Na ye de, ɔhɔle sua bɔ beyia nu nanu, na ɔne Yudafoɛ ne susuli nningyein nwo. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Ɔwɔ nu, bɛsrɛle ye kyɛ ɔne bɛ tena berɛ kaa, nakoso wambene, <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />mmom ɔne bɛ lili ngraa, na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Sɛ ɔte Awurade pɛ a, ngosa ngɔwa ɛmɔ wa bieku.” Na ɔfale hyep wɔ Efeso hɔle.<verse eid="ACT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Odwuli Kaesarea ne, ɔhɔle Yerusalem ɔɔhyeale asafo bɔ ɔwɔ berɛ ne, yeɛ osa hɔle Antiokia. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Ɔtenane berɛ kaa, afei ohyinini Galatia ne Frigia mandam nanu hyɛle asuafoɛ namukoraati nguraen.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Ná Yudaniɛ bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Apolo, bɔ ofi Alɛzandria wale Efeso. Né ye noa ate paa, na ne ɔse tworɔnzɛm nanu koso. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Né batete sɔ brienzua he wɔ Awurade atee so, na ɔnate kyɛ né honhom krongron wɔ ye so nati, ɔhane Yesu nwo dwirɛ hyirehyirele nu pɛpɛɛpɛ. Nakoso Yohane asubɔ ne ngome yeɛ ne ɔse ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Ɔhyɛle yebo fale akukuduro dwudwole wɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nanu, na mmerɛ bɔ Prisila ne Akwila tele bɔ ɔka ne, bɛmaa ɔɔbokale bɛ so, na bɛhyirehyirele Nyameɛ atee nanu yé bɛhyirele ye. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Né Apolo pena kyɛ ɔkɔ Akaia, yeti aliemaa nemɔ hworɔle krataa bɛɛmane asuafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ, bɛle ye kama. Mmerɛ bɔ odwuli dɔ ne, ɔbokale bɛ bɔ bɛnate Nyameɛ adom so baayɛ gyidifoɛ ne paa. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Ofikyɛ ɔfale akukuduro lale ye ali wɔ badwanu kyɛ Yudafoɛ nemɔ amini, na ɔmaa bɛnwuni ye wɔ Tworɔnzɛm nanu kyɛ, Yesu yeɛ ole Kristo ne.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Mmerɛ bɔ ne Apolo wɔ Korinto ne, Paul fale nekaa bɔ ɔmbingye ɛpo wale Efeso. Odwuli berɛ ne, onwuni asuafoɛ biemɔ, <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />yeɛ obisale bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ yɛle gyidifoɛ ne, ɛmɔ nyane honhom krongron?” Bɛhane kyɛ: “Saa, yɛtelle ye lle kyɛ honhom krongron bie po wɔ berɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Yeti osa bisale bɛ kyɛ: “Asu beni yeɛ ɛmɔ bɔle ne?” Bɛhane kyɛ: “Yohane asubɔ ne.” <verse eid="ACT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Paul hane kyɛ: “Yohane asubɔ ne de, né okyire adwene-sakra, na né ɔka kyire mmenia ne kyɛ benya bɔ oli ye si ɔba nanu gyidie, na ye yeɛ ole Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Bɛtele ɛhe ne, bɛbɔle asu wɔ Awurade Yesu dumaa nu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Na mmerɛ bɔ Paul fale ye sa guale bɛ so ne, honhom krongron ne wale bɛ so, na bɛhyɛle yebo bɛhane dwudwolɛ foforɛ, na bɛhyɛle ngɔm. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Bɛ mukoraati, né bɛte mmrienzua kɔyɛ kyɛ 12.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Ɔfale bosome nza hɔle sua bɔ beyia nu nanu, na ɔfale akukuduro dwudwole, na ɔne bɛ susuli Nyameɛ Ahennie nanwo, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a bɛkɔte yebo ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Nakoso né ebiemɔ ahone yɛ se, na banne banni, ná bɛkekane edwirɛ bɔ ɔttemaye bɛfale Atee nanwo wɔ mmenia ne nyunu. Yeti ɔhwene ye nwo fili bɛ nwo, na ɔmaa asuafoɛ nemɔ koso hwene bɛ nwo. Na daa biala né ɔka edwirɛ ne wɔ Tirano sukuu sua nanu. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Ɔyɛle sɔ alaa afoɛ nyɔ, yeti bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Asia mandam nanu namukoraati, Yudafoɛ ne Greekfoɛ mukoraati tele Awurade dwirɛ ne.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Na Nyameɛ nate Paul sa so yɛle nningyein mbiri-mbiri paa, <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />sɛ́ bɛfa ɛtena ne ndadeɛ bɔ waha ye ne po bɛma ayarefoɛ a, ne b'anwonyerɛ né ahɔ, na sunzummɔne mɔ po fi bɛ nu fite. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Né Yudafoɛ biemɔ koso nate nu bɛtu sunzummɔne, yeti bɛyɛle kyɛ, bɛkɔbɔ Awurade Yesu dumaa bɛkogua bɛ bɔ bɛle sunzummɔne nemɔ so kyɛ: “Mehyɛ wɔ wɔ Yesu bɔ Paul ka ye nwo dwirɛ ne dumaa nu.” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Né Yudaniɛ sɔfo panyi bie bɔ bɛfrɛ Skewa le mmaa mmrienzua nzoo bɔ né bɛyɛ sɔ nikye ne bie. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Nakoso, sunzummɔne ne ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Mese Yesu, na mese Paul, na ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔfi nisua?” <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Na biaa bɔ sunzummɔne wɔ ye so ne fa guale bɛ so, na ɔbole bɛ mukoraati. Yeti bɛnwati bɛfili awuro berɛ, na bɛkɔ ne, né bɛ nwo la so, na né bapire-pira. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Yudafoɛ ne Greekfoɛ bɔ bɛte Efeso namukoraati tele ye nwo dwirɛ, na esuronyi tɔle bɛ mukoraati so, na bɛyele Yesu dumaa ne ayɛ paa. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Na gyidifoɛ pee wale, na bɛtole bɛ noa nu tui bɛhane bɔne bɔ bayɛ namukoraati wɔ badwanu, bamva komapɛ po bamvea. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ magyek nanu pee fale bɛ nwomaa wale, na bɛyerale ye maa ebiala nwuni ye. Na bɛ sesene ne, bɛnwuni kyɛ ye nyɔboɛ te dwetɛ 50,000. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Na Awurade dwirɛ ne hɔle so trɛle, na ɔyɛle se.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Ɛhemɔ si ne, Paul bɔle ye ti anu kyɛ, ɔkɔfa Makedonia ne Akaia kɔhɔ Yerusalem. Ɔhane kyɛ: “Sɛ medwu berɛ a, odikyɛ mekɔ Roman koso.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Yeti, ɔsomane bɛ bɔ bɛboka ye nanu nyɔ, Timoteo ne Erasto maa bɛhɔle Makedonia, na ye de, ɔtenane Asia mandam nanu berɛ kaa.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Sɔ mmerɛ nanu ne, edwirɛ bie dwɔsole wɔ Atee nanwo. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Bɔ ɔwale yeɛ ole kyɛ, né Demetrio te ebie bɔ ɔfa dwetɛ yɛ nningyein. Na né ɔfa dwetɛ yɛ Artemi bosoen sua ne bie, na ɛhe maa bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ dwetɛ nwo adwuma ne nyane sikaa paa. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Yeti, ɔboale bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ sɔ adwuma ne noa, yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Mmrienzua, ɛmɔse kyɛ sɔ adwuma he yeɛ wamaa yanya yɛ nwo ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Na kesaalae nnaa ɛmɔ anwu ye, na ɛmɔ ate kyɛbɔ Paul he amaa mmeni pee anya adwene foforɛ ne; yenwa, nyameɛ bɔ kuro sona ayɛ ne, ɔtte nyameɛ biala. Nná Efeso ngome yeɛ waha sɔ dwirɛ ne ɔ, mmom Asia mandam nanu mukoraati. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Na bɔ mesuro po yeɛ ole kyɛ, nná y'adwuma ne ngome yeɛ mmenia kɔkeka ye nwo dwirɛ ɔ, mmom annea a, yɛ nyameɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Nyameɛ brasua.”</char></note> kandinga Artemi sua ne koso, mmenia ngonya obuo biala ngɔma ye kõ. Na Artemi bɔ bɛsõ ye wɔ Asia mandam nanu ne wiase mukoraati ne, ye anuonyam kɔbɔ ye.”<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Mmenia ne tele ɛhe ne, bɛfɛle yaa paa, na bɛhyɛle yebo bɛteɛteane nu kyɛ: “Efesofoɛ Artemi né te piri paa!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Yeti kuro nanu yɛle bagya-bagya, na bɛ mukoraati bɛtuli bum bɛhɔle <char style="w">park</char> naso,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Brɔfo: </char><char style="it">Theatre</char>, Ɔte nekaa bɔ ne mmenia pee yia nu nea angorɛ anaa bɛyɛ nhyiam.</note> na bɛhwene Gaius ne Aristarko, Makedoniafoɛ nyɔ bɔ bɛne Paul tutu atee ne bɛhɔle berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Né Paul pena kyɛ ɔkɔ mmenia nanu, nakoso asuafoɛ ne amma ye ate. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Ye nnamvo bɔ ne bɛte mbanyi wɔ Asia mandam nanu ne somane ebiemɔ maa bɛɛsrɛle ye kyɛ, nnɛmaa ɔfa ye ngoa to asane nu kɔ park naso. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Né ɛberɛ ayɛ bagya-bagya, sɛ ebie tea nu ka ɛhe a, na ebiemɔ koso atea nu aha ɛhe. Né bɛ nu pee nala nze bɔ yeti bayia nu berɛ ne po. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Na bɛmaa Alɛzanda fite fili mmenia nanu, na Yudafoɛ nemɔ piepiane ye maa oogyinane anyunu dɔ. Na Alɛzanda mane ye sa so, fa yɛle nzɛngyerɛneɛ hyirele bɛ kyɛ bɛyɛ dinn ma ɔye ye nwo noa. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Nakoso mmerɛ bɔ bɛnwuni kyɛ ɔte Yudaniɛ ne, mmenia namukoraati teɛteane nu kyɛ: “Efesofoɛ Artemi né te piri paa!” Bɛyɛle sɔ alaa kɔyɛ dɔnhwere nyɔ. <verse eid="ACT 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Mmerɛ bɔ kuro né krakye ne maa bɛyɛle dinn ne, ɔhane kyɛ: “Efeso mmrienzua, nwa yeɛ ɔnze kyɛ Efeso kuro he yeɛ ɔnea Artemi kandinga né asɔre sua, ɔne ye statu bɔ ofi anwuro wale naso ɔ? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Aporowaa biala nne ɛhe anwo, yeti ɛmɔha ɛmɔ ahone bɛto ɛmɔ kunu, na nnɛmɔ pere ɛmɔ nwo. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Ofikyɛ mmenia bɔ ɛmɔ afa bɛ bawa ɛwa ne, bɛwialle asɔre sua nu nningyein, yeɛ bɛhanne mmusue dwirɛ biala bɛfalle yɛ nyameɛ nanwo. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Yeti, sɛ Demetrio ne bɛ bɔ ɔne bɛ yɛ dwetɛ nwo adwuma ne le bɛ nwo dwirɛ bie a, kɔɔto ne wɔ berɛ, na amrado nemɔ koso wɔ berɛ. Edwirɛ biala bɔ bɛle ye ne, bɛfa bɛbra. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Nakoso sɛ ɔte nikye bie bɔ ɔtra ɛhe de a, sana mbanyi ne frɛ maen namukoraati maa bɛbayia, na besi ye nwo gyinayɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Ná bɔ wahɔ so ɛnɛ ne, annea a né babɔ yɛ sommoɛ kyɛ yate atua, ofikyɛ yɛngɔhora yɛngohyire bɔ yeti yeɛ yɛyɛle sɔ basabasa ne.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Ɔhane ɛhe yiele ne, ɔmaa mmenia namukoraati hɔle.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Basabasa ne wale ase ne, Paul maa bɛfrɛle asuafoɛ nemɔ bɛwale, na ɔhyɛle bɛ nguraen yiele ne, ɔne bɛ lili ngraa, na osili atee so hɔle Makedonia. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Mmerɛ bɔ ɔfale sɔ mandam nemɔ nu, ná ɔhyɛle bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ne nguraen ne, ɔwale Greek. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Ɔtenane berɛ bosome nza. Né ahaa ɔpena kyɛ ɔfa hyep kɔ Siria, nakoso né Yudafoɛ nemɔ abɔ ye nwo porɛ, yeti ɔyɛle ye adwene kyɛ okosa kɔfa Makedonia. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Ɔne Piro bɔ ofi Berea né awa Sopata, Aristarko ne Sekundo bɔ bɛfi Tɛsalonika, Gaius bɔ ofi Derbi, Timoteo, Tikiko ne Trofimo bɔ bɛfi Asia mandam nanu ne yeɛ bɛhɔle ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Sɔ mmrienzua hemɔ lili moa, na bɛɛwondɛle yɛ wɔ Troa. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Paanoo bɔ Yiste Nne Nu afahyɛ ne si ne, yɛfale hyep wɔ Filipi, na ɛlɛnnu si ne, yɛɛtole bɛ wɔ Troa, na yɛtenane berɛ ngyẽa nzoo.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Kyẽa bɔ oli moa wɔ dapɛn nanu ne, yɛ mukoraati yɛyiale nu kyɛ yɛdidi. Ná Paul hyɛle yebo kyɛ ɔne bɛ dwudwo, ofikyɛ aleɛ kye a, né okofi berɛ kɔhɔ. Yeti odwudwole tonn maa odwuli kɔngɔen tumm. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Nekaa bɔ né yayia nu wɔ aborosaen naso ne, né kanea pee wɔ berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Paul dwudwo ne, né abrandeɛ bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Eutiko te mboma naso. Ɔte berɛ ne, sãa ne wafa nu wala. Ɔlale hatee maa ofili aborosaen bɔ ɔtɔ so nza naso tɔle ase. Bɛmane ye so ne, né wawu. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Na Paul dwu hɔle aseɛ nwo dɔ, na obutule ye so, yeɛ ɔto brale ye hane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔyakyi dede ne, ofikyɛ ɔte ase.” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Afei Paul sa hɔle aborosaen naso, na ɔtenane ase didili. Oyiele ne, ɔtoale so dwudwole tonn maa aleɛ hene, yeɛ ofili berɛ hɔle ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Bɛfale abrandeɛ ne bɛhɔle awuro, na né b'ahone atɔ bɛ kunu alaa maa waboso, ofikyɛ ne abrandeɛ ne te ase.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Yeti yɛfale hyep yɛhɔle Asos kyɛ yɛkwaafa Paul. Ofikyɛ ne wali moa wabɔ y'amaneɛ kyɛ ɔfa ase kɔ dɔ. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Na mmerɛ bɔ yɛyiale ye wɔ Asos ne, yɛfale ye, na yɛhɔle Mitilene. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Aleɛ hene ne, yɛtu yɛfili berɛ yɛhɔle Kios, ye aleɛ hene ne, yɛhɔle Samo, na ye kyẽa bɔ oli berɛ ne, yɛhɔle Mileto. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Né Paul mbena kyɛ ɔsɛkye mmerɛ wɔ Asia mandam nanu, yeti ɔyɛle ye adwene kyɛ ongogyina Efeso, ofikyɛ né ɔpena kyɛ ɔyɛ ye ndɛ, na sɛ ɔkɔyɛ ye a, okodwu Yerusalem kora ne bali Pentekoste afahyɛ ne.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Paul wɔ Mileto ne, ɔfale ngraa mane mbanyi bɔ bɛwɔ Efeso asafo nanu ne. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Mmerɛ bɔ beeyiale ye ne, ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ bɔbɔ ɛmɔse kyɛbɔ mmɔle me bra, fi kyẽa bɔ oli moa bɔ mmale Asia mandam nanu ne, <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />kyɛbɔ mvale anwobraseɛ pee ne mmoen nzone Awurade, ɔne amaneɛ bɔ nwuni ye, ɔnate porɛ bɔ Yudafoɛ ne bɔle nati. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Mmerɛ bɔ né mekyirekyire ɛmɔ wɔ dwaaso ne awuro-awuro nu ne, edwirɛ bɔ ne ɔkɔboka ɛmɔ ne, mamva komapɛ po mamvea. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Mmom nnili Yudafoɛ ne Greekfoɛ adanzeɛ fengyemm kyɛ bɛsakra b'adwene bɛbra Nyameɛ berɛ, ná benya gyidie wɔ Yesu nu. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Na kesaalae ɛmɔnea, honhom ne ahyɛ me kyɛ ngɔ Yerusalem, ɔwɔ nu, menze bɔ ɔkɔto me wɔ berɛ ɔ, <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />nakoso bɔ mese yeɛ ole kyɛ, kuro biala nu ne, honhom krongron ne di m'adanzeɛ kyɛ, bɔ ɔla berɛ onwondɛ me yeɛ ole prizin nnaa ne amanehunu. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Nakoso nná bɔ ohia me yeɛ ole me ngoa, bɔ ohia me yeɛ ole kyɛ ngoyie mirika bɔ metu ne, na mayie ɔsom adwuma bɔ Awurade Yesu fa mane me ne, na ɛhene yeɛ ole kyɛ nni Nyameɛ adom nzɛmba nanwo adanzeɛ fekɔ-fekɔ. <verse eid="ACT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />Afei ɛmɔtie, ɛmɔ bɔ ngane Ahennie nanwo dwirɛ ngyirele ɛmɔ ne, mese kyɛ ɛmɔ nu biala ngonwu me nyunu kõ. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Yeti ɛnɛ, meye ɛmɔ adanzeɛ kyɛ, menni sona biala mogya nwo fɔ, <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />ofikyɛ bɔ Nyameɛ abɔ ye ti anu kyɛ ɔkɔyɛ biala ne, mamva mamvea ɛmɔ, ngane ye mukoraati ngyirele ɛmɔ. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Ɛmɔnea ɛmɔ nwo so, na ɛmɔnea mmoan bɔ honhom krongron né afa bɛ awura ɛmɔ sa naso. Ná ɛmɔnea Nyameɛ asafo bɔ ɔfale ɔwa ne bɔbɔ mogya tɔle naso yé. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Mese kyɛ, mmerɛ bɔ mekɔ ye, mbataku bɔ be ti anu yɛ se koowuraa ɛmɔ nu, na bɛngonya mmoan nanwo aboterɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Afei koso, ɛmɔ bɔbɔ ɛmɔ nu yeɛ ebiemɔ kɔdwɔso kɔhyeɛhyea edwirɛ ne, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛkɔhwe asuafoɛ nemɔ bɛkoli bɛ si. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Yeti ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye la berɛ, na ɛmɔma ɔtena ɛmɔ ti anu kyɛ, mvale mmoen nduli ɛmɔ nu biala fo afoɛ nza, na manyakyi ye lle. <verse eid="ACT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Afei mefa ɛmɔ mewura Nyameɛ sa, na mefa ɛmɔ mewura edwirɛ bɔ ofi ye adom nu nanu. Sɔ dwirɛ ne kɔhora kɔmaa ɛmɔ kɔyɛ se, ná wamaa ɛmɔ agyapadeɛ wɔ bɛbɔ bate bɛ nwo namukoraati nu. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Me nye ammoro ebiala dwetɛ, sikaa kɔkorɛ anaa atadeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Ɛmɔ bɔbɔ ɛmɔse kyɛ, asaa he ala yeɛ ɔmaa mene bɛbɔ bɛboka me so ne nyane bɔ yɛhia ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Mamaa ɛmɔ anwu ye wɔ nikye biala nu kyɛ, odikyɛ ɛmɔyɛ adwuma bɔ ɔyɛ se sɔa bɛfa bɛboka bɛbɔ bayɛ mmerɛ ne, ná ɛmɔkaye Awurade Yesu dwirɛ ne, yenwa: ‘Sɛ yɛkyɛ nikye a, ɔmaa yɛ nye gye pa tra kyɛ yɛkole ɔ.’”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Ɔhane ɛhemɔ yiele ne, obuli ndwerɛ, na ɔne bɛ mukoraati bɔle mbaeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Nahorɛ nu, bɛ mukoraati bɛsuni, na bɛyɛle Paul atuu bɛfele ye noa. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Bɔ ɔmaa bɛ wora bɔle koraa yeɛ ole edwirɛ bɔ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ, bɛngonwu ye nyunu kõ ne. Ná bɛɛsomane ye bɛdwuli hyep nanwo berɛ.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Yɛ ne bɛ tetele nu ne, yɛfale po so yɛwale Kos tee. Na aleɛ hene ne, yɛhɔle Rodo, na ye si ne, yɛhɔle Patara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Yɛnwuni kyɛ hyep bie pɛ nu kɔ Foinike, yeti yɛfole. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Yɛdwuli nekaa bie, né yɛ nye ta Kipro supɔ ne, na yɛyakyile ye wɔ bɛen so yɛpɛle nu yɛhɔle Siria, na yɛɛgyinane Tiro. Ɛberɛ yeɛ né hyep ne baaye ye nningyein ne ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Yeti yɛpenane aliemaa mɔ bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ne, na yɛ tenane berɛ ɛlɛsoo. Ná bɛnate honhom naso bɛha bɛhyirele Paul alaa kyɛ, nnɛmaa ɔkɔ Yerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Yɛ mmerɛ ne sone ne, yɛtoale y'akwanduo naso. Na bɛ mukoraati, bɛne bɛ ye ne bɛ mmaa mɔ somane yɛ atee tonn maa yɛfili kuro nanu. Na yɛ buli ndwerɛ wɔ po ne noa yɛbɔle mbaeɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Yɛne bɛ lili ngraa yiele ne, yɛɛfole hyep ne, na bɛ koso bɛhɔle awuro.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Yɛtu yɛfili Tiro ne, yɛfale po so yɛwale Ptolemai. Na yɛ hyeale aliemaa mɔ, yeɛ yɛtenane bɛ nwo berɛ ɛlɛho. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Aleɛ hene ne, yɛfili berɛ yɛhɔle Kaesarea, na yɛɛtenane Filipo bɔ ɔka nzɛmba n'awuro, né ɔboka mmrienzua nzoo naso. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Né ole mmaa mmrasua asigyafoɛ nná, bɔ bɛhyɛ ngɔm. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Yɛlili ngyẽa kaa wɔ berɛ ne, diifoɛ bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Agabus fili Yudea wale. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Ɔwale nekaa bɔ yɛwɔ ne, na ɔfale Paul bɛlɛt<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Abɔsoɛ.”</char></note> kyekyele ye sa na ye gya, yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: “Bɔ honhom krongron ne aha ɛhe: ‘Sɔa yeɛ Yudafoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Yerusalem ne kɔkyekye brienzua bɔ ye bɛlɛt ɛhe ne, na bɛkɔfa ye bɛkɔma maen-maen nanufoɛ ne.’” <verse eid="ACT 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Yɛtele ye sɔ ne, yɛne mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ namukoraati srɛle Paul kyɛ, nnɛmaa ɔkɔ Yerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Nakoso Paul hane kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔsu maa m'abanu bu ne? Awurade Yesu dumaa ti, mayɛ krado kyɛ bɛkyekye me wɔ Yerusalem. Na sɛ ɔba kyɛ nwu po a, maboaboa me nwo dada.” <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Mmerɛ bɔ yɛnwuni ye kyɛ, bɔ waha ala yeɛ waha ne, yɛyakyile, yeɛ yɛhane kyɛ: “Bɔ Awurade kuro yeɛ ɔyɛ berɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Ngyẽa hemɔ si ne, yɛ boɔboale ye nwo, na yɛsili nu yɛhɔle Yerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Asuafoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Kaesarea ne bie ne yɛ hɔle, na bɛfale yɛ bɛhɔle Mnason bɔ ofi Kipro ne berɛ. Ɔte asuafoɛ bɔ bɛli moa ne bie, na ye awuro yeɛ yɛɛtenane ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Yɛdwuli Yerusalem ne, aliemaa nemɔ lɛle yɛ kama. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Aleɛ hene ne, Paul ne yɛ hɔle Yakobo berɛ, né mbanyi namukoraati wɔ berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Ɔhyeale bɛ yiele ne, ɔhane nningyein bɔ Nyameɛ nate ye som adwuma naso ayɛ ye wɔ maen-maen nanu ne ngoko-ngoko hyirele bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Bɛtele ne, bɛhyɛle Nyameɛ anuonyam. Nakoso bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Aliemaa, nnaa wɔ nye tua Yudafoɛ apee pee bɔ baayɛ gyidifoɛ ne, na bɛ mukoraati koso, mmeraa ne nwo hia bɛ paa. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Na batete kyɛ, ɛka kyire Yudafoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ maen-maen nanu ne kyɛ bɛyakyi Mose mmeraa ne, ná esa ka kyire bɛ kyɛ nnɛmaa bɛpɛ bɛ mmaa mɔ toa, na nnɛmaa bɛdi amammerɛ nemɔ so. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Ye de, nzu yeɛ yɛkɔyɛ ɔ? Ofikyɛ kyɛbɔ ɔte biala ne, bɛkɔte kyɛ awa. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Yeti, yɛ bɔ yɛka yɛkyire wɔ ne. Yɛle mmrienzua nná bie wɔ wa bɔ baha ndaen. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Ɛne sɔ mmrienzua nemɔ hɔ, na ɛmɔɔte ɛmɔ nwo, na tua bɛ nwo kerɛ ma bɛtete bɛ ti. Ɛhene kɔmaa ebiala konwu kyɛ, bɔ bɛkeka bɛfa wɔ nwo ne, ɔtte nahorɛ, na wɔ koso ɛfa mmeraa nanu dwirɛ yɛ adwuma. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Ná maen-maen nanufoɛ bɔ baayɛ gyidifoɛ ne de, gyinayɛ bɔ yasi ne, yahworɔ yaama bɛ kyɛ, bɛhwe bɛ nwo bɛfi aleɛ bɔ bafa babɔ afɔleɛ bama bosoen, mogya, ngaka bɔ bahu bɔ bambɛ bɛ ti, ɔne adwamammɔ nwo.” <verse eid="ACT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Yeti aleɛ hene ne, Paul fale sɔ mmrienzua nemɔ, na ɔne bɛ tele bɛ nwo, yeɛ ɔhɔle asɔre awuro berɛ, na ɔmaa bɛnwuni kyẽa bɔ bɛkɔte bɛ nwo bɛkoyie, ná bɛ nu biala abɔ ye afɔleɛ ne.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Ɔka kaa maa ɛlɛsoo ne so ne, Yudafoɛ bɔ bɛfi Asia ne nwuni ye wɔ asɔre awuro berɛ, bɛnwuni ye ne, bɛmaa mmenia ne yɛle bagya-bagya, na bɛhyele Paul, <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />yeɛ bɛteɛteane nu kyɛ: “Israel mmrienzua, ɛmɔbra! Sɔ biaa he yeɛ okyirekyire ebiala wɔ nekaa biala kyɛ, bɛdwɔso betia yɛ mmenia, yɛ mmeraa, ɔne ɛwa ne. Na afei de, wafa Greekfoɛ wawa asɔre awuro wa waagua nekaa krongron nanwo fiɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Né bali moa banwu Efesoniɛ Trofimo wɔ kuro nanu, na né b'adwene yɛ bɛ kyɛ Paul afa ye ahɔ asɔre awuro berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Kuro nanu mukoraati yɛle bagya-bagya, na mmenia namukoraati tuli mirika bɛɛsɔle Paul nu, na bɛhwene ye bɛfili asɔre awuro berɛ, yeɛ bɛtole anoa nanu ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Ahaa bɛku ye, nakoso né sahene ne ate ye dada kyɛ, Yerusalem ayɛ bagya-bagya. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Na ɛberɛ ala, ɔfale sogyafoɛ mbanyi ne sogyafoɛ wale bɛ so. Bɛnwuni sahene ne né sogyafoɛ nemɔ ne, bɛyakyile Paul bolɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Yeɛ sahene ne hɔle berɛ ɔɔhyele ye, na ɔhyɛle kyɛ bɛfa kyenyi nyɔ bɛkyekye ye. Na obisale bɛ sona-horɛ bɔ ɔte, ɔne bɔ wayɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Na mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ne hyɛle yebo teɛteane nu, ebie ka ɛhe a, né sona foforɛ aha ɛhe. Basabasa nati, wannwu edwirɛ nanu yé, yeti ɔhyɛle kyɛ bɛfa ye bɛhɔ nekaa bɔ sogyafoɛ ne te ne. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Mmerɛ bɔ odwuli stɛps naso ne, basabasa bɔ ne mmenia ne yɛ nati, né odikyɛ sogyafoɛ nemɔ soa Paul, <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />ofikyɛ né ɛlɔen ne li ye si bɛteɛtea nu kyɛ: “Ɛmɔhu ye!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Mmerɛ bɔ sogyafoɛ ne yɛle kyɛ bɛfa ye bɛkɔ nekaa bɔ bɛte ne, Paul ha hyirele sahene ne kyɛ: “Ngɔhora ngɔha edwirɛ bie ngohyire wɔ?” Yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: “Ɛte Greek? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Nná wɔ yeɛ ɛle Egyptniɛ bɔ mmerɛ bie ɛmaa mmenia tele atua, na ɛlili atuturafoɛ 4,000 nyunu maa bɛhɔle ɛserɛ naso ne?” <verse eid="ACT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Paul yele ye noa kyɛ: “Nahorɛ dwirɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ, nde Yudaniɛ, na mvi Tarsus bɔ ɔwɔ Kilikia ne, kuro bɔ wale dumaa paa nanu. Yeti mesrɛ wɔ, ma mene mmenia ne dwudwo.” <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Mmerɛ bɔ ɔmane ye nwo atee ne, Paul gyinane stɛps naso, na ɔmane ye sa so hyirele mmenia ne. Na ɛberɛ yɛle dinn, yeɛ ɔfale Hebri dwudwolɛ ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ:<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Nniema mɔ ne me baba mɔ, ɛmɔtie me noa dwirɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛtele kyɛ, Hebri yeɛ ɔka kyire bɛ ne, ɛberɛ yɛle konn. Yeɛ Paul hane kyɛ: <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />“Nde Yudaniɛ, bɛwole me wɔ Tarsus bɔ ɔwɔ Kilikia ne, na kuro he ala nu yeɛ Gamaliel hyirele me nikye, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ngoli yɛ baba mɔ mmeraa so pɛpɛɛpɛ. Né mebɔ mmɔden wɔ Nyameɛ adwuma nwo, kyɛbɔ ɛmɔyɛ ye ɛnɛ nala. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Bɛbɔ bɛnate Atee he aso ne, nduli me nye nziele bɛ so maa bɛhuni bɛ, na né me kyekye mmrienzua ne mmrasua maa bɛfa bɛ bɛgua prizin, <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />sɔfo panyi ne mbanyi namukoraati te ɛhe anwo adanzefoɛ. Nza nnɛle krataa mvili bɛ berɛ kyɛ mefa mekɔma aliemaa mɔ bɔ bɛwɔ Damasko ne, na nzili nu kyɛ me kwaahye bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ dɔ ne meba Yerusalem maa bɛtwe bɛ so.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />“Na nnate atee so, bɔ waha kaa maa medwu Damasko, kɔyɛ eyia-gyina ne, kanea bie fili anwuro tɔle me so komapɛ, na ɔpɛle me nwo yiale. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Na ndɔle ase, yeɛ ndele kyɛ konviɛ bie ka kyire me kyɛ: ‘Saul, Saul, nzuati yeɛ ɛtane me sɔ ne?’ <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Na ngane kyɛ: ‘Me wura, wɔ yeɛ ɛle nwa?’ Yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: ‘Me yeɛ nne Nazerɛtniɛ Yesu bɔ ɛtane ye nye ne.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Mmrienzua bɔ bɛboka me so ne de, né bɛnwu kanea ne, nakoso né bɛnde bɔ ɔne me dwudwo ne konvi. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Yeti ngane kyɛ: ‘Awurade, nzu yeɛ nyɛ ɔ?’ Yeɛ Awurade ha hyirele me kyɛ: ‘Dwɔso kɔ Damasko, na bɛkɔmaa ekonwu nikye biala bɔ bahyɛ bato berɛ kyɛ ɛyɛ ne.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Kanea bɔ ɔtɔle me so ne anuonyam nati, né menwu hwee, yeti bɛ bɔ bɛboka me so ne yeɛ bɛsosɔle me nu bɛfale me bɛhɔle Damasko ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />Né biaa bie wɔ berɛ bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Ananias, né osuro Nyameɛ, na né odi Mmeraa naso, né Yudafoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ namukoraati bɔ ye dumaa pa. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Sɔ biaa ne wale me berɛ, na ogyinane me nwo berɛ ha hyirele me kyɛ: ‘Nniema Saul, sa nwu nikye!’ Na ɛberɛ ala mmane me ti so, ná nwuni ye. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: ‘Yɛ nana mɔ Nyameɛ ne aye wɔ kyɛ enwu ye apɛdeɛ, na enwu teneneeniɛ ne, ná ɛte ye noa nu dwirɛ, <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />ofikyɛ nningyein bɔ anwu ye na ate ne, ɛkoli ye nwo adanzeɛ kohyire mmenia mukoraati. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Ye de ɛnwondɛ nzu? Dwɔso ma bɛbɔ wɔ asu, na bɔ ye dumaa ma okyikyi wɔ bɔne.’<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />“Na nza mmale Yerusalem, bɔ né mebɔ mbaeɛ wɔ asɔre awuro berɛ ne, nikye bie tɔle me so <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />na nwuni kyɛ Awurade ka kyire me kyɛ: ‘Yɛ ye ndɛ, na fi Yerusalem, ofikyɛ adanzeɛ bɔ ɛdi fa me nwo ne, bɛngole bɛngɔto nu.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Yeɛ ngane kyɛ: ‘Awurade, bɛ bɔbɔ bɛse kyɛ ngyele bɛ bɔ bedɛ wɔ bɛdi ne nguale nu, na ngwale bɛ wɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nemɔ nu; <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />na mmerɛ bɔ bɛhwie Steven bɔ ɔte w'adanzeniɛ ne mogya bɛgua ne, né ngyi berɛ bie na né mefoa bɔ bɛyɛ naso, me yeɛ nneane bɛ bɔ ne bɛku ye ne ndadeɛ so ɔ.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Nakoso ɔha hyirele me kyɛ: ‘Kɔ, ofikyɛ ngɔsoma wɔ maa ɛkɔhɔ maen-maen nanufoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ dede ne dɔ.’”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Betiele ye tonn oodwuli sɔ dwirɛ he aso. Yeɛ bɛmane bɛ konvi so bɛteɛteane nu kyɛ: “Ɛmɔye sona he bɛfi aseɛ naso! Ofikyɛ ɔtte ebie bɔ odikyɛ ɔtena ase ɔ!” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Na bɛteɛteane nu bɛgyili bɛ ndadeɛ bɛguale, yeɛ bɛtotole mvuture bɛguale ewienu, yeti <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />sahene ne maa bɛfale Paul bɛwale nekaa bɔ sogyafoɛ nemɔ te ne, na ɔhane kyɛ bɛgwa ye maa ɔha bɔ wayɛ ɔ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bekonwu bɔ yeti yeɛ mmenia ne teɛteanu gua ye so sɔ ne. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Bɛhwene Paul nu bɔ bɛbaagwa ye ne, obisale sogyaniɛ panyi bɔ ogyi ye nwo berɛ ne kyɛ: “Mmeraa maa ɛmɔ ate maa ɛmɔgwa Romaniɛ, mmerɛ bɔ bɛlili ye dwirɛ ɔ?” <verse eid="ACT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Sogyaniɛ ne tele sɔ dwirɛ ne, ɔhɔle sahene ne berɛ, yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nzu yeɛ ɛpena kyɛ ɛyɛ ne? Nea, sɔ biaa he te Romaniɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Yeti, sahene ne wale ye berɛ, yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Ka kyire me, ɛte Romaniɛ?” Ɔhane kyɛ: “Yoo.” <verse eid="ACT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Yeɛ sahene ne hane kyɛ: “Esikaa piri paa yeɛ nduale kora yeɛ menya ye nwo atee mebayɛ Romaniɛ ɔ.” Yeɛ Paul hane kyɛ: “Nakoso me de, bɛfa bɛwole me.” <verse eid="ACT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Ɛberɛ ala, mmrienzua bɔ ahaa bɛ baaneɛnea ye dwirɛ nu ne hwene bɛ nwo, na esuronyi hane sahene ne, ofikyɛ wafa kyenyi wakyekye Romaniɛ.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Yeti aleɛ hene ne, né ɔpena kyɛ onwu nikye-horɛ deinn ti bɔ Yudafoɛ ne bɔ ye sommoɛ ne, yeti ɔyakyile ye, na ɔfrɛle sɔfo mbanyi nemɔ ne Sanhendrin namukoraati maa beyiale. Na ɔmaa Paul gyinane bɛ nyunu berɛ.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Paul neane Sanhendrin badwa ne haa, yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: “Nniema mɔ, mafa ahonim pa mabɔ me bra wɔ Nyameɛ nyunu tonn maa waadwu ɛnɛ kyẽa ye.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Ɔhane sɔ ne, sɔfo panyi Ananias ha hyirele bɛ bɔ bɛgyi ye nwo berɛ ne kyɛ, bɛbɔ ye noa so. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Yeɛ Paul hane kyɛ: “Nyameɛ baabɔ wɔ, wɔ fasue bɔ baha ye nwo fufue hyɛnn. Atena berɛ kyɛ ɛbaafa Mmeraa ne bu me atɛn, nakoso wɔ bɔbɔ ebu Mmeraa naso hyɛ ebie kyɛ ɔbɔ me?” <verse eid="ACT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Na bɛ bɔ bɛgyi berɛ ne hane kyɛ: “Nyameɛ sɔfo panyi yeɛ ɛpepɛ ye nzoaa ne?” <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Yeɛ Paul hane kyɛ: “Menze kyɛ ɔte sɔfo panyi, ofikyɛ bahworɔ ye wɔ mmeraa nanu kyɛ, ‘Nnɛka edwirɛ tɛɛ fa bɔ odi wɔ maen so nanwo.’”<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Paul nwuni kyɛ mmenia ne bue te Sadukifoɛ, na bɛ bue te Farisifoɛ, yeti ɔteane nu wɔ Sanhendrin ne nyunu kyɛ: “Mmrienzua, nniema mɔ, nde Farisiniɛ, Farisifoɛ awa. Na ewue tingyele bɔ awufo konya ye nanwo anidasoɛ nati yeɛ bɛbu me atɛn ne.” <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Ɔhane ɛhe nala pɛ, edwudwolɛ wale Farisifoɛ ne Sadukifoɛ nemɔ afia, na mmenia nanu hyɛle nyɔ. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Né Sadukifoɛ nemɔ ka kyɛ ewue tingyelɛ, abɔfo anaa honhom biala nne berɛ, nakoso Farisifoɛ nemɔ de, né bedɛ bɛdi kyɛ sɔ nningyein namukoraati wɔ berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Yeti, ɛberɛ yɛle gye-gyee-gye, na atwerɛfoɛ ne biemɔ bɔ bɛte Farisifoɛ ne dwɔsole, na bɛteɛteane nu serɛ-serɛ kyɛ: “Yɛnwuni mvomsoɛ biala bɔ biaa he ayɛ ɔ, ebie po a né honhom anaa abɔfo bie adwudwo ahyire ye.” <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Mmerɛ bɔ dwudwolɛ nanu yɛle se ne, né sahene ne suro kyɛ annea a, né batete Paul nu, yeti ɔhyɛle sogyafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ, bɛhɔ aseɛ nwo dɔ bɛɛle ye bɛfi bɛ sa nu, na bɛfa ye bɛbra nekaa bɔ sogyafoɛ nemɔ te ne.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Kɔngɔen bɔ oli berɛ ne, Awurade wale ye nwo berɛ, yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nya akukuduro! Na kyɛbɔ ali me nwo adanzeɛ fekɔ-fekɔ wɔ Yerusalem ne, sɔ ala yeɛ odikyɛ ɛdi me nwo adanzeɛ wɔ Roman ɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Aleɛ hene ne, Yudafoɛ nemɔ bɔle porɛ, na bɛhane ndaen kyɛ, sɛ bɛhunni Paul a, bɛngɔdidi, na bɛngɔno hwee. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Mmrienzua kɔbo 40 yeɛ né baha sɔ ndaen ne ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Sɔ mmrienzua nemɔ hɔle sɔfo mbanyi ne kuro nanu mbanyi nemɔ berɛ, yeɛ bɛha bɛhyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Yali amoen yaha ndaen kyɛ, sɛ yɛhunni Paul a, yɛngɔdidi, na yɛngɔno hwee. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Yeti ɛmɔ ne Sanhendrin namukoraati hɔ, na ɛmɔɔbɔ sahene ne amaneɛ kyɛ, ɔfa ye berɛ ɛmɔ; na ɛmɔyɛ ɛmɔ nwo kyɛ ɛmɔpena kyɛ ɛmɔneɛnea ye dwirɛ nanu bɛkɔ siɛ. Na kyɛ dee bɔ odwu wa ne, né yahu ye.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Nakoso Paul awosea tele kyɛ, babɔ porɛ kyɛ bɛkɔtetɛ ye, yeti ɔhɔle nekaa bɔ sogyafoɛ nemɔ te ne, ná ɔɔbɔle Paul amaneɛ. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Na Paul koso frɛle sogyafoɛ mbanyi nanu kõ, yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Fa sɔ abrandeɛ he kɔ sahene ne berɛ, ofikyɛ ɔpena kyɛ ɔka edwirɛ bie kyire ye.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Yeti, ɔfale ye hɔle sahene ne berɛ, yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: “Paul bɔ ɔla prizin ne frɛle me, na yenwa mva abrandeɛ he mmerɛ wɔ, ofikyɛ ɔpena kyɛ ɔka edwirɛ bie kyire wɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Sahene ne sɔle abrandeɛ ne sa, na ɔne ye hɔle ahameɛ, yeɛ obisale ye kyɛ: “Nzu yeɛ ɛpena kyɛ ɛka kyire me ne?” <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: “Yudafoɛ ne abɔ porɛ kyɛ, ɛhema, bɛkɔmaa ɛkɔfa Paul kɔwa Sanhendrin ne nyunu, te kyɛ enwa bɛpena kyɛ bɛneɛnea ye dwirɛ nu yé ne. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Nakoso nnɛmaa bɛlaka-laka wɔ, ofikyɛ bɛ nu kɔyɛ 40 kɔtetɛ atee nu, na baha ndaen kyɛ, sɛ bɛhunni Paul a, bɛngɔdidi na bɛngɔno hwee. Na bɔ bɛnwondɛ ala yeɛ ole kyɛ ɛkɔ pene so.” <verse eid="ACT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Yeti sahene ne hyɛle abrandeɛ ne kyɛ: “Nnɛka kyire ebiala kyɛ, aha sɔ dwirɛ he ahyire me,” yeɛ ɔmaa ɔhɔle ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Na ɔfrɛle sogyafoɛ mbanyi nyɔ ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ boɔboa sogyafoɛ 200 noa, na ɛmɔsa bɛboɔboa 70 bɔ bɛte pɔngɔ so ne 200 bɔ bɛtire-tira pea noa, sɛ ɔbɔ kɔngɔen 9:00<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">9:00 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dɔnhwere bɔ ɔtɔ so nza.</char></note> a, ɛmɔ kosi nu bɛkɔhɔ Kaesarea. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Afei, ɛmɔpena mbɔngɔ bɔ Paul kɔtena so, na ɛmɔfa ye bɛhɔ amrado Felix berɛ asomdwie nu.” <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Na ɔhworɔle sɔ krataa he bokale so kyɛ:<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />Klaudio Lisia yeɛ metworɔ krataa he ɔ.</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 23:26">Na metworɔ mebrɛ Onuoyamfoɛ Amrado Felix.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 23:26" />
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 23:26">Me kyẽa wɔ.<verse eid="ACT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Yudafoɛ nemɔ hyele sɔ biaa he, na né bɛpena kyɛ bɛku ye, nakoso mene sogyafoɛ nemɔ hɔle berɛ ndɛ, yeɛ yɛɛlɛle ye ɔ; ofikyɛ nwuni kyɛ né ɔte Romaniɛ. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Né mepena kyɛ menwu bɔ yeti yeɛ bɛbɔ ye sommoɛ ne, yeti mvale ye ngɔle Sanhendrin ne nyunu. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Nakoso mma nwuni kyɛ, sãa bɛ mmeraa nanwo dwirɛ biemɔ ti yeɛ babɔ ye kwaadu ne, ná ɔyɛlle nikye biala bɔ yeti odikyɛ bɛku ye anaa ɔda prizin ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Na ebiemɔ abɔ me amaneɛ kyɛ babɔ ye nwo porɛ kyɛ bɛkɔhu ye, yeti yeɛ me maa ɔba wɔ berɛ ndɛ ne. Na bɛ bɔ bɛne ye le edwirɛ ne koso, meka mekyire bɛ kyɛ, bɛbra wɔ dɔ, na bɛɛbɔ ye kwaadu.<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Yeti kɔngɔen nala, sogyafoɛ nemɔ fale Paul, na bɛne ye hɔle Antipatris, kyɛbɔ bahyɛ nala. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Aleɛ hene ne, bɛmaa sogyafoɛ bɔ bɛte mbɔngɔ so ne fale ye hɔle, na bɛ ngaa ne sa wale nekaa bɔ sogyafoɛ nemɔ te ne. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Sogyafoɛ bɔ bɛte pɔngɔ so ne hɔle Kaesarea, na bɛfale krataa ne bɛmane amrado ne, yeɛ bɛfale Paul bɛwurale ye sa ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Yeti ɔkengale krataa ne, na obisale Paul mandam bɔ ofi nu ɔ, na onwuni kyɛ ofi Kilikia. <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Sɛ bɛ bɔ babɔ wɔ kwaadu ne ba a, ngɔto me bo ase ngotie wɔ dwirɛ namukoraati.” Na ɔhyɛle kyɛ, bɛnea ye so wɔ Herode ahemvie berɛ.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Ɛlɛnnu si ne, Sɔfo Panyi Ananias ne mbanyi biemɔ ne lɔya bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Tertulo wale Kaesarea. Na bɛɛbɔle Paul kwaadu wɔ amrado ne nyunu. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Bɛfrɛle Tertulo ne, ɔbɔle Paul sommoɛ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:2">“Onuoyamfoɛ Felix, wɔ yeɛ amaa yanya asomdwie paa ɔ, na ɔnate kyɛ ɛdwene kɔ siɛ nati, sɔ maen he atu mbɔn paa, <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />na daa biala yɛmaa yɛ nye sɔ bɔ ayɛ ne paa, na yɛka ye nwo dwirɛ ɔmva ye nwo ne nekaa biala bɔ yɛwɔ ne. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Nakoso yɛmbena kyɛ yɛsɛkye wɔ mmerɛ, yeti yɛsrɛ wɔ, nwu yɛ anwunvo na tie yɛ kaa. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Yanwu kyɛ sɔ akoaa he te ebie bɔ otutu maen bo, ná otutu gua Yudafoɛ ne so anu maa bɛte atua wɔ aseɛ he aso mukoraati, na ye yeɛ ɔla Nazerɛtfoɛ kue ne noa ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Afei, ɔyɛle ye adwene kyɛ ogua asɔre awuro nanwo fiɛ, yeti yeɛ yɛhyele ye ne. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />— <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Sɛ wɔ bɔbɔ ɛneɛnea ye dwirɛ nu a, ekonwu kyɛ sommoɛ bɔ yafa yabɔ ye namukoraati te nahorɛ.”<verse eid="ACT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Na Yudafoɛ nemɔ fa tole so kyɛ, bɔ ɔka ne te nahorɛ.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Amrado ne bɔle ye ti ngo hyirele Paul kyɛ odwudwo, yeti ɔhane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:10">“Mese paa kyɛ, ɛyɛle maen he temmufoɛ ne, afoɛ pee ɛhe, yeti ɔyɛ me fɛ kyɛ meye me noa wɔ wɔ nyunu ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Ngɔle Yerusalem kyɛ mekwaaso ne, kɔyɛ kyɛ ngyẽa buru-ne-nyɔ ɛhe, wɔ bɔbɔ ɛkɔhora kobisa nu kɔnea. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Na bannwu me lle kyɛ mene ebie su aporowaa wɔ asɔre awuro berɛ, anaakyɛ me maa mmenia yɛ basa-basa wɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nanu, anaa kuro nanu. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Ná kwaadu bɔ babɔ me kesaalae ne, bɛlle ye nwo adanzeɛ biala. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Nakoso bɔ medɛ́ meto nu wɔ wɔ nyunu yeɛ ole kyɛ, kue bɔ bɛnwa mate ne, ɛhene yeɛ ole atee bɔ mefa so me so me nana mɔ Nyameɛ ɔ, ofikyɛ bɔ Mmeraa ne ka, ɔne bɔ bahworɔ ye wɔ Adiifoɛ nemɔ nwomaa nanu ne, medɛ́ ye namukoraati medi. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Na anidasoɛ bɔ nne ye wɔ Nyameɛ nu yeɛ ole kyɛ, mmerɛ bie kɔwa bɔ teneneefoɛ ne abɔnefoɛ mukoraati kɔdwɔso kofi ewue nu, na mmrienzua hemɔ koso le sɔ anidasoɛ nala bie. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Sɔ anidasoɛ he ati yeɛ mebɔ mmɔden kyɛ ngonya ahonim pa wɔ Nyameɛ ne sona nyunu ne. <verse eid="ACT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />Afoɛ pee si ne, mmale kyɛ mebaayɛ me maen adɔyɛ, ná mebɔ afɔleɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Mmerɛ bɔ meyɛ sɔ nningyein nemɔ ne, bɛnwuni me wɔ asɔre awuro berɛ kyɛ mate me nwo kama, nakoso né ɛlɔen biala bokka me so, na né menyɛ basa-basa koso. Yudafoɛ biemɔ bɔ bɛfi Asia yeɛ ne bɛwɔ berɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Sɔ mmenia nemɔ po yeɛ sɛ bɛle edwirɛ bie betia me a, odikyɛ ahaa bɛba wɔ nyunu bɛbabɔ me kwaadu ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Sɛ ɔtte sɔ a, ma mmenia hemɔ ha bɔne bɔ bɛnwuni ye wɔ me nwo, mmerɛ bɔ ne ngyi Sanhendrin ne nyunu ne, <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />sana edwirɛ komapɛ bɔ ndeane nu wɔ bɛ nyunu berɛ ngane ne, na yeɛ ole kyɛ: ‘Awufo tingyele nati yeɛ ɛnɛ bɛbu me atɛn ne.’”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Né Felix se Atee nanwo dwirɛ pee, yeti otuli bɛ dwirɛ ne hyɛle kyẽa, yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: “Sɛ Lisia bɔ ɔte sahene ne ba a, yeɛ ngobua ɛmɔ dwirɛ ne ɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Na ɔha hyirele sogyaniɛ panyi ne kyɛ ɔnea ye so, nakoso ɔma ye ahofadie kaa, na bɛma ye nnamvo atee maa bɛyɛ nningyein biemɔ bɛma ye.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Ngyẽa bie si ne, Felix ne ɔye Drusila wale, né ɔye ne te Yudaniɛ. Felix maa bɛfale Paul bɛwale, na ɔmaa ɔhane Kristo Yesu nu gyidie nwo dwirɛ hyirele ye. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Nakoso, mmerɛ bɔ Paul ka tenenee, ahosodi ne atemmuo bɔ ɔkɔwa nanwo dwirɛ ne, esuronyi hane Felix, na ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Kesaalae de kɔ, sɛ menya atee a, ngɔmaa bɛkɔfrɛ wɔ bieku.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Sɔ mmerɛ namu, ne ye nye la so kyɛ Paul kɔma ye sikaa. Ɛhene ti, né ɔtaa maa bɛfrɛ ye maa ɔne ye bɔ ngɔmmɔ. <verse eid="ACT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Nakoso afoɛ nyɔ si ne, Porkio Festo sili Felix gya nu; na ɔnate kyɛ ne Felix pena kyɛ onya anuonyam wɔ Yudafoɛ nemɔ nyunu nati, ɔyakyile Paul wɔ prizin berɛ.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Festo hyɛle ye adwuma bo wɔ mandam nanu ne, ye ɛlɛsa so ne, ofili Kaesarea hɔle<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Fo hɔle.”</char></note> Yerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Ná sɔfo mbanyi ne Yuda kuro nanu mbanyi ne fale Paul kwaadu ne tole ye nyunu. Na bɛsrɛle Festo <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />kyɛ ɔlo bɛ, na ɔfa Paul bra Yerusalem. Né bayɛ b'adwene kyɛ bɛkɔtetɛ ye wɔ atee nu, na bahu ye. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Nakoso Festo ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ bɛma Paul la prizin wɔ Kaesarea, ofikyɛ ɔngɔhyɛ, ɔkɔhɔ dɔ. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Na ɔhane kyɛ: “Sɛ ɔte amba kyɛ biaa he ayɛ bɔne bie a, ɛmɔma atitire bɔ bɛwɔ ɛmɔ nu ne né me hɔ, na bɛɛbɔ ye kwaadu.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Festo tenane berɛ kɔyɛ ngyẽa mmɔtwɛ bɔ ɔkɔ buru so ne, osa hɔle Kaesarea. Aleɛ hene ne, ɔtenane ase kyɛ odi dwirɛ, na ɔmaa bɛfale Paul bɛwale. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Paul wale ne, Yudafoɛ bɔ bɛfi Yerusalem bawa ne pɛle ye nwo yiale, na bɛbɔle ye sommoɛ pee, nakoso né bɛlle adanzeɛ biala. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Ná Paul yele ye nwo noa kyɛ: “Nyɛlle bɔne biala ndiale Yudafoɛ mmeraa ne, asɔre awuro ne, anaa Kaesare.” <verse eid="ACT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Ɔnate kyɛ ne Festo pena kyɛ onya Yudafoɛ ne nyunu anuonyam nati, obisale Paul kyɛ: “Ɛpena kyɛ ɛkɔ Yerusalem, ná bɛkodi edwirɛ he wɔ me nyunu anaa?” <verse eid="ACT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Nakoso Paul hane kyɛ: “Ngyi Kaesare kɔɔto, na ɛwa yeɛ odikyɛ bɛbu me atɛn ɔ. Na kyɛbɔ wɔ bɔbɔ anwu ye ne, nyɛlle Yudafoɛ ne bɔne biala. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Sɛ ɔte amba kyɛ mayɛ nikye bie bɔ odikyɛ mewu a, menzrɛ kyɛ bɛyakyi me; nakoso sɛ nahorɛ biala nne edwirɛ bɔ bafa bato me so nanu a, ebiala lle ye nwo atee kyɛ ɔfa me ma bɛ. Mefa me dwirɛ ne mema Kaesare.” <verse eid="ACT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Festo ne ye mbanyi ne tuli agyina yiele ne, ɔha hyirele Paul kyɛ: “Sɛ Kaesare yeɛ afa wɔ dwirɛ ne ama ye a, ɛkɔhɔ Kaesare dɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Ngyẽa bie si ne, Ɔhene Agripa ne Bɛnis wale Kaesarea kyɛ bɛbaahyea Festo, na bɛyɛ ye ayikoo. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Né bɛkoli ngyẽa kaa wɔ berɛ, yeti Festo fale Paul dwirɛ ne tole bɛ nyunu kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:14">“Felix yakyile biaa bie wɔ prizin, <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />na mmerɛ bɔ né nwɔ Yerusalem ne, sɔfo mbanyi ne Yudafoɛ mbanyi ne fale ye nwo dwirɛ tole me nyunu, na bɛsrɛle kyɛ mmu ye kumfɔ. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Nakoso nga ngyirele bɛ kyɛ, ɔtte mmeraa wɔ Roman kyɛ yɛkobu ebie fɔ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɛkɔsɔ bɛ bɔ babɔ ye kwaadu ne nye, sana sona ne yia bɛ bɔ babɔ ye kwaadu ne, na ɔye ye nwo noa wɔ edwirɛ bɔ bafa bato yeso nanwo kora. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Yeti bɛwale wa ne, mandena-tena ye nwo, aleɛ hene nala ndenane kɔɔto berɛ, yeɛ mmaa bɛfale biaa ne bɛwale ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Bɛhyɛle yebo kyɛ bɛdwudwo ne, bɔne bɔ né m'adwene yɛ me kyɛ ebie a wayɛ ne, nná ɛhene po yeɛ bɛhane ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Mmom atee bɔ bɛfa so bɛsõ bɛ nyameɛ nanwo aporowaa, ɔne biaa bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Yesu bɔ wawu, nakoso Paul asɔ nu twann kyɛ ɔte ase nanwo aporowaa yeɛ bɛne ye suli ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Né mennwu bɔ nyɛ ye wɔ sɔ dwirɛ nanwo, yeti mmisale ye kyɛ, okuro kyɛ ɔkɔ Yerusalem maa bɛdi sɔ dwirɛ ne wɔ berɛ anaa? <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Nakoso Paul hane kyɛ, bɛma ɔla prizin ma Otumvoɛ ne bua edwirɛ ne. Yeti ngane kyɛ bɛfa ye bɛto prizin kodwu kyɛ ngɔfa ye ngɔhɔ Kaesare dɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Na Agripa ha hyirele Festo kyɛ: “Me bɔbɔ mepena kyɛ metie biaa ne noa dwirɛ.” Na ɔhane kyɛ, “Ɛhema ɛkotie ye noa dwirɛ.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Aleɛ hene ne, Agripa ne Bɛnis wuro-wurale bɛ nwo pɔsɔɔ wale nekaa bɔ bɛdi edwirɛ ne. Bɛba ne, bɛne asahene, ne mmeni titire bɔ bɛwɔ kuro nanu ne yeɛ bɛwale ɔ. Yeɛ Festo hane kyɛ bɛfa Paul bɛbra, yeti bɛfale ye bɛwale. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Na Festo hane kyɛ: “Ɔhene Agripa, ne ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔ ne yɛ ayia nu mukoraati, ɛmɔ anwu sɔ biaa he? Biaa he yeɛ Yudafoɛ namukoraati fale ye nwo dwirɛ tole me nyunu wɔ Yerusalem ne ɛwa, ná bɛteɛteane nu kyɛ, nnɛmaa ɔtena ngoa nu kõ ne. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Nakoso manwu kyɛ, ɔyɛlle nikye biala bɔ odikyɛ bɛku ye ɔ, yeti mmerɛ bɔ biaa he hane kyɛ, wafa ye dwirɛ ne wama Otumvoɛ ne, nyɛle kyɛ ngɔmaa bɛkɔfa ye bɛkɔhɔ. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Nakoso nnne edwirɛ biala bɔ metworɔ mefa ye nwo mekɔma me Wura ɔ. Yeti mafa ye mawa ɛmɔ mukoraati nyunu, ye titire ne, wɔ, Ɔhene Agripa, na sɛ yɛneɛnea ye dwirɛ nanu yɛyie a, manwu bɔ metworɔ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Ofikyɛ nyanza nne nu kyɛ ngɔfa ebie bɔ ɔla prizin ngɔhɔ bɔ olle kwaadu biala ɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Agripa ha hyirele Paul kyɛ: “Ɛkɔhora kɔye wɔ nwo noa.” Yeti Paul tengyɛle ye sa, na ɔhyɛle yebo dwudwole kyɛ: <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Ɔhene Agripa, kwaadu bɔ Yudafoɛ abɔ me namukoraati, ɔyɛ me fɛ paa kyɛ wɔ nyunu yeɛ meye me noa ɔ, <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />ofikyɛ wɔ de, ɛse Yudafoɛ amammerɛ paa, na ɛse nningyein bɔ bɛsu ye nwo aporowaa ne koso. Yeti mesrɛ wɔ, nya aboterɛ tie me. <verse eid="ACT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />Nahorɛ dwirɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ ofi me ngwalaa nu, bra bɔ mabɔ ye wɔ me maen nu ne Yerusalem namukoraati ne, Yudafoɛ se ye mu. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Bɛse me dada, na sɛ bɛkoli me nwo adanzeɛ po a, bɛse kyɛ né nde Farisiniɛ bɔ odi ye som nu amaneɛ so pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Nakoso kesaalae de, ɛbɔ bɔ Nyameɛ hyɛle yɛ nana mɔ nanwo anidasoɛ bɔ nne ye nati yeɛ bɛdi me dwirɛ ne, <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />na sɔ bɔhyɛ he ala yeɛ né abusuakue 12 ne nye la so kyɛ ɔkɔwa nu, bɔ yeti, bɛyerele bɛ nwo bɛsõne Nyameɛ eyia ne kɔngɔen ne. Nana, sɔ anidasoɛ he anwo yeɛ Yudafoɛ nemɔ abɔ me kwaadu ne. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Nzuati yeɛ ɔyɛ se ma ɛmɔ kyɛ ɛmɔkole bɛkoli kyɛ Nyameɛ tingye awufo ɔ?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />“Me sɔa, né menwu ye kyɛ odikyɛ meyɛ nningyein pee mefa mekõ metia Nazerɛtniɛ Yesu dumaa ne. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Na sɔ ala yeɛ nyɛle ye wɔ Yerusalem ɔ; tumi bɔ sɔfo mbanyi nemɔ fa mane me nati, ngyele akrongronfoɛ pee nguale prizin. Na sɛ́ bɛku bɛ a, né mefoa so. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Né metaa metwe bɛ so wɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nanu, na mmɔle mmɔden kyɛ ngɔhyɛ bɛ maa bɛkɔyakyi bɛ gyidie nu. Na ɔnate kyɛ né me nye aboro bɛ so nati, ngɔle nguro foforɛ so ngɔndane bɛ nye wɔ berɛ.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />“Mmerɛ bɔ ne ngu so meyɛ ɛhe ne, sɔfo mbanyi nemɔ mane me tumi, na bɛhyɛle me kyɛ ngɔ Damasko. Na nnate atee so mekɔ ne, <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Nana, né ɔte eyia-gyina, ná bɔ nwuni ye ala yeɛ ole kyɛ, kanea bie bɔ tra eyia fi anwuro apɛ mene bɛ bɔ mene bɛ nate nanwo ayia. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Na yɛte yɛguale ase ne, ndele kyɛ konviɛ bie ka kyire me wɔ Hebri nu kyɛ: ‘Saul, Saul, nzuati yeɛ ɛtane me sɔ ne? Sɛ ɛfa wɔ gya bɔ pɔmaa noa a, ɔkɔyɛ wɔ yea.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Yeɛ ngane kyɛ: ‘Me wura, wɔ yeɛ ɛle nwa?’ Na Awurade ha hyirele me kyɛ: ‘Me yeɛ nne Yesu bɔ ɛtane ye nye ne. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Nakoso dwɔso gyina wɔ gya so. Ofikyɛ bɔ wamaa maye me nwo ali mahyire wɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, nningyein bɔ anwu ye, ate, ɔne bɔ ngɔmaa ekonwu ye kɔfa me nwo ne, ɛkɔyɛ ye nwo somvoɛ ne danzeniɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Na ngole wɔ ngofi mmenia hemɔ ne maen-maen nanufoɛ ne sa nu. Bɛ yeɛ mesoma wɔ bɛ berɛ <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />maa ɛkɔbukye bɛ nye, na wamaa bafi awosii nu bawa kanea nu, ná bafi Satan tumi bo, bawa Nyameɛ berɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bekonya bɔne-fakyɛ, ná banya agyapadeɛ wɔ bɛ bɔ gyidie bɔ banya ye wɔ me nu ne amaa bɛ nwo ate nanu.’<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />“Yeti Ɔhene Agripa, anisoadehu bɔ ofi anwuro ne, mannyɛ ye nwo asoserɛ, <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />mmon nni moa ngane ye nwo dwirɛ ngyirele bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Damasko ne, afei nga ngyirele bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Yerusalem ne, ɔne bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Yudea mandam namukoraati nu, yeɛ maen-maen nanufoɛ ne koso. Nga ngyirele bɛ kyɛ bɛsakra b'adwene, na bɛyɛ nningyein bɔ okyire adwene-sakra, ná wamaa bawa Nyameɛ berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Ɛhe ati yeɛ Yudafoɛ ne hyele me wɔ asɔre awuro berɛ bɔ ahaa bɛku me ne. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Nakoso mmokalɛ bɔ Nyameɛ aboka me nati yeɛ ɛnɛ, ndɛ́ te ase bɔ medi adanzeɛ mekyire atitire ne ngoaa ne. Nakoso bɔ adiifoɛ nemɔ ne Mose hane kyɛ okosi ne, ɛhene ala yeɛ meka ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />Na yeɛ ole kyɛ, né odikyɛ Kristo ne nwu amaneɛ, na ɔnate kyɛ ye yeɛ bɛkɔ limoa bɛkotingye ye bɛkofi ewue nu nati, né ɔkɔbɔ kanea ne dawure kohyire mmenia hemɔ ne maen-maen nanufoɛ ne.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Ná Paul gu so ɔka ɛhemɔ fa ye ye noa ne, Festo teane nu kyɛ: “Paul, ɛpena bɔ laen! Adesua pee ne pena fa wɔ ti anu!” <verse eid="ACT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Nakoso Paul hane kyɛ: “Onuoyamfoɛ Festo, nná ɛlaen yeɛ mebɔ ɔ, m'adwene nu la berɛ paa, na nahorɛ paa yeɛ meka ne. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Na bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, Ɔhene bɔ mefa ahotɔsoɛ meka edwirɛ he mekyire ye ne koso se bɔ meka ne yé paa; na medɛ́ medi kyɛ ɛhemɔ nu biala nne berɛ bɔ ɔnze ɔ, ofikyɛ enu biala nne berɛ bɔ bɛyɛle ye wɔ kokoanu ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Ɔhene Agripa, nnaa edɛ adiifoɛ nemɔ di? Mese kyɛ edɛ bɛ di.” <verse eid="ACT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Nakoso Agripa ha hyirele Paul kyɛ: “Waha kaa bie, ahaa ɛma meyɛ Kristoniɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Na Paul koso hane kyɛ: “Sɛ waha kaa oo, sɛɛ ɔkɔhyɛ oo, me de, ɔhale me ngome a, ahaa Nyameɛ amaa ɛne bɛ bɔ betie me namukoraati ayɛ kyɛ me, bɔ kyenyi he bokka so ɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Afei ɔhene ne dwɔsole, na amrado ne né Bɛnis ne bɛ bɔ bɛne ye tete berɛ ne koso dwɔsole. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Na bɛkɔ ne, edwirɛ bɔ ne bɛka yeɛ ole kyɛ: “Sɔ biaa he yɛlle nikye fee bɔ odikyɛ bɛku ye anaa bɛfa ye bɛto prizin ɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Yeɛ Agripa ha hyirele Festo kyɛ: “Sɛ nná edwirɛ bɔ wafa wama Kaesare ne a, ahaa yɛkɔhora yɛkɔyakyi ye.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Afei, bɛsili gyinayɛ kyɛ odikyɛ yɛkɔ Italy, na bɛfale Paul ne prizinfoɛ biemɔ bɛwurale sogyaniɛ panyi bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Julius ne sa, né ɔboka sogyafoɛ kue bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Augusto naso. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Yeti yɛfole hyep bie wɔ Adramatio, né sɔ hyep ne baatu kɔ nekaa ahoroɛ bɔ hyep gyina wɔ Asia mandam nanu ne. Né Makedonianiɛ Aristarko, bɔ ofi Tɛsalonika ne boka yɛ so. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Aleɛ hene ne, yɛɛgyinane Sidon, na Julius bokale Paul paa, ɔmane ye atee maa ɔhɔle ye nnamvo mɔ berɛ maa bɛneane ye. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Yɛtu yɛfili Sidon ne, né mvrama ne bɔ yia yɛ, yeti yɛfale nekaa bie bɔ ne ɔkɔmaa Kipro kole yɛ kofi mvrama ne noa. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Na yɛfale Kilikia ne Pamfilia ɛpo naso alaa yɛwale nekaa bɔ hyep gyina wɔ Mira bɔ ɔwɔ Lisia ne. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Yɛdwuli berɛ ne, sogyaniɛ panyi ne nwuni hyep bie bɔ ofi Alɛzandria ɔkɔ Italy, na ɔmaa yɛfole. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Né hyep ne ngora kɔ, yeti yɛlili ngyẽa pee wɔ atee nu, na yɛ nwo hyerele yɛ paa, nakoso ngaka-ngaka, yɛɛdwuli Knido. Yeti, yɛfale Salmone, né ɛberɛ kɔmaa Kreta kole yɛ kofi mvrama nanu. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Na yɛmiane yɛ nye yɛfale ɛpo ne noa ngaka-ngaka yɛɛdwuli nekaa bie bɔ bɛfrɛ berɛ Nekaa Pa Bɔ Hyep Gyina ne, né opingye Lasea kuro ne.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Yɛhyɛle berɛ pa, na sɔ mmerɛ ne, né ɔyɛ suro kyɛ yɛkɔfa nzue naso, ofikyɛ ne Kyẽa bɔ bɛyɛ akɔngyere bɛsrɛ bɔne-fakyɛ ne po apɛ nu, yeti Paul tuli bɛ fo kyɛ, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />“Ngya mɔ, menwu ye kyɛ sɛ yɛtoa so a, nningyein kɔsɛkye. Nná hyep ne né enu nningyein ngome yeɛ ɔkɔsɛkye ɔ, mmom yɛ ngoa koso kofi yɛ sa.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Nakoso sogyaniɛ panyi ne amva Paul dwirɛ ne, mmom otiele hyep ne wura ne bɔ ɔka hyep ne. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Afei koso, sɛ́ ayirɛ ba a, ɛyɛ né yenoa yɛ se paa wɔ nekaa bɔ hyep ne gyinane ne, yeti mmeni pee nala hane kyɛ, yɛtu yɛfi berɛ, na yɛnea sɛ yɛkɔhora yɛkoodwu Foinise a, ná yatena berɛ maa ayirɛ ne apɛ nu. Né Foinise te nekaa bɔ ɛlɛen gyina wɔ Kreta, na ɛkora fa <char style="tl">North-East</char> ne <char style="tl">South-West</char> kɔ berɛ.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Mvrama bɔkɔɔ bie hyɛle yebo kyɛ ɔbɔ fi ngwaen, yeti ne bɛnwu ye kyɛ, bɔ b'adwene ye nwo ne kɔyɛ yé. Yeti bɛtuli sɛkyɛ ne, na bɛfale Kreta po ne noa bɛhɔle. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Mmerɛ kaa bie si ne, mvrama kandinga bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye <char style="tl">Eurakilo</char><note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okyire mvrama bɔ ɔbɔ fi sorɔ.</char></note> hyɛle yebo kyɛ otu. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Né mvrama ne bɔ yia hyep ne, na né yɛyɛ ye nwo hwee a, ɔnyɛ yé, yeti yɛyakyile maa mvrama ne hwene yɛ hɔle. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Yesi ne, yɛfale nekaa bie bɔ ne ɔkɔmaa supɔ kaa bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Kauda ne kɔbɔ yɛ nwo waen kofi mvrama nanwo, nakoso yɛfɛle pa, kora yeɛ yɛsa ka ɛlɛen<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ɛlɛen </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ne te </char><char style="it">Life boat.</char></note> bɔ ɔbɔ yɛ hyep ne bo ne ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Bɛfale ɛlɛen ne bɛwale hyep nanu ne, bɛfale nyamaa bɛfale hyep nabo bɛkyekyele hyep ne paa. Na ɔnate kyɛ né bɛsuro kyɛ annea a né hyep ne atimu Sirti anweaa nanu nati, bɛsangyele nyamaa bɔ otire-tira hyep né tena nanu ne maa mvrama ne bɔbɔ fale yɛ hɔle. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Na ɔnate kyɛ ne mvrama ne toto yɛ nati, aleɛ hene ne, bɛhyɛle yebo kyɛ bɛye ɛlɛen nanu nningyein ne bie bɛgua. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Ye ɛlɛsa so ne, bɛfale bɛsa bɛtutule hyep nanwo nningyein ne bie bɛguale. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Ngyẽa pee pɛle nu bɔ né yɛnnwuni eyia anaa nzramaa, na ne mvrama kandinga ne tɛ́ tu. Yeti né yɛlle anidasoɛ biala kyɛ yekonya ngoa.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Né ngyẽa pee apɛ nu bɔ yɛllili hwee, yeti Paul dwɔso gyinane bɛ afia, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Ngya mɔ, né odikyɛ ahaa ɛmɔtie me. Sɛ yandu yamvi Kreta a, ahaa yɛngonwu sɔ amaneɛ he maa ɛmɔ ngɔhwere sɔ nningyein hemɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Nakoso meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ɛmɔha ɛmɔ ahone bɛto ɛmɔ kunu, ofikyɛ sona-horɛ po ngowu, hyep ne mmom yeɛ ɔkɔsɛkye ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Ɛnɛ kɔngɔen, Nyameɛ bɔ nde ye deɛ, na mesõ ye ne, ye abɔfo wale me nwo berɛ, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />na ɔha hyirele me kyɛ: ‘Paul, nnɛsuro. Odikyɛ egyina Kaesare nyunu. Na ɛse, Nyameɛ afa bɛ bɔ ɛne bɛ tu atee namukoraati ama wɔ.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Yeti ngya mɔ, ɛmɔnya akukuduro, na medɛ́ Nyameɛ medi kyɛ, bɔ waha wahyire me ne, ɔkɔwa nu pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Nakoso, mvrama ne kɔfa yɛ koogua supɔ bie so.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Odwuli kɔngɔen bɔ ɔtɔ so buru-ne-nná ne, né mvrama ne tɛ́ fa yɛ di akɔ-ne-aba wɔ Adria<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Mediterania po.”</char></note> po naso. Na kɔngɔen tumm ne, né bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ adwuma wɔ hyep nanu ne adwene yɛ bɛ kyɛ, yɛpena yɛpingye aseɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Yeti, bɛtole nyamaa bɛguale nzue nabo bɛfa bɛsusuli, na bɛnwuni kyɛ ye tendee ne te mita 36, yeti bɛhɔle bɛ nyunu kaa, na bɛsa bɛsusuli, na bɛnwuni kyɛ ɔte mita 27. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Né bɛsuro kyɛ yɛkɔɔfofo nyɔboɛ bie so; yeti bɛyakyile sɛkyɛ nná nu bɛfili ɛlɛen ne si dɔ bɛguale nzue nanu; ná ɔhale bɛ ngome a, né aleɛ ahe. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Né hyep nanu adwumayɛfoɛ ne pena kyɛ bɛnwati bɛfi hyep nanu, yeti bɛyakyile ɛlɛen ne bɛsiele ɛpo naso, na bɛhyɛda bɛyɛle bɛ nwo kyɛ bɛkwaasangye sɛkyɛ ne wɔ hyep ne nyunu dɔ, <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />nakoso Paul ha hyirele sogyaniɛ panyi ne kyɛ: “Sɛ sɔ mmenia hemɔ andena hyep nanu a, ɛmɔngonya ngoa.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Yeti sogyafoɛ nemɔ pɛle ɛlɛen ne nyamaa ne, na bɛmaa ɔtɔle nzue nanu.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Aleɛ baahe ne, Paul srɛle bɛ mukoraati kyɛ bɛdidi, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ afa ngyẽa buru-ne-nná banwodɛ paa bɔ aleɛ biala hanne ɛmɔ noa. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Yeti mesrɛ ɛmɔ, ɛmɔdidi kaa, na ɔkɔboka ɛmɔ, ofikyɛ ɛmɔ nu biala nne berɛ bɔ ye ti nwiaa komapɛ po komini ɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Ɔhane ɛhe yiele ne, ɔfale paanoo, na ɔlale Nyameɛ ase wɔ bɛ mukoraati nyunu, yeɛ obuli nu hyɛle yebo lili ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Yeti bɛ mukoraati benyane akukuduro bɛhyɛle yebo bɛdidili. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Mmenia 276 yeɛ ne bɛwɔ hyep nanu ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Bɛdidili maa bɛ ko yili ne, bɛgyili hwiit bɔ ɔwɔ ɛlɛen nanu ne bɛguale ɛpo nanu, maa hyep nanu yɛle nyera.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Aleɛ hene ne, né bɛnnwu aseɛ ne, nakoso bɛnwuni ɛpo noa bɔ ɛpo ne adidi awura aseɛ nanu, yeti bɛyɛle b'adwene kyɛ, sɛ ɔkɔyɛ ye a, bɛkɔfa hyep ne bɛkɔhɔ dɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Yeti bɛpepɛle sɛkyɛ nemɔ nu maa oguale ɛpo nanu, na bɛsangyele stiya ne nyamaa nemɔ. Yeɛ bɛfale ɛtena bɔ ɔwɔ hyep ne nyunu ne bɛhyirele mvrama ne, na bɛsili nu kyɛ bɛkɔ ɛpo ne noa dɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Nakoso, hyep ne fofole anweaa sire bie so wɔ ɛpo nanu, na ye nyunu ne timuni maa ɔhale berɛ, na asorɔkye bɔ né ɔbɔ serɛ-serɛ ne bubuli ye si nanu mmaa-mmaa. <verse eid="ACT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Yeti, sogyafoɛ nemɔ yɛle kyɛ, bɛku prizinfoɛ ne, na ebiala ammia anwanti. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Nakoso né sogyaniɛ panyi ne abɔ ye ti anu porɛ kyɛ okole Paul ngoa, yeti wamma bɛ atee maa bannyɛ bɔ né bɛpena kyɛ bɛyɛ ne. Mmom ɔhane kyɛ, bɛ bɔ bɛse bia ne, bɛto bɛ nwo gua nzue nanu, na bɛbia bɛli moa bɛhɔ aseɛ naso dɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Na bɛ ngaa ne koso, ebiemɔ butu ndaboa nemɔ so, na ebiemɔ koso butu hyep nanu nningyein ne biemɔ so, ná bɛli bɛ si. Yeti, bɛ mukoraati bɛɛdwuli aseɛ naso asomdwie nu.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Mmerɛ bɔ yɛdwuli asomdwie nu ne, yɛnwuni kyɛ bɛfrɛ ɛberɛ Malta <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ne bokale yɛ paa, nzue bɔ né ɔtɔ ne ayirɛ bɔ ne ɔwɔ nu nati, bɛsɔle see bɛmane yɛ, na bɛlɛle yɛ mukoraati kama. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Nakoso mmerɛ bɔ Paul sesale eyein bie guale see nanu ne, see ne hyerɛ nati, ɛkyerebene bie fili nu fitele, na ɔbrɛbrale ye sa nwo. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Ɛberɛfoɛ ne nwuni kyɛ ɛwoo ne abrɛbra ye sa nwo ne, bɛkeka bɛhyirele bɛ nwo kyɛ: “Amba, biaa he te wudiniɛ paa. Ɔwɔ nu, wafi ɛpo nanu wafite, nakoso atɛn tenenee ngɔma ɔngɔtena ase.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Nakoso ɔpetele ɛwoo ne fili ye nwo sa guale see nanu, na hwee anyɛ ye. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Né bɛnea atee kyɛ, ebia ɔkɔ nwu-nwu anaa ɔkɔpɛ kofĩ kowu, nakoso bɛ nwondɛle mmerɛ-tende bɔ hwee anyɛ ye ne, bɛsesane b'adwene bɛhane kyɛ, ɔte nyameɛ.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Né aseɛ biemɔ wɔ mandanu berɛ, na ne ɔte odikuro bɔ ɔwɔ berɛ ne deɛ, ne bɛfrɛ ye Pablio. Sɔ biaa he lɛle yɛ kama, na ɔfale ɛlɛsa sone yɛ wɔfoɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Sãa né Pablio baba afokyɛ la mba so, né fiiva ahye ye, na né ye kunu koso tu. Yeti Paul hɔle ye nwo berɛ, ɔbɔle mbaeɛ mane ye, na ɔfale ye sa guale yeso maa ye nwo tɔle ye. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Ɛhe si ne, supɔ naso mmenia bɔ bafokyɛ namukoraati wale Paul berɛ, na ɔsale bɛ anwonyerɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Besa bɛhyɛle yɛ nningyein pee, na yɛkɔ ne, bɛfale bɔ yɛhia biala bɛguale hyep nanu maa yɛfa yɛhɔle.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Bosome nza si ne, yɛfole hyep bie bɔ ofi Alɛzandria yɛhɔle. Ayirɛ nati, né sɔ hyep ne agyina supɔ naso. Né bahworɔ ye nyunu “Zeus Mmaa.” <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Yɛdwuli Sirakusa ne, yɛlili ɛlɛsa wɔ berɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Na yɛfili berɛ ne, yɛwale Regio. Na kyẽa bɔ oli berɛ ne, mvrama bie tuli paa fili ngwan, yeti ɛlɛnyɔ so kora yeɛ yɛkɔ Puteoli ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Yɛnwuni aliemaa mɔ wɔ berɛ, na bɛsrɛle yɛ maa yɛtena berɛ ɛlɛsoo, na yesi ne, yɛsili nu yɛhɔle Roman. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Mmerɛ bɔ aliemaa mɔ bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ne tele yɛ nga ne, bɛpɛle atee bɛfili ɛdɔ alaa beeyiale yɛ wɔ Apia Dwaa naso, ɔne kuro bɔ bɛfrɛ berɛ Nzãa-Sua-Nza ne. Mmerɛ bɔ Paul nwuni bɛ ne, ɔlala Nyameɛ ase, na y'ahone tɔle ye kunu. <verse eid="ACT 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Afei mmerɛ bɔ yɛdwuli Roman ne, bɛmane Paul atee maa ye ngome ɔtenane, na sogyaniɛ kõ neane ye so.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Ɛlɛsa si ne, ɔfrɛle Yudafoɛ atitire ne. Bɛwale ne, ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nniema mɔ, ɔwɔ nu, nyɛlle nikye fee ndiale yɛ mmenia nemɔ, anaa yɛ nana mɔ amammerɛ, nakoso bɛfale me bɛwurale Romanfoɛ nemɔ sa kyɛ priziniɛ Yerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Ná bɛneɛneane me dwirɛ nu bɛyiele ne, né bɛpena kyɛ bɛye me, ofikyɛ nyɛlle hwee bɔ odikyɛ bɛku me ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Nakoso Yudafoɛ nemɔ ambene, yeti mvale me dwirɛ ne mmane Kaesare, ɛhe ngyire kyɛ, nne edwirɛ bɔ mefa mebɔ me maen ne kwaadu. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Ɛhe ati yeɛ mepena kyɛ menwu ɛmɔ, na mene ɛmɔ dwudwo ne, ofikyɛ anidasoɛ bɔ Israel lɛ ye nati yeɛ bafa kyenyi he bagua me sa ne.” <verse eid="ACT 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Bɛhane kyɛ: “Yɛnyanne wɔ nwo krataa biala yɛffili Yudea, ná aliemaa mɔ bɔ bɛfi dɔ bɛwale ne koso, bɛbɔlle yɛ amaneɛ anaa bɛhanne wɔ nwo dwirɛ tɛɛ biala koso bɛhyirele yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Nakoso né yɛnwu ye kyɛ, ɔte pa kyɛ yɛkotie bɔ ɛle ye ka ɔ, ofikyɛ yɛse ye paa kyɛ, kue he de, nekaa biala ɛkɔhɔ ne, mmenia ka ye nwo dwirɛ tɛɛ.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Yeti bɛhyɛle kyẽa bɔ bɛne ye koyia ne, na mmeni pee wale nekaa bɔ ɔte ne. Ná ofi ngyerɛmɔ bɔ ɔkwaadwu nnɔsoa ne, ohyirehyirele edwirɛ nanu hyirele bɛ, na olili Nyameɛ Ahennie nanwo adanzeɛ fekɔ-fekɔ, na ɔnate Mose Mmeraa ne Adiifoɛ nemɔ so hane Yesu nwo dwirɛ maa ɔtɔle bɛ so anu. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Ebiemɔ lɛle bɔ ɔka ne lili, na ebiemɔ koso anne anni. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Na ɔnate kyɛ ne b'adwene nyia nati, bɛhyɛle yebo kyɛ bɛkɔ, yeɛ Paul hane sɔ dwirɛ he ɔ: “Mmerɛ bɔ honhom krongron ne nate diifoɛ Isaiah so hane sɔ dwirɛ he hyirele ɛmɔ baba mɔ ne, né ɔte nahorɛ kaenn; ɔhane kyɛ:<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />‘Kɔ sɔ mmenia hemɔ berɛ, na ka kyire bɛ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">“Ɛtelɛ de ɛmɔ kɔte, nakoso ɛmɔngɔte yebo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">Ɛneanɛ de ɛmɔ kɔnea, nakoso ɛmɔ ngonwu ye.<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Ofikyɛ mmenia hemɔ ahone atiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">na bɛfa bɛ so betie ye mbaen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">na bakata bɛ nye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛngɔfa bɛ nye bɛngonwu ye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">ná bafa bɛ so bate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">ná bafa b'ahone bate yebo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">ná basakra b'adwene maa masa bɛ anwonyerɛ.”’<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Yeti, ɛmɔma ɔla ɛmɔ ti anu kyɛ, bafa sɔ ngoa bɔ ofi Nyameɛ berɛ ne bahɔ maen-maen nanu, na bedɛ, bɛkotie.” <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" /><note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛ ɛnea Bible biemɔ nu a, edwirɛ bie wura ɛwa kyɛ: </char><char style="bdit">“Ɔhane edwirɛ he nala pɛ, Yudafoɛ nemɔ fili berɛ hɔle, na ne bafɛ yaa paa.”</char> Nakoso sɔ dwirɛ ne, ɛnea asaanoa ndworɔyɛ bɔ wahyɛ paa ɔne bɔ odi mu paa nemɔ nu a, ɔnne nu.</note>—<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Paul bɔbɔ hayele sua wɔ berɛ tenane nu afoɛ nyɔ, na bɛ bɔ bɛwale berɛ kyɛ bɛbaasrale ye ne, olɛle bɛ kama. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Na ɔhane Nyameɛ Ahennie nanwo dwirɛ hyirele bɛ, na ɔfale akukuduro hyirehyirele bɛ Awurade Yesu Kristo nwo dwirɛ bɔ nikye fee anzi yɛ atee ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>